1
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,260
[Heejin: Jinwoo.]
[Jinwoo: Huh?]

2
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:13,530
[Heejin: You wrote yours pretty fast.]

3
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:16,730
[Jinwoo: Me? Yeah, I already knew
what I wanted to write.]

4
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:18,870
[Jinwoo: One specific moment stood out to me.]

5
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:22,600
[Heejin: Just one moment?]
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

6
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:26,880
[Jinwoo: There are a lot of dates
I'd like to relive.]

7
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:29,540
[Jinwoo: For example, the dates
where we had so much fun together.]

8
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:34,020
[Jinwoo: But the point of Rewind Date is to go back ]

9
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,420
[Exactly.]
[Jinwoo: and have that conversation again.]

10
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:40,760
[Jinwoo: At least, that's how I see it. So...]

11
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:43,690
[Jinwoo: I chose the moment
things started drifting apart.]

12
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:46,660
[Jinwoo: That's why I finished so fast.
What about you?]

13
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:51,970
[Heejin: I thought the same thing...]

14
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:56,940
[Heejin: If I had tried to talk to her]

15
00:00:56,940 --> 00:01:05,050
[Heejin: even just once,
I might have enjoyed my time here a lot more.]

16
00:01:05,050 --> 00:01:10,920
[Heejin: So I want to try talking to her...]

17
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:15,720
[Jinwoo: Yeah, I get what you mean.]

18
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:22,660
[Would things change
between us if we went back in time?]

19
00:01:23,730 --> 00:01:26,130
[Sujin: Did you really write it from the heart?]
[Seungho: Totally.]

20
00:01:26,130 --> 00:01:29,600
[Sujin: I really poured my heart into it.]

21
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,210
[Seungho: Yeah, I meant every word.]

22
00:01:31,210 --> 00:01:34,680
[Sujin: Do you have regrets, too?]
[Seungho: Yeah, I do.]

23
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:37,350
[Sujin: People really do repeat the same mistakes.]

24
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:39,750
[Seungho: Yeah. And I'll probably
make another one today.]

25
00:01:39,750 --> 00:01:42,950
[Hey! This...]

26
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:45,350
[Sujin: You really say whatever
pops into your head around me.]

27
00:01:45,350 --> 00:01:48,020
[Sujin: No, I won't let myself
repeat those mistakes today.]

28
00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:49,620
[Seungho: Yeah, me neither.]

29
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:52,289
[Sujin: Really?]
[Seungho: Honestly, I'm not even sure
if it was my fault.]

30
00:01:52,289 --> 00:01:53,630
[Sujin: Let's both avoid messing up today.]

31
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:57,100
[Can they go back
and avoid making the same mistakes?]

32
00:01:58,170 --> 00:02:02,170
[Heading back to Rewind Dates,
carrying their own regrets.]

33
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:10,610
[Hey.] [You're here?]

34
00:02:11,250 --> 00:02:14,300
[Eunchae stays silent]

35
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:20,420
[A quick glance]

36
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:25,930
[Silence hangs heavy in the lounge]

37
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:39,270
[Chaebe: Wait, so everyone gets a date?]
[Heejin: Yeah, no one can say no.]

38
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:37,380
-Right. -Yeah.

39
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:45,680
[Heejin: The morning after the Secret Room date,]

40
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:52,890
[Heejin: Eunchae started
acting cold toward me.]

41
00:02:52,890 --> 00:02:56,090
[Heejin: I noticed it a few times,]

42
00:02:57,690 --> 00:03:00,630
[Heejin: so I thought Eunchae must have]

43
00:03:00,630 --> 00:03:03,300
[Heejin: sensed something in the Secret Room.]

44
00:03:03,940 --> 00:03:05,540
Eunchae, you're leaving?

45
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:12,110
[Eunchae leaves for her date
without saying a word]

46
00:03:06,330 --> 00:03:07,850
-Bye. -See ya.

47
00:03:07,850 --> 00:03:08,800
Bye.

48
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,760
-Heading out with Hyeyeon? -Yep, I'm off.

49
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:12,180
Alright, have fun.

50
00:03:12,740 --> 00:03:13,610
Bye.

51
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:20,120
[What happened between those two?]

52
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:19,380
Get back safe.

53
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:25,450
[The First Rewind Date]

54
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,590
[Jinwoo: I wanted to pick the date]

55
00:03:31,590 --> 00:03:34,530
[Jinwoo: I regretted most.]

56
00:03:34,530 --> 00:03:38,800
[Jinwoo: So I chose that talk]

57
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:43,610
[Jinwoo: Seungho and I had on the bench.]

58
00:03:43,610 --> 00:03:46,540
[Jinwoo chose the moment he regretted most—
his conversation with Seungho.]

59
00:03:50,010 --> 00:03:51,610
[Seungho: Wait, what?
They said this was an interview.]

60
00:03:51,610 --> 00:03:53,210
[Sit here.]

61
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:57,750
[Seungho: What we said out there on the bench]

62
00:03:57,750 --> 00:04:01,220
[Seungho: fits this Rewind Date best.]

63
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:02,560
[Seungho: Considering how things went down,]

64
00:04:02,820 --> 00:04:05,760
[Seungho: Jinwoo was the first person I thought of.]

65
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:11,900
[They thought of the exact same moment]

66
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:21,779
[Remember what we said on the bench two nights ago?
I wanted to know if you meant what you said.]

67
00:04:21,779 --> 00:04:25,510
[I want to apologize for the things I said
while I was emotional]

68
00:04:25,510 --> 00:04:28,180
[ I want to go back and have a mature conversation]

69
00:04:31,650 --> 00:04:34,590
[Facing that conversation once again]

70
00:04:34,659 --> 00:04:36,340
[Jinwoo: Honestly,]

71
00:04:37,140 --> 00:04:40,340
[Jinwoo: I just wanted to check on you back then.]

72
00:04:41,260 --> 00:04:42,860
[Jinwoo: You looked upset.]

73
00:04:42,860 --> 00:04:46,070
[Seungho: Yeah, I was upset.]

74
00:04:46,070 --> 00:04:48,470
[Jinwoo: But were those the reasons you were upset,]

75
00:04:48,470 --> 00:04:51,140
[Jinwoo: the ones you told me before?]

76
00:04:51,940 --> 00:04:54,880
[Seungho: You remember them, right?]

77
00:04:55,940 --> 00:04:59,150
[Jinwoo: Me saying things like "Hey" or "you"
when addressing you,]

78
00:04:59,150 --> 00:05:03,690
[Jinwoo: and grabbing my phone back,
which I was only joking about.]

79
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:06,740
[Seungho: But after we talked that night,]

80
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:08,900
[Seungho: a whole lot more piled on.]

81
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:12,490
[Seungho: At first it was just those two things.]

82
00:05:12,780 --> 00:05:17,570
[Seungho: Suddenly it turned into five or six.]
[Jinwoo: Five or six? Things I did to hurt you?]

83
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:22,870
[Like what...]

84
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:30,460
[Seungho: Remember that mission earlier?
You called to tell me to come back.]

85
00:05:30,460 --> 00:05:32,590
[Seungho: We were supposed to stay out overnight.]

86
00:05:32,590 --> 00:05:33,930
[Seungho: I had no idea
what was going on before I went.]

87
00:05:33,930 --> 00:05:38,200
[Seungho: I was thinking, "What's happening?"
Then you called.]

88
00:05:39,270 --> 00:05:43,270
[Seungho: First of all, I panicked.]

89
00:05:43,270 --> 00:05:47,540
[Seungho: If it ended like this,]

90
00:05:47,540 --> 00:05:49,260
[Seungho: I'd feel really sorry toward Yongkyu.]

91
00:05:49,260 --> 00:05:51,180
[Seungho: So I said,]

92
00:05:51,180 --> 00:05:53,050
[Seungho: "Why do you call me?"]

93
00:05:53,310 --> 00:05:57,050
[Seungho: I swallowed my frustration
and came back to the house.]

94
00:05:57,590 --> 00:06:02,780
[Seungho: Then you said you felt conflicted,
which just confused me even more.]

95
00:06:03,190 --> 00:06:08,530
[He built up the courage to come back,
only to be crushed by Jinwoo's words]

96
00:06:09,780 --> 00:06:13,600
[Jinwoo: Honestly, people see things differently
in that situation.]

97
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,200
[Jinwoo: It really comes down
to a difference in mindset.]

98
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:19,740
[Jinwoo: If I were]

99
00:06:19,740 --> 00:06:21,610
[Jinwoo: in that situation,]

100
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:25,080
[Jinwoo: I would have appreciated it.]

101
00:06:25,610 --> 00:06:29,350
[Jinwoo: I would think,]

102
00:06:29,350 --> 00:06:31,220
[Jinwoo: "You really want to see me."]

103
00:06:31,490 --> 00:06:34,960
[Jinwoo: But you reacted by saying]

104
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:37,090
[Jinwoo: you wished you hadn't known]

105
00:06:37,090 --> 00:06:40,030
[Jinwoo: And you asked
why I put you in such a tough spot.]

106
00:06:40,030 --> 00:06:41,900
[Jinwoo: You even brought up Yongkyu.]

107
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:43,230
[Jinwoo: None of those things]

108
00:06:46,170 --> 00:06:48,300
["were about me."]

109
00:06:48,570 --> 00:06:50,710
[Jinwoo: I called you]

110
00:06:50,710 --> 00:06:53,640
[Jinwoo: because I missed you and wanted you back,]

111
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:54,440
[Jinwoo: but you didn't consider me
at all in your response.]

112
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:58,450
[Jinwoo: You only focused on yourself or Yongkyu.]

113
00:06:58,450 --> 00:07:00,320
[Jinwoo: You only cared
about how it affected the two of you.]

114
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:03,250
[Jinwoo: So that really hurt.]

115
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:08,590
[Jinwoo: If before that I was just a little annoyed]

116
00:07:08,590 --> 00:07:11,260
[Jinwoo: over minor petty stuff,]

117
00:07:11,260 --> 00:07:15,260
[Jinwoo: that phone call was the very first time]

118
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:18,470
[Jinwoo: I felt genuinely disappointed.]

119
00:07:18,470 --> 00:07:21,140
[Jinwoo: Given how things were, yeah.]

120
00:07:22,470 --> 00:07:24,870
[Jinwoo: So I told myself]

121
00:07:24,870 --> 00:07:29,140
[Jinwoo: as long as I didn't show my frustration,
it'd be fine.]

122
00:07:30,210 --> 00:07:33,680
[Jinwoo: I honestly thought I hid it well.]

123
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:38,490
[Jinwoo: But while we
were relaxing on the bed,]

124
00:07:39,020 --> 00:07:41,960
[Jinwoo: you were clearly upset.]

125
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:45,690
[Jinwoo: You completely gave me the cold shoulder.]

126
00:07:45,890 --> 00:07:47,460
[You were different back then.]

127
00:07:47,460 --> 00:07:48,380
[What?]
[You were different back then.]

128
00:07:48,380 --> 00:07:52,100
[Seungho: The Jinwoo I knew]

129
00:07:52,100 --> 00:07:55,570
[Seungho: and the Jinwoo I saw that day
were so different.]

130
00:07:55,570 --> 00:07:58,240
[Seungho: I kept sensing this cold distance
from you,]

131
00:07:58,240 --> 00:08:00,910
[Seungho: and I really hated that.]

132
00:08:01,710 --> 00:08:04,110
[Jinwoo: In my mind, I had already calmed down.]

133
00:08:04,110 --> 00:08:07,320
[Jinwoo: I thought I wasn't letting it show,]

134
00:08:07,580 --> 00:08:11,590
[Jinwoo: but if you felt it, then clearly]

135
00:08:11,590 --> 00:08:13,450
[Jinwoo: I made it obvious.]

136
00:08:14,790 --> 00:08:17,730
[Jinwoo: I apologize for that.]

137
00:08:17,730 --> 00:08:21,730
[Jinwoo: I hate letting my mood
dictate my attitude, too.]

138
00:08:21,730 --> 00:08:23,600
[Jinwoo: Since I acted that way,]

139
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:27,340
[Jinwoo: I want to apologize.]

140
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:31,610
[Jinwoo: What else? Was there anything else...]

141
00:08:31,610 --> 00:08:32,669
[Jinwoo: that disappointed you about me?]

142
00:08:33,210 --> 00:08:36,140
[Seungho: A lot more.]
[Jinwoo: A lot more?]

143
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:42,280
[Seungho: You even said your feelings cooled off.]

144
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:44,420
[Jinwoo: I didn't say that.]
[Seungho: You did.]

145
00:08:44,420 --> 00:08:46,820
[Seungho: You basically implied it.]

146
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:49,760
[Seungho: That's how you put it.]

147
00:08:50,020 --> 00:08:53,760
[Seungho: And then you brought up smoking.]

148
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:56,960
[Seungho: You said you could keep that promise]

149
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:59,630
[Seungho: when your feelings were strong,]

150
00:08:59,630 --> 00:09:00,970
[Seungho: but now you weren't so sure.]

151
00:09:00,970 --> 00:09:02,300
[Seungho: Right after saying
your feelings cooled down,]

152
00:09:02,300 --> 00:09:04,440
[Seungho: you said you felt stronger back then,]

153
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:06,840
[Seungho: but now...]

154
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,440
[Seungho: you aren't feeling it as much.]

155
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:11,910
[Seungho: So you didn't see
why you had to listen to me.]

156
00:09:11,910 --> 00:09:15,120
[Seungho: That's exactly how it sounded to me.]

157
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:17,250
[Seungho: And I really hated hearing that.]

158
00:09:17,250 --> 00:09:19,920
[Seungho: I didn't like it.]

159
00:09:21,260 --> 00:09:24,460
[Jinwoo: First off, I didn't mean
the smoking thing like that.]

160
00:09:24,990 --> 00:09:29,000
[Jinwoo: I think I said I wanted to cut back instead.]
[Seungho: Right.]

161
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,330
[Seungho: That is what you said.]

162
00:09:30,330 --> 00:09:33,420
[Seungho: When your feelings were strong,]

163
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:37,810
[Seungho: you made that promise,
but now you hesitated.]

164
00:09:37,810 --> 00:09:39,940
[Seungho: You said you didn't know
if you could fully quit,]

165
00:09:39,940 --> 00:09:43,680
[Seungho: so cutting back was better for now.]

166
00:09:45,010 --> 00:09:50,620
[Seungho: Bottom line is, you said,
"When my feelings were strong,"]

167
00:09:50,890 --> 00:09:53,290
[Seungho: meaning back when you liked me more,]

168
00:09:53,290 --> 00:09:56,490
[Seungho: you were willing to change for me.]

169
00:09:56,490 --> 00:10:01,030
[Seungho: But now, whether your feelings cooled
or you just don't like me as much,]

170
00:10:01,300 --> 00:10:02,900
[Seungho: you don't care to make an effort]

171
00:10:02,900 --> 00:10:07,700
[Seungho: for me anymore.]

172
00:10:07,970 --> 00:10:11,970
[Jinwoo: I had no idea you took it that way.]

173
00:10:11,970 --> 00:10:15,980
[Jinwoo: I spoke out of frustration in that moment.]

174
00:10:15,980 --> 00:10:18,380
[Jinwoo: When I said I needed to adjust,]

175
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:20,780
[Jinwoo: it wasn't because my feelings faded.]

176
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:24,250
[Jinwoo: Once we leave this place,]

177
00:10:24,250 --> 00:10:26,650
[Jinwoo: we'll still keep in touch and hang out.]

178
00:10:26,650 --> 00:10:29,590
[Jinwoo: If you saw me struggle to quit that time,]

179
00:10:29,590 --> 00:10:32,790
[Jinwoo: you would've been
even more disappointed in me.]

180
00:10:32,790 --> 00:10:36,800
[Jinwoo: You might have thought
I only said those things because I wanted us]

181
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:39,470
[Jinwoo: to become the final couple.]

182
00:10:39,470 --> 00:10:42,140
[Jinwoo: I was worried you'd think that.]

183
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,340
[Jinwoo: So...]

184
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:48,280
[Jinwoo: It wasn't about me liking you any less.]

185
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:52,810
[Jinwoo: After that phone call,
I realized my feelings for you were this strong,]

186
00:10:52,810 --> 00:10:57,350
[Jinwoo: but yours for me were way down here.]

187
00:10:57,350 --> 00:10:59,220
[Jinwoo: Like I just said,]

188
00:10:59,220 --> 00:11:01,890
[Jinwoo: what you said
showed zero consideration for me.]

189
00:11:01,890 --> 00:11:06,960
[Jinwoo: It made me question
if I should keep pushing a relationship]

190
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:12,570
[Jinwoo: where I'm the only one fully invested.]

191
00:11:12,570 --> 00:11:14,700
[Jinwoo: That's why my feelings wavered.]

192
00:11:14,700 --> 00:11:18,440
[Jinwoo: Was I doing the right thing]

193
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:21,110
[Jinwoo: by choosing you]

194
00:11:21,110 --> 00:11:23,510
[Jinwoo: and pursuing you so directly?]

195
00:11:23,510 --> 00:11:25,110
[Jinwoo: My feelings for you haven't changed.]

196
00:11:25,110 --> 00:11:26,980
[Jinwoo: I just felt like you barely cared about me.]

197
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:30,990
[Jinwoo: So I wondered
if going all-in was the right move.]

198
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:33,650
[Jinwoo: We talked it out.]

199
00:11:33,650 --> 00:11:36,860
[Jinwoo: I didn't mean those words back then.]

200
00:11:36,860 --> 00:11:42,200
[Jinwoo: I feel like I said the wrong things.
We just kept...]

201
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,930
[Jinwoo: It felt uncomfortable.]

202
00:11:46,270 --> 00:11:49,340
[The distance between them is not easy to bridge]

203
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:52,870
[Jinwoo: Is there anything else you want
to ask me besides that?

204
00:11:52,870 --> 00:11:55,280
[Seungho: I already voiced my frustrations.]

205
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:58,210
[Seungho: You keep coming back to the same points,]

206
00:11:58,210 --> 00:12:01,950
[Seungho: so I want
to ask if you have anything else to say.]

207
00:12:05,150 --> 00:12:08,890
[Jinwoo: Actually, there are a few things
I kept to myself.]

208
00:12:08,890 --> 00:12:12,890
[Jinwoo: But that's something
I was struggling with myself.]

209
00:12:12,890 --> 00:12:15,830
[Jinwoo: As I got to know you,]

210
00:12:15,830 --> 00:12:17,430
[Jinwoo: the more dates we had,]

211
00:12:17,430 --> 00:12:20,640
[Jinwoo: and the closer we got, the more I felt]

212
00:12:21,170 --> 00:12:24,110
[Jinwoo: like I was always the one adjusting to you.]

213
00:12:24,110 --> 00:12:26,240
[Jinwoo: I know you put in effort, too,]

214
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:30,510
[Jinwoo: and you cared about me.
I saw that, and I know it.]

215
00:12:30,780 --> 00:12:33,450
[Jinwoo: But it still felt like I was doing way more.]

216
00:12:33,450 --> 00:12:36,650
[Jinwoo: Starting with quitting smoking...]

217
00:12:36,650 --> 00:12:41,460
[Jinwoo: Even when I felt hurt,
I couldn't let it show.]

218
00:12:41,460 --> 00:12:44,390
[Jinwoo: No matter what you asked me,
after I answered,]

219
00:12:44,390 --> 00:12:46,790
[Jinwoo: you'd compare me to Hyeyeon,]

220
00:12:46,790 --> 00:12:52,130
[Jinwoo: saying she would have understood you.]

221
00:12:52,130 --> 00:12:55,340
[Jinwoo: Hearing that just made me]

222
00:12:56,140 --> 00:12:58,270
[Jinwoo: bottle things up even more.]

223
00:12:58,270 --> 00:13:02,010
[Jinwoo: About where I struggled,
what drained me...]

224
00:13:02,010 --> 00:13:03,610
[Jinwoo: I know you didn't mean to,]

225
00:13:03,610 --> 00:13:07,620
[Jinwoo: but it felt like
I was the only one struggling.]

226
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:10,550
[Jinwoo: Since it kept happening,]

227
00:13:10,550 --> 00:13:12,690
[Jinwoo: I thought if we kept going like this,]

228
00:13:12,690 --> 00:13:15,090
[Jinwoo: I'd be the only one]

229
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:19,360
[Jinwoo: getting hurt worse. That thought]

230
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:21,230
[Jinwoo: really ate away at me.]

231
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:27,370
[Jinwoo: Right when I felt like giving up,]

232
00:13:27,370 --> 00:13:29,500
[Jinwoo: Sujin came up to me]

233
00:13:30,300 --> 00:13:32,440
[Jinwoo: and said, "If you want to be with Seungho,]

234
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:35,380
[Jinwoo: you have to handle this.
That's what dating is.]

235
00:13:35,380 --> 00:13:39,110
[Jinwoo: Just like how he has]

236
00:13:39,110 --> 00:13:42,850
[Jinwoo: to put up with things]

237
00:13:42,850 --> 00:13:45,520
[Jinwoo: to be with you."]

238
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,920
[Jinwoo: Then I realized I was only thinking
about myself again.]

239
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:50,860
[Jinwoo: You must have had
your own frustrations, too.]

240
00:13:50,860 --> 00:13:52,190
[Jinwoo: I was only thinking about myself]

241
00:13:52,460 --> 00:13:54,600
[Jinwoo: and almost gave up
because I lost my confidence.]

242
00:13:57,800 --> 00:14:00,470
[Jinwoo finally opens up
about what he had kept hidden]

243
00:14:01,540 --> 00:14:03,400
[Seungho: You just said]

244
00:14:03,670 --> 00:14:07,140
[Seungho: I expect you to do so much for me]

245
00:14:07,140 --> 00:14:10,340
[Seungho: while I do nothing for you.]
[Fair point.]

246
00:14:10,340 --> 00:14:11,950
[Seungho: Same with the smoking issue.]

247
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:17,020
[Seungho: Up until now, I haven't clearly
committed to anyone, right?]

248
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:19,950
[Seungho: So I can't help acting this way.]

249
00:14:19,950 --> 00:14:23,960
[Seungho: A week is really short,]

250
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:27,700
[Seungho: and if you feel like
you're doing everything]

251
00:14:27,700 --> 00:14:31,170
[Seungho: while I'm doing nothing.]

252
00:14:31,170 --> 00:14:33,300
[Seungho: Does that mean]

253
00:14:34,900 --> 00:14:39,170
[Seungho: I have to feel just as strongly about you]

254
00:14:39,170 --> 00:14:42,110
[Seungho: before you'll actually change?]

255
00:14:42,110 --> 00:14:46,110
[Jinwoo: No, it's not that. I need
to try harder to understand you.]

256
00:14:47,180 --> 00:14:49,580
[Jinwoo: So... ]
[Seungho: But you aren't understanding me right now.]

257
00:14:49,580 --> 00:14:51,990
[Seungho: You said
that you're the only one putting in all this effort,]

258
00:14:51,990 --> 00:14:55,460
[Seungho: and that no matter
how hard you pursue me,]

259
00:14:55,460 --> 00:14:58,130
[Seungho: it feels pointless.]

260
00:14:58,130 --> 00:15:02,130
[Seungho: So maybe walking away is better.]

261
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,490
And walking away...

262
00:15:02,130 --> 00:15:04,800
[Seungho: I started having those thoughts too.]

263
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:09,600
[Seungho: "I have to meet your expectations.]

264
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:13,340
[Seungho: It felt like I was the only one
trying and putting in effort.]

265
00:15:13,340 --> 00:15:17,880
[Seungho: I didn't think there was a reason
for me to keep going all in like that."]

266
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:21,080
[Seungho: That's the feeling I've had from you all along.]

267
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,220
[Jinwoo: Oh... even now?]

268
00:15:23,220 --> 00:15:26,690
[Jinwoo: Even after I talked to Sujin,
built up the courage,]

269
00:15:26,690 --> 00:15:29,890
[Jinwoo: and told you I wanted to fix things?]

270
00:15:29,890 --> 00:15:31,490
[Seungho: Yeah.]

271
00:15:32,290 --> 00:15:35,500
[Jinwoo: I thought since I put in more effort,]

272
00:15:35,500 --> 00:15:42,440
[Jinwoo: you could just
match that effort. Right?]

273
00:15:42,700 --> 00:15:47,510
[Jinwoo: Because I never got a clear answer
from you.]

274
00:15:48,310 --> 00:15:50,180
[Seungho: I've been telling you this the whole time.]

275
00:15:50,180 --> 00:15:51,780
[Seungho: I just said it, too.]

276
00:15:51,780 --> 00:15:55,520
[Seungho: If it wasn't for all this,
I wouldn't even consider Hyeyeon.]

277
00:15:59,790 --> 00:16:04,860
[Seungho: I don't know how deep your feelings go,]

278
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:07,530
[Seungho: but you've been straight up
pursuing me, right?]

279
00:16:07,530 --> 00:16:09,400
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]
[Seungho: Right.]

280
00:16:09,660 --> 00:16:12,330
[Seungho: Well, when you just like someone,]

281
00:16:12,870 --> 00:16:17,670
[Seungho: you think, "I hope they make me happy."]

282
00:16:17,670 --> 00:16:22,480
[Seungho: When you love someone,
you think, "I want to make them happy."]

283
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:24,080
[Seungho: The feelings are deeper, you know?]

284
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:26,750
[Seungho: "Liking" and "loving"
are different.]

285
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:30,480
[Seungho: What I mean is, it feels like
your feelings aren't that deep yet.]

286
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:38,230
[Seungho: I feel like if you truly like me,]

287
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:44,900
[Seungho: you'd be willing
to do those things for me.]

288
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:49,170
[Jinwoo: If we want to keep working
through things outside,]

289
00:16:49,170 --> 00:16:51,840
[Jinwoo: we just need to keep going.]

290
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:56,110
[Jinwoo: If things already feel this uncertain]

291
00:16:56,110 --> 00:16:58,250
[Jinwoo: before we really get to know each other,]

292
00:16:58,250 --> 00:17:03,050
[Jinwoo: and you don't think we're a good fit,
then it just won't work.]

293
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:06,250
[Seungho: Even if it's a short period of time,]

294
00:17:06,250 --> 00:17:08,660
[Seungho: I really need certainty.]

295
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:11,859
[Seungho: Clear answers? Certainty?]

296
00:17:11,859 --> 00:17:13,990
[Seungho: I like things expressed clearly,
no matter what.]

297
00:17:13,990 --> 00:17:16,930
[Seungho: We have to pick
our final partner here soon.]

298
00:17:16,930 --> 00:17:18,270
[Seungho: Even if time is short,]

299
00:17:18,270 --> 00:17:21,470
[Seungho: if I don't feel certain before then,]

300
00:17:21,470 --> 00:17:23,869
[Seungho: I might just not choose anyone.]

301
00:17:24,670 --> 00:17:28,410
[Jinwoo: Seungho didn't apologize]

302
00:17:28,410 --> 00:17:30,280
[Jinwoo: for any of the things that hurt me.]

303
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:32,140
[Jinwoo: There's nothing I can do.]

304
00:17:32,140 --> 00:17:33,900
[Jinwoo: It really is out of my hands.]

305
00:17:33,900 --> 00:17:35,880
[Jinwoo: I said everything I could
to explain my side.]

306
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:37,480
[Jinwoo: Even if we kept dating,]

307
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:40,420
[Jinwoo: wouldn't we just end up
hurting each other more?]

308
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:44,430
[Seungho: I didn't get the answer I wanted.]

309
00:17:44,430 --> 00:17:49,500
[Seungho: "If it's for you,
I'll do whatever you want." ]

310
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:52,700
[Seungho: That's what I wanted to hear most.]

311
00:17:54,570 --> 00:17:58,840
[Even after clearing the air,
their differences remain unresolved]

312
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:04,710
[Can their relationship still turn around?]

313
00:18:06,780 --> 00:18:09,250
[Sujin: Were we sitting like this back then?]

314
00:18:10,050 --> 00:18:12,190
[Sujin: I think we sat like this
after the ring-making workshop.]

315
00:18:12,190 --> 00:18:14,590
[Sujin: Before it,
we sat in the opposite spots.]

316
00:18:12,430 --> 00:18:13,310
-Right. -Before it,

317
00:18:13,310 --> 00:18:14,910
we sat in the opposite spots.

318
00:18:15,510 --> 00:18:17,200
When you answered Yes or No,

319
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:19,390
[Heading back to the car two days ago,
on the way to the ring-making workshop]

320
00:18:18,290 --> 00:18:19,380
did you hesitate?

321
00:18:19,660 --> 00:18:22,330
[Sujin: I had to revisit this date]

322
00:18:22,330 --> 00:18:25,900
[Sujin: with Heejin.]

323
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:26,380
[I want to go back to that moment
in the car during our date.
I misread your feelings then and drove us apart.]

324
00:18:26,380 --> 00:18:28,380
[I hope it's not too late to go back, show you my curiosity, and reveal a whole new side of me. Sujin: I hope it's not too late.]

325
00:18:28,380 --> 00:18:31,140
[I want to show you how sincere I am.
Thanks for reading this note—Sujin]
[Sujin: I wanted to clear up]

326
00:18:31,140 --> 00:18:34,340
[Sujin: the misunderstanding between us.]

327
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:38,610
[Sujin is revisiting her date with Heejin]

328
00:18:38,970 --> 00:18:40,440
Because we didn't finish what we started.

329
00:18:40,210 --> 00:18:41,460
[Sujin: You didn't read my note, did you?]

330
00:18:41,460 --> 00:18:43,580
[Heejin: I did.]
[Sujin: Oh, really?]

331
00:18:43,580 --> 00:18:45,020
[Heejin: I read it, and...]
[Sujin: Ah, I'm kind of embarrassed...]

332
00:18:45,020 --> 00:18:46,220
[Heejin: I read it and found it so...]

333
00:18:46,220 --> 00:18:48,140
[Heejin: I couldn't stop smiling after reading it.]

334
00:18:48,140 --> 00:18:49,560
[Sujin: Why? Why? Why?]

335
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:52,230
[Heejin: Because your note was just so adorable.]

336
00:18:52,230 --> 00:18:56,230
[Heejin: You even drew cute little doodles on it.]

337
00:18:56,230 --> 00:18:58,630
[Sujin: I put my heart into it.]
[Heejin: When I read your note,]

338
00:18:58,630 --> 00:19:01,840
[Heejin: I thought, "Ah, so this is how she writes."]

339
00:19:02,370 --> 00:19:05,840
[Heejin: I actually expected her to choose me.]

340
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:07,710
[Heejin: On the outside of the note,]

341
00:19:07,710 --> 00:19:09,840
[Heejin: she wrote, "Sending my heart to Heejin."]

342
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:12,780
["Sending my heart to Heejin."]
[Heejin: and drew that adorable face?]

343
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:15,450
[Heejin: That made me smile.]

344
00:19:15,450 --> 00:19:21,060
[Heejin: It made me realize,]

345
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:24,530
[Heejin: "Wow, she really is serious about me."]

346
00:19:24,530 --> 00:19:26,390
[Heejin: I could feel how much she valued me.]

347
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:31,200
[Sujin: Oh... honestly, if I came on too strong,]

348
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:35,200
[Sujin: I worried it might feel overwhelming.]

349
00:19:31,310 --> 00:19:34,220
-It might feel overwhelming. -Yeah.

350
00:19:34,220 --> 00:19:35,240
Yeah.

351
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:37,870
[Sujin: So what I wrote inside]
[Heejin: You weren't being casual at all.]

352
00:19:37,870 --> 00:19:39,740
[Sujin: was pretty deep,]

353
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:42,940
[Sujin: but the outside had that cute,
playful vibe.]

354
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:46,950
[Heejin: First off, thank you so much
for writing to me.]

355
00:19:46,950 --> 00:19:48,820
[Heejin: I wanted to talk to you again, too.]

356
00:19:48,820 --> 00:19:53,420
[Heejin: I sent you an SBM Talk yesterday
saying we should chat when you have time.]

357
00:19:53,140 --> 00:19:53,460
Right.

358
00:19:53,430 --> 00:19:55,570
[Sujin: Honestly, if we just ended things like that,]

359
00:19:55,570 --> 00:19:57,440
[Sujin: went on separate dates the next day,]

360
00:19:57,440 --> 00:20:00,110
[Sujin: and I never pulled you aside to talk,]

361
00:20:00,110 --> 00:20:01,980
[Sujin: we would've never cleared things up.]

362
00:20:01,980 --> 00:20:02,780
[Heejin: Never, ever.]

363
00:20:02,780 --> 00:20:05,710
[Sujin: Yesterday, I was the one
who approached you first.]

364
00:20:05,860 --> 00:20:08,920
[Sujin: You know that wasn't easy for me, right?]

365
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:10,520
[Sujin: Opening up like that?]

366
00:20:10,780 --> 00:20:14,790
[Heejin: In that moment, I thought
you were so cool.]

367
00:20:11,840 --> 00:20:14,170
-Did I startle you? -I thought you were...

368
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:17,580
[Heejin: I was genuinely surprised.]

369
00:20:16,170 --> 00:20:16,910
Really?

370
00:20:16,910 --> 00:20:17,740
So,

371
00:20:17,580 --> 00:20:20,660
[Heejin: I felt so grateful that you spoke up first.]

372
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:23,600
[Heejin: I wanted to talk to you, too,]

373
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:27,600
[Heejin: and I was trying to figure out
when to bring it up.]

374
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:32,140
[Sujin: So what bugged me was
going back to what you said then.]

375
00:20:32,140 --> 00:20:34,270
[Sujin: When I heard you say,]

376
00:20:34,270 --> 00:20:37,210
[Sujin: "I like being taken care of,
but you don't seem like the type to do that."]

377
00:20:37,210 --> 00:20:39,350
[Sujin: That really hit me hard.]

378
00:20:40,410 --> 00:20:42,820
[Heejin: Aren't you the type
to take care of people, Sujin?]

379
00:20:42,820 --> 00:20:43,880
[Heejin: You aren't that type, right?]

380
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:47,620
[Sujin: What's that supposed to mean?]
[Heejin: You like being taken care of, right?]

381
00:20:50,290 --> 00:20:53,230
[Sujin: It felt like you already labeled me
in your head.]

382
00:20:53,230 --> 00:20:56,160
[Sujin: So I thought, "Ah, no matter what I do now,]

383
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:57,760
[Sujin: can anything even change?"]

384
00:20:57,790 --> 00:20:59,370
That's what went through my head.

385
00:20:59,370 --> 00:21:00,970
[Heejin: Ah, I see.]

386
00:21:00,970 --> 00:21:03,370
[Sujin: And during our date,]

387
00:21:03,370 --> 00:21:05,770
[Sujin: you made playful jokes
like you couldn't trust me.]

388
00:21:06,020 --> 00:21:07,080
Couldn't trust...

389
00:21:07,110 --> 00:21:08,710
[Heejin: Like I doubted you could do it?]

390
00:21:08,710 --> 00:21:10,840
[Sujin: But I had already heard
that comment earlier.]

391
00:21:10,840 --> 00:21:14,580
[Heejin: So it hit harder...]
[Sujin: Hearing "I don't think you can do it" again...]

392
00:21:14,970 --> 00:21:15,730
Really?

393
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:18,050
[Sujin: Wow, seriously...]

394
00:21:18,050 --> 00:21:21,520
[Sujin: I felt like... am I really that bad?]

395
00:21:21,230 --> 00:21:22,490
It really felt like...

396
00:21:23,660 --> 00:21:26,060
[Sujin: "She only came out on this date
because I picked her,]

397
00:21:26,060 --> 00:21:27,660
[Surprised]
[Sujin: not because she actually liked me."]

398
00:21:27,930 --> 00:21:29,530
[Heejin: That wasn't it at all.]

399
00:21:29,530 --> 00:21:33,530
[Heejin: I only realized how you felt later on.]

400
00:21:32,700 --> 00:21:33,700
Right, right.

401
00:21:33,750 --> 00:21:34,890
I thought,

402
00:21:34,870 --> 00:21:39,410
[Heejin: "Oh, she's actually really great.]

403
00:21:39,410 --> 00:21:41,010
[Heejin: I want to get to know her better.
I'm really curious about her.]

404
00:21:41,010 --> 00:21:43,410
[Heejin: I want to go on a date]

405
00:21:43,410 --> 00:21:46,080
[Heejin: with her tomorrow."]

406
00:21:46,350 --> 00:21:47,900
[Heejin: But...]

407
00:21:47,900 --> 00:21:54,300
[Heejin: during the date,
the side of you I hoped to see]

408
00:21:54,300 --> 00:21:55,640
[Heejin: didn't show up.]

409
00:21:57,770 --> 00:22:02,050
[Heejin: You were so different from what I imagined.]

410
00:22:02,050 --> 00:22:04,450
[Heejin: I started feeling really confused.]

411
00:22:04,450 --> 00:22:08,720
[Heejin: It was actually a pretty big shock for me.]

412
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:11,660
[Heejin: "Ah, what do I do now?"]
[Sujin: So you felt disappointed.]

413
00:22:11,660 --> 00:22:16,730
[Heejin: Exactly. I didn't know]

414
00:22:16,730 --> 00:22:19,130
[Heejin: how to move forward.]

415
00:22:20,460 --> 00:22:22,600
[Heejin: So I overthought everything.]

416
00:22:22,870 --> 00:22:27,670
[Sujin: Ah... you were hurting just like I was.]

417
00:22:27,940 --> 00:22:29,810
[Sujin: If I had known that, even if I was hurt,]

418
00:22:29,810 --> 00:22:34,340
[Sujin: I should have lightened the mood first]

419
00:22:34,340 --> 00:22:36,750
[Sujin: and tried having an honest talk]

420
00:22:36,750 --> 00:22:39,680
[Sujin: with her.]

421
00:22:39,950 --> 00:22:44,760
[Sujin: And I heard that comment way too early.]

422
00:22:43,570 --> 00:22:44,270
Really?

423
00:22:44,760 --> 00:22:48,230
[Heejin: Ah, right. It was right at the beginning.]
[Sujin: Yeah, hearing that right]

424
00:22:48,230 --> 00:22:53,030
[Sujin: at the start... ah...
Everything just fell apart.]

425
00:22:53,030 --> 00:22:55,170
[Sujin: I couldn't push forward...]

426
00:22:55,170 --> 00:22:58,370
[Sujin: "Ah... today just isn't going to work."]

427
00:22:58,370 --> 00:23:00,240
[Sujin: I definitely had high hopes, too.]

428
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:04,240
[Sujin: Before that, I kept asking you
to help me pick out clothes]

429
00:23:04,240 --> 00:23:07,180
[Sujin: and doing your makeup...]

430
00:23:07,180 --> 00:23:10,650
[Sujin: To me, all of that was my way
of showing I liked you.]

431
00:23:12,250 --> 00:23:18,120
[Sujin: So after that day,
I barely approached you at all.]

432
00:23:17,940 --> 00:23:21,320
-Right. -I thought it would make you feel pressured.

433
00:23:18,120 --> 00:23:22,130
[Sujin: I was worried I'd make you feel pressured.]

434
00:23:22,130 --> 00:23:23,190
[Sujin: That's why I kept my distance.]

435
00:23:23,660 --> 00:23:27,260
[Sujin: But later, I found out
I was your second choice.]

436
00:23:27,260 --> 00:23:28,700
[Heejin: Were you surprised?]
[Sujin: Oh, yes.]

437
00:23:28,700 --> 00:23:30,540
[Heejin: Ah, really?]
[Sujin: Seriously, I was so shocked.]

438
00:23:30,930 --> 00:23:34,670
[Sujin: I assumed I wasn't even on your radar.]

439
00:23:34,670 --> 00:23:37,610
[Heejin: Not at all. I wasn't thinking
about anyone else but you back then.]

440
00:23:38,140 --> 00:23:41,350
[Sujin: Because besides me,
you were having deep conversations]

441
00:23:41,350 --> 00:23:44,280
[Sujin: with someone else.]

442
00:23:41,430 --> 00:23:42,490
with someone else.

443
00:23:44,280 --> 00:23:48,290
[Sujin: And maybe your views on relationships
lined up better with theirs.]

444
00:23:48,290 --> 00:23:52,290
[Sujin: I didn't hear your conversation,
so I didn't know.]

445
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,760
[Heejin: We never really talked about]

446
00:23:55,760 --> 00:23:58,160
[Heejin: what we actually like about each other]

447
00:23:58,160 --> 00:24:02,430
[Heejin: or our hobbies.]
[Sujin: Right, exactly.]

448
00:24:02,430 --> 00:24:04,570
[Heejin: I did talk
about those things a lot with Eunchae.]

449
00:24:05,900 --> 00:24:12,040
[Heejin: But I thought you had already moved on.]

450
00:24:08,700 --> 00:24:12,010
-Right. -already moved on.

451
00:24:12,040 --> 00:24:17,910
[Heejin: And if someone doesn't like me,]

452
00:24:17,910 --> 00:24:21,120
[Heejin: pushing closer feels a bit...]
[Sujin: It's hard.]

453
00:24:21,120 --> 00:24:24,050
[Sujin: Nobody finds that easy.]
[Heejin: I just can't do it.]

454
00:24:24,050 --> 00:24:26,990
[Heejin: With my personality,
I really couldn't push it.]

455
00:24:26,990 --> 00:24:30,460
[Heejin: So I had to put those lingering feelings]

456
00:24:30,460 --> 00:24:34,200
[Heejin: behind me.]

457
00:24:34,200 --> 00:24:37,930
[Heejin: After that, I felt like...]

458
00:24:37,930 --> 00:24:41,140
[Heejin: I couldn't really see that bright,
cheerful side of you anymore, like I used to.]

459
00:24:41,140 --> 00:24:44,180
[Sujin: Right, because it seemed so clear to me.]

460
00:24:44,580 --> 00:24:46,480
[Sujin: Back then, I thought,]

461
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:50,480
[Sujin: "She drew a line and decided
I wasn't good enough,]

462
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:52,350
[Sujin: so why keep trying?"]

463
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:56,350
[Sujin: And over the next two days, somehow]

464
00:24:56,350 --> 00:25:00,890
[Sujin: we ended up drifting apart even more, right?]

465
00:25:00,890 --> 00:25:03,830
[Sujin: That's why I wrote in the note,]

466
00:25:03,830 --> 00:25:07,030
[Sujin: "I hope it's not too late."]

467
00:25:07,560 --> 00:25:11,030
[Sujin: Even if it's too late,
my feelings won't change.]

468
00:25:12,250 --> 00:25:13,070
Just...

469
00:25:14,240 --> 00:25:19,040
[Sujin: Does this put pressure on you?]
[Heejin: No, not at all. Absolutely not.]

470
00:25:17,870 --> 00:25:19,070
Not at all. Absolutely not.

471
00:25:19,040 --> 00:25:22,510
[Sujin: And, well... obviously...]

472
00:25:22,510 --> 00:25:25,450
[Sujin: How could I just erase my feelings
when we keep running into each other?]

473
00:25:25,450 --> 00:25:27,050
[Sujin: Of course I couldn't. It's impossible.]

474
00:25:27,050 --> 00:25:30,790
[Sujin: I just didn't show it in front of you.]

475
00:25:30,790 --> 00:25:33,460
[Sujin: I felt like it would put pressure on you.]

476
00:25:33,460 --> 00:25:35,860
[Sujin: And if I showed it in front of Eunchae,]

477
00:25:35,860 --> 00:25:37,990
[Sujin: it would make things even harder for you.]

478
00:25:38,530 --> 00:25:41,730
[Sujin: I thought you lost all interest in me,]

479
00:25:41,730 --> 00:25:44,670
[Sujin: so I deliberately kept acting like that.]

480
00:25:45,200 --> 00:25:47,070
[Heejin: That's why, like I said earlier,]

481
00:25:47,070 --> 00:25:50,010
[Heejin: I wanted to talk to you again]

482
00:25:50,010 --> 00:25:53,740
[Heejin: and hear what you're thinking now.]

483
00:25:54,280 --> 00:25:58,820
[Sujin: Then do you think today's conversation
might change your mind?]

484
00:25:58,820 --> 00:26:03,350
[Heejin: It will.]

485
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:03,900
-Because... -Just...

486
00:26:03,350 --> 00:26:07,360
[Heejin: It couldn't leave me unaffected.]

487
00:26:07,780 --> 00:26:10,290
[Sujin: I'm going to follow my heart now.]

488
00:26:10,290 --> 00:26:12,700
[Sujin: Even if you say you feel pressured,]

489
00:26:12,700 --> 00:26:16,170
[Sujin: I'm still going to show how I feel.
Pressure or not.]

490
00:26:16,430 --> 00:26:19,640
[Because I genuinely like you.]

491
00:26:18,420 --> 00:26:19,530
So I...

492
00:26:20,170 --> 00:26:23,370
[Heejin: I really saw]

493
00:26:23,370 --> 00:26:26,040
[Heejin: the Sujin before.]

494
00:26:26,040 --> 00:26:31,650
[Heejin: "Ah, right, this is the side
of her I liked." I felt that again.]

495
00:26:31,650 --> 00:26:36,190
[Sujin: I really plan to give this my all.]

496
00:26:36,190 --> 00:26:38,590
[Sujin: If someone asked me,
"Can you give it your all here?"]

497
00:26:38,590 --> 00:26:41,790
[Sujin: I'd say yes, I can.]

498
00:26:42,330 --> 00:26:46,860
[Heejin: Now I can really feel that...
you're sincere.]

499
00:26:46,860 --> 00:26:52,200
[Heejin: Now... because I can feel it,
right now I'm...]

500
00:26:47,050 --> 00:26:50,610
-Right now I'm... -Right.

501
00:26:51,600 --> 00:26:52,700
It's just that before...

502
00:26:52,200 --> 00:26:55,940
[Heejin: It really moved me.]

503
00:26:52,700 --> 00:26:53,720
It really moved me.

504
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:55,940
I just wasn't hovering around you before.

505
00:26:55,940 --> 00:26:58,880
[Heejin: You really moved me.]

506
00:26:59,100 --> 00:27:00,460
[Sobbing]

507
00:27:01,620 --> 00:27:03,150
[Heejin: I really had no idea.]

508
00:27:03,150 --> 00:27:05,280
[Sujin: I just wasn't hovering around you before.]

509
00:27:05,280 --> 00:27:07,950
[Heejin: Because when you're right in front of me,
it always...]

510
00:27:08,090 --> 00:27:08,560
