511
00:27:08,490 --> 00:27:12,760
[Tears well up after hearing her true feelings]

512
00:27:09,020 --> 00:27:10,420
It'll turn out like this.

513
00:27:10,670 --> 00:27:12,870
So I was just trying to keep my distance.

514
00:27:14,090 --> 00:27:17,830
[Heejin: Don't do that.
That would make me feel so sad.]

515
00:27:15,350 --> 00:27:15,960
So...

516
00:27:17,830 --> 00:27:24,500
[Sujin: That's why I did it.]
[Heejin: But through this talk, everything I felt...]

517
00:27:22,780 --> 00:27:23,680
