518
00:27:24,770 --> 00:27:26,640
[Heejin: I get it now.]

519
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:29,310
[Heejin: "Ah, so that's why you acted like that..."]

520
00:27:29,310 --> 00:27:31,440
[Heejin: I was so confused before.]

521
