523
00:27:37,380 --> 00:27:39,450
[Sujin: Why did that happen? ]
[Heejin: Yeah, like, "What's going on?"]

524
00:27:38,610 --> 00:27:39,680
What's going on?

525
00:27:39,450 --> 00:27:40,420
[Heejin: It really felt like that.]

526
00:27:40,420 --> 00:27:43,450
[Sujin: "What's going on?
Why is she acting like this all of a sudden?"]
[Heejin: "Why did it turn out like this?"]

527
00:27:42,150 --> 00:27:43,450
Why did it turn out like this?

528
00:27:43,450 --> 00:27:46,390
[Heejin: I wanted.]

529
00:27:46,390 --> 00:27:49,590
[Heejin: to pick you.]

530
00:27:49,590 --> 00:27:55,730
[Heejin: Then you turned into that, which was so...]

531
00:27:55,730 --> 00:27:58,130
[Heejin: so painful for me in that moment.]

532
00:27:57,730 --> 00:27:58,510
And then...

533
00:27:58,130 --> 00:28:00,270
[Heejin: "What do I do now?"]

534
00:28:00,270 --> 00:28:02,940
[Heejin: I didn't know who else I could turn to.]

535
00:28:03,210 --> 00:28:06,140
[Heejin: So I struggled with it for a long time.]

536
00:28:06,140 --> 00:28:08,280
[Heejin: I was so hurt.]

537
00:28:08,280 --> 00:28:09,610
[Heejin: Anyway, that's how it was.]

538
00:28:10,150 --> 00:28:14,150
[Sujin: But no matter how much my feelings
seemed to drop,]

539
00:28:14,150 --> 00:28:16,550
[Sujin: you were always my number one.]

540
00:28:16,550 --> 00:28:19,490
[Heejin: She looked straight
into my eyes when she said that.]

541
00:28:19,490 --> 00:28:23,490
[Heejin: Her eyes were shining so bright.]

542
00:28:23,490 --> 00:28:27,230
[Heejin: That confident vibe felt amazing.]

543
00:28:27,230 --> 00:28:29,370
[Heejin: It was so cool.]

544
00:28:30,480 --> 00:28:34,220
[Heejin: I could really feel your sincerity.]

545
00:28:34,220 --> 00:28:38,490
[Heejin: Right now... my heart feels...]

546
00:28:36,390 --> 00:28:38,440
Like this? Swaying back and forth?

547
00:28:40,630 --> 00:28:43,300
[Heejin: I really miss this side of you.]

548
00:28:44,100 --> 00:28:47,570
[Heejin: Tomorrow is the final choice.]

549
00:28:47,570 --> 00:28:50,500
[Heejin: Right now...]

550
00:28:50,500 --> 00:28:52,910
[Sujin: But what I want to say is...]

551
00:28:50,510 --> 00:28:53,050
-Think twice. -What I want to say is...

552
00:28:53,170 --> 00:28:56,380
[Sujin: Tomorrow, just choose
