557
00:29:12,520 --> 00:29:14,650
[Heejin: Honestly, right now...]

558
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:18,120
[Heejin: I really am leaning toward Sujin.]

559
00:29:18,120 --> 00:29:21,860
[Heejin: Because I've always been drawn]

560
00:29:21,860 --> 00:29:23,730
[Heejin: to personalities like hers.]

561
00:29:23,730 --> 00:29:28,000
[Heejin: The people who attracted me
in the past were just like her.]

562
00:29:29,600 --> 00:29:34,410
[Heejin: I'm so glad we could talk like this today...]
[Sujin: Talking really changes everything.]

563
00:29:34,410 --> 00:29:38,300
[Heejin: Talking really changes everything, seriously.]
[Sujin: Communication is key.]

564
00:29:38,300 --> 00:29:41,780
[Sujin: Even without this date,
I would have talked to you anyway.]

565
00:29:41,780 --> 00:29:43,920
[Sujin: Just like yesterday.]
[Heejin: Ah, right. Just like yesterday.]

566
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:46,320
[Heejin: But having this chance]

567
00:29:46,320 --> 00:29:50,590
[Heejin: to get to know you again feels so great.]

568
00:29:51,660 --> 00:29:55,930
[The rewind ends, rekindling old feelings]

569
00:30:00,470 --> 00:30:02,610
[Sujin is waiting for someone]

570
00:30:09,810 --> 00:30:16,220
[Eunchae: I want to go back
to when I first met Sujin.]

571
00:30:20,220 --> 00:30:23,430
[Sujin: This note feels longer than I expected.]

572
00:30:23,590 --> 00:30:25,020
["Sujin, I want to go back to when we first met."]

573
00:30:25,020 --> 00:30:27,380
[Sujin: "Sujin"]

574
00:30:28,500 --> 00:30:30,100
[Sujin: How cute.]

575
00:30:36,240 --> 00:30:37,310
[Sujin: Oh my gosh.]

576
00:30:38,580 --> 00:30:40,060
[Surprised.]

577
00:30:40,780 --> 00:30:43,980
[Eunchae: Hi.]
[Sujin: Hey!]

578
00:30:44,510 --> 00:30:47,180
[Sujin: I read your note.]
[Eunchae: You did?]

579
00:30:47,520 --> 00:30:48,150
Yeah.

580
00:30:48,250 --> 00:30:50,650
[Eunchae: Did you know I'd write to you?]

581
00:30:50,920 --> 00:30:54,660
[Sujin: No, not at all! I really didn't expect it.]

582
00:30:55,190 --> 00:30:58,930
[Sujin: Honestly, when we first met,
you seemed super awkward.]

583
00:30:58,300 --> 00:30:59,040
Yeah.

584
00:30:58,930 --> 00:31:04,000
[Sujin: So I assumed that was a bad memory for you.]

585
00:31:04,530 --> 00:31:10,670
[Eunchae: I felt really awkward back then
because it was our first time meeting.]

586
00:31:09,930 --> 00:31:10,580
Right.

587
00:31:10,670 --> 00:31:14,140
[Eunchae: So I felt a bit bad about it.]

588
00:31:14,140 --> 00:31:18,950
[Eunchae: That's not how I usually am all the time.]

589
00:31:18,950 --> 00:31:22,420
[Eunchae: We've gotten a lot closer lately, right?]
[Sujin: Yeah, yeah.]

590
00:31:22,420 --> 00:31:27,220
[Eunchae: So... in this comfortable state?]

591
00:31:28,020 --> 00:31:32,300
[Sujin: Now that we're closer?]
[Eunchae: Yeah, I thought that'd be so much better.]

592
00:31:32,300 --> 00:31:35,420
[Eunchae: So I didn't hesitate at all.]

593
00:31:35,420 --> 00:31:36,830
[Sujin: Seriously?]
[Eunchae: Yeah.]

594
00:31:37,220 --> 00:31:41,370
[Eunchae: Ah, I knew I had to write to you.]

595
00:31:42,580 --> 00:31:46,220
[Eunchae: Like I said, I felt a little regretful.]

596
00:31:46,220 --> 00:31:47,820
[Eunchae: How do you feel about it?]

597
00:31:47,820 --> 00:31:52,890
[Sujin: I thought Seungho was your second choice.]

598
00:31:52,890 --> 00:31:56,630
[Sujin: So I just assumed you wrote to him.]

599
00:31:56,630 --> 00:31:59,560
[Eunchae: Ah, today's note?]
[Sujin: Yeah.]

600
00:32:00,980 --> 00:32:02,580
[Eunchae: But...]

601
00:32:02,580 --> 00:32:03,640
[Sujin: What's up? What's wrong?]

602
00:32:03,640 --> 00:32:05,250
[Eunchae: No, no.]

603
00:32:05,250 --> 00:32:07,110
[Sujin: What? What isn't?]

604
00:32:05,300 --> 00:32:07,330
-What? What isn't? -Nothing.

605
00:32:07,520 --> 00:32:08,420
[Eunchae: That's not it.]

606
00:32:08,420 --> 00:32:10,820
[Sujin: Did I get your second choice wrong?]
[Eunchae: No, that's not it.]

607
00:32:12,500 --> 00:32:15,380
[Eunchae: Right now, I don't really...]

608
00:32:15,380 --> 00:32:16,420
[Sujin: Is the gap too big?]

609
00:32:16,740 --> 00:32:20,330
[Sujin: Between your first and second choices...]

610
00:32:20,330 --> 00:32:23,800
[Eunchae: Shouldn't you ask
if I even have one first?]

611
00:32:20,370 --> 00:32:22,020
-Shouldn't you ask -Oh, do you?

612
00:32:22,020 --> 00:32:23,670
if I even have one first?

613
00:32:23,800 --> 00:32:26,210
[Sujin: Ah, so do you? A second choice?]

614
00:32:26,210 --> 00:32:27,810
[Sujin: Anyone you're interested in?]

615
00:32:29,140 --> 00:32:34,210
[Sujin: Just a tiny bit? Like, 0.5%?]
[Eunchae: A tiny bit?]

616
00:32:35,820 --> 00:32:38,480
[Eunchae: Well... before I knew it,]

617
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:40,890
[Eunchae: I ended up in the Secret Room with someone.]

618
00:32:41,300 --> 00:32:43,560
[Sujin: That's great.]
[Eunchae: Yeah, it's a good sign.]

619
00:32:43,560 --> 00:32:44,890
[Eunchae: So for me...]

620
00:32:45,690 --> 00:32:48,360
[Eunchae: as for a second choice...]

621
00:32:48,360 --> 00:32:52,370
[Sujin: You don't have one?
[Eunchae: Yeah, I guess I don't.]

622
00:32:54,140 --> 00:32:55,820
