623
00:32:56,900 --> 00:32:58,770
[Sujin: How was yesterday?]

624
00:32:58,770 --> 00:33:00,640
[Eunchae: How was what?]

625
00:33:00,640 --> 00:33:04,380
[Sujin: How did the Secret Room go yesterday?]

626
00:33:04,380 --> 00:33:07,050
[Sujin: Ah, I heard about everyone else's dates,]

627
00:33:07,050 --> 00:33:08,650
[Sujin: except yours.]

628
00:33:08,650 --> 00:33:11,850
[Sujin: I have no idea what you two did.]
[Eunchae: Ah, yesterday? The Secret Room?]

629
00:33:13,990 --> 00:33:16,390
[Eunchae: Well, it was...]

630
00:33:17,190 --> 00:33:18,900
[Sujin: What? Was it a bit awkward?]

631
00:33:18,900 --> 00:33:21,100
[Sujin: Did... something happen?]

632
00:33:21,100 --> 00:33:24,310
[Eunchae: No, no. I'm just trying
to figure out how to put it into words.]

633
00:33:25,110 --> 00:33:26,710
[Sujin: Heejin said]

634
00:33:26,710 --> 00:33:30,180
[Sujin: that during her Secret Room date
with Eunchae,]

635
00:33:30,450 --> 00:33:35,520
[Sujin: she picked up on a strange, subtle vibe.]

636
00:33:37,120 --> 00:33:39,260
[Heejin: I had fun in the Secret Room.]

637
00:33:39,260 --> 00:33:41,660
[Heejin: But... yeah, I had fun...]

638
00:33:41,660 --> 00:33:45,130
[Heejin: Eunchae might have felt it too...]

639
00:33:45,130 --> 00:33:47,800
[Heejin: I just felt this subtle,
lingering awkwardness.]

640
00:33:48,060 --> 00:33:48,870
[Heejin: I can't put my finger on it,]

641
00:33:48,870 --> 00:33:51,270
[Heejin: but something felt off.]

642
00:33:51,270 --> 00:33:54,740
[Sujin: I wondered if Eunchae felt the same way.]

643
00:33:54,740 --> 00:33:58,210
[Sujin: If she did,
maybe I still have a shot.]

644
00:33:58,470 --> 00:34:03,280
[Sujin: So even though I felt a bit bad,
I decided to probe.]

645
00:34:03,810 --> 00:34:06,220
[Eunchae: It was just a bit...]

646
00:34:06,220 --> 00:34:11,820
[Sujin: It didn't live up to your expectations?]
[Eunchae: No, no, it's not like that.]

647
00:34:12,360 --> 00:34:16,889
[Eunchae: I just thought it felt weird
if our feelings didn't spark further.]

648
00:34:16,889 --> 00:34:19,830
[Sujin: Because the setup was so romantic?]
[Eunchae: Right, the vibe.]

649
00:34:19,830 --> 00:34:22,340
[Eunchae: Everything was set up so perfectly.]

650
00:34:22,820 --> 00:34:26,500
[Eunchae: That's why I looked forward to it.
I wanted to go there anyway.]

651
00:34:27,040 --> 00:34:32,380
[Sujin: Did it make your emotions stronger?]

652
00:34:32,380 --> 00:34:36,110
[Eunchae: Well... my feelings?]
[Sujin: Yeah.]

653
00:34:37,580 --> 00:34:42,520
[Eunchae: It seems like Heejin
gets two votes every day.]

654
00:34:42,520 --> 00:34:45,190
[Eunchae: In my opinion,]

655
00:34:45,190 --> 00:34:49,989
[Eunchae: one of those votes comes from Sujin.]

656
00:34:49,989 --> 00:34:53,199
[Eunchae: So I kept worrying about
