657
00:34:53,730 --> 00:34:58,800
[Eunchae knew Sujin likes Heejin]

658
00:34:54,800 --> 00:34:57,690
So going into the date,

659
00:35:00,670 --> 00:35:04,410
[Eunchae: I didn't feel like I fully knew her yet.]

660
00:35:04,410 --> 00:35:09,480
