664
00:35:21,220 --> 00:35:23,890
[Eunchae: We mostly just talked
about our tastes and hobbies.]

665
00:35:23,890 --> 00:35:27,630
[Eunchae: Later, when we chatted in the Secret Room,]

666
00:35:27,630 --> 00:35:32,700
[Eunchae: we talked about relationship styles,]

667
00:35:32,700 --> 00:35:38,570
[Eunchae: what we value, and our core values.]

668
00:35:38,570 --> 00:35:43,380
[Sujin: You connected well... ]
[Eunchae: We really resonated with each other...]

669
00:35:44,180 --> 00:35:45,860
["I started catching feelings, too."]

670
00:35:47,020 --> 00:35:48,450
[Eunchae: You look pretty happy about that.]

671
00:35:50,050 --> 00:35:52,190
[Sujin: No, I'm not that happy.]

672
00:35:52,460 --> 00:35:55,120
[Sujin: I see...]

673
00:35:55,120 --> 00:35:56,460
[Sujin: Guess I need to keep a close eye on this.]

674
00:35:56,460 --> 00:35:59,930
[Eunchae: Ah, alright.]
[Sujin: Ah, I'm just kidding.]

675
00:35:59,930 --> 00:36:01,000
[Sujin: Just kidding.]

676
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:03,670
[Eunchae: Ah, I'd love it
if you rooted for me.]

677
00:36:04,470 --> 00:36:08,740
[Eunchae: Because I feel this genuine sense
of certainty]

678
00:36:08,740 --> 00:36:11,940
[Eunchae: holding me up.]

679
00:36:12,740 --> 00:36:16,480
[Eunchae: So I don't really feel anxious or worried.]

680
00:36:17,010 --> 00:36:22,350
[Where will their hearts lead them
as they both chase the same person?]

681
00:36:25,820 --> 00:36:29,030
[Sujin: Did you go on your date?]
[Chaebe: I was sleeping right here.]

682
00:36:28,590 --> 00:36:29,330
Why?

683
00:36:29,560 --> 00:36:31,430
[Chaebe: Not a single person asked me out.]

684
00:36:31,430 --> 00:36:38,100
[Sujin: Didn't you go on a date?]
[Chaebe: Not yet. Did you go?]

685
00:36:31,650 --> 00:36:33,530
-Didn't you go on a date? -Yeah.

686
00:36:36,230 --> 00:36:37,430
You haven't gone yet?

687
00:36:38,100 --> 00:36:43,170
[Sujin: I went. I used mine on Heejin.]

688
00:36:39,970 --> 00:36:42,460
Ah, Heejin.

689
00:36:43,170 --> 00:36:48,240
[Sujin: We had a misunderstanding,
so I cleared it up while I had the chance.]
[Chaebe: Uh, really?]

690
00:36:48,240 --> 00:36:51,180
[Chaebe: Everyone has so many misunderstandings.]
[Sujin: Eunchae might not end up with a couple.]

691
00:36:51,180 --> 00:36:53,580
[Chaebe: Why?]
[Sujin: Because I might be the one.]

692
00:36:53,580 --> 00:36:58,120
[Chaebe: Huh? With Heejin?]
[Sujin: Who knows?]

693
00:36:58,120 --> 00:37:02,390
[Chaebe: What happened?]
[Sujin: It's a long story. Watch the show later.]

694
00:37:02,390 --> 00:37:04,790
[Chaebe: Watch the show...]
[Sujin: What about you?]

695
00:37:04,790 --> 00:37:07,460
[Sujin: Did you use yours on Yongkyu?]
[Chaebe: Yeah.]

696
00:37:07,460 --> 00:37:10,930
[Chaebe: But, well...]
[Sujin: Did Yongkyu use his on Seungho?]

697
00:37:10,930 --> 00:37:13,070
[Chaebe: He wrote someone else's name.]
[Sujin: Or Hyeyeon.]

698
00:37:13,070 --> 00:37:15,200
[Chaebe: It's one of the two.]
[Sujin: Yeah, it's definitely one of those two.]

699
00:37:15,200 --> 00:37:18,670
[Sujin: My money is on Hyeyeon.]
[Chaebe: Why?]

700
00:37:19,210 --> 00:37:21,340
[Sujin: Just a hunch.]

701
00:37:45,640 --> 00:37:49,910
[Hey, Yongkyu!
We already spent so much time together,
so I didn't know which moment to pick.
But if I had to choose, I'd go back to
when we walked on the beach together!]

702
00:37:50,710 --> 00:37:54,980
[Yongkyu: I wonder if he enjoyed]

703
00:37:55,100 --> 00:37:59,520
[Yongkyu: that date or if regretted it.]

704
00:38:11,420 --> 00:38:13,930
[Chaebe: Hey, Yongkyu.]
[Yongkyu: What? What's going on?]

705
00:38:14,460 --> 00:38:17,130
[Chaebe: Hey.]
[Yongkyu. I read your note.]

706
00:38:17,130 --> 00:38:19,270
[Chaebe: So, how do you feel?]

707
00:38:19,540 --> 00:38:20,340
[Chaebe: Any thoughts?]

708
00:38:19,590 --> 00:38:20,770
-Any thoughts? -Thoughts?

709
00:38:20,340 --> 00:38:21,940
[Yongkyu: Thoughts?]
[Chaebe: Yeah.]

710
00:38:21,940 --> 00:38:23,270
[Yongkyu: Well...]

711
00:38:24,070 --> 00:38:26,210
[Yongkyu: Thankful?]
[Chaebe: Thankful?]

712
00:38:26,210 --> 00:38:27,810
[Chaebe: That's it?]

713
00:38:27,810 --> 00:38:31,810
[Yongkyu: Uh... yeah?]

714
00:38:35,020 --> 00:38:36,090
[Chaebe: Sit?]

715
00:38:36,090 --> 00:38:38,220
[Yongkyu: Go ahead.]

716
00:38:38,330 --> 00:38:39,460
Of course we can sit.

717
00:38:39,820 --> 00:38:45,700
[Sitting together on the beach,
just like on their first date]

718
00:38:46,500 --> 00:38:49,970
[Chaebe: Back then,]

719
00:38:52,640 --> 00:38:54,500
[Chaebe: we didn't really know each other.]

720
00:38:55,040 --> 00:38:55,840
[Yongkyu: What didn't we know?]

721
00:38:55,840 --> 00:38:56,910
[Chaebe: Just, you know, about each other.]

722
00:38:56,910 --> 00:38:58,510
[Yongkyu: Ah, right, right.]

723
00:38:58,510 --> 00:39:00,110
[Chaebe: We didn't know about each other.]

724
00:39:00,910 --> 00:39:03,580
[Chaebe: I just wanted]

725
00:39:03,580 --> 00:39:08,920
[Chaebe: another chance to talk with you.]

726
00:39:09,720 --> 00:39:11,050
[Chaebe: Right here.]

727
00:39:11,050 --> 00:39:13,460
[Yongkyu: Right here?]
[Chaebe: Yeah.]

728
00:39:15,590 --> 00:39:17,730
[Yongkyu: How do you think things will go tomorrow?]

729
00:39:17,730 --> 00:39:19,860
[Chaebe: Tomorrow?]
[Yongkyu: The final day.]

730
00:39:19,860 --> 00:39:21,460
[Chaebe: I think I'll have some regrets.]

731
00:39:21,460 --> 00:39:25,200
[Chaebe: When I first got here,]

732
00:39:25,200 --> 00:39:27,070
[Chaebe: everything felt so unfamiliar.]

733
00:39:28,140 --> 00:39:32,680
[Chaebe: I wondered
if I could handle these seven days,]

734
00:39:33,210 --> 00:39:37,750
[Chaebe: and now tomorrow is already the last day.]

735
00:39:37,750 --> 00:39:38,810
[Chaebe: What about you?]

736
00:39:41,480 --> 00:39:43,890
[Yongkyu: Time really flew by.]

737
00:39:43,890 --> 00:39:46,820
[Yongkyu: Honestly, I wondered,]

738
00:39:47,620 --> 00:39:51,890
[Yongkyu: "Is love at first sight real?"]

739
00:39:51,890 --> 00:39:54,300
[Yongkyu: I used to think it wasn't.]

740
00:39:54,300 --> 00:39:57,770
[Yongkyu: But after coming here]

741
00:39:57,770 --> 00:39:59,900
[Yongkyu: and living together day in, day out,]

742
00:40:00,970 --> 00:40:04,170
[Yongkyu: I realized it actually is possible.]

743
00:40:04,440 --> 00:40:06,310
[Yongkyu: It's pretty interesting.]

744
00:40:06,310 --> 00:40:10,850
[Chaebe: So who's your top pick right now?]

745
00:40:11,380 --> 00:40:12,980
[Yongkyu: Hyeyeon.]

746
00:40:12,980 --> 00:40:15,920
[Chaebe: Hyeyeon? Any particular reason?]

747
00:40:16,720 --> 00:40:22,330
[Yongkyu: During my date with her yesterday,]

748
00:40:22,860 --> 00:40:26,060
[Yongkyu: I felt like we talked a lot.]

749
00:40:26,060 --> 00:40:27,400
[Yongkyu: We shared things
we didn't know about each other]

750
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:30,600
[Yongkyu: and stuff we couldn't bring up
in front of the group.]

751
00:40:31,130 --> 00:40:34,070
[Yongkyu: It felt like we clicked really well.]

752
00:40:34,070 --> 00:40:36,210
[Yongkyu: Plus, she has a great personality.]

753
00:40:37,010 --> 00:40:40,210
[Yongkyu: I was not trying
to draw a line on purpose,]

754
00:40:40,210 --> 00:40:43,680
[Yongkyu: but long story short,]

755
00:40:43,680 --> 00:40:46,350
[Yongkyu: I just told him
how I honestly felt.]

756
00:40:46,880 --> 00:40:51,950
[Chaebe: So far, I'm not in your top two, am I?]

757
00:40:52,490 --> 00:40:54,620
[Yongkyu: Uh...]

758
00:40:56,760 --> 00:40:58,890
[Yongkyu: Honestly, you're right.]

759
00:40:59,740 --> 00:41:03,220
[Bitter smile]

760
00:41:03,970 --> 00:41:10,910
[Yongkyu: People couldn't have
had zero interest in you.]

761
00:41:10,910 --> 00:41:13,040
[Yongkyu: It can't be zero, right?]
[Chaebe: Then where do I rank?]

762
00:41:13,580 --> 00:41:15,980
[Yongkyu: Do we really have to rank everyone?]

763
00:41:14,980 --> 00:41:15,660
Yes.

764
00:41:15,980 --> 00:41:17,850
[Chaebe: Since you already
have a first and second choice.]

765
00:41:17,850 --> 00:41:21,580
[Yongkyu: I didn't really rank anyone after that.]

766
00:41:21,880 --> 00:41:24,790
[Awkward] [Ah, I see.]

767
00:41:24,220 --> 00:41:25,010
What's wrong?

768
00:41:24,790 --> 00:41:28,790
[Chaebe: I didn't even make the list.]

769
00:41:28,790 --> 00:41:30,660
[Yongkyu: It's not that I left you off...]

770
00:41:30,660 --> 00:41:33,330
[Chaebe: Wow. Six days...]

771
00:41:33,860 --> 00:41:36,530
[Chaebe: I thought I tried my best,]

772
00:41:36,530 --> 00:41:39,200
[Chaebe: but it still wasn't enough...]

773
00:41:40,900 --> 00:41:42,410
[That hurts a little.]

774
00:41:42,410 --> 00:41:45,070
[Yongkyu: But honestly, right now,]

775
00:41:45,340 --> 00:41:48,810
[Yongkyu: I just have stronger feelings]

776
00:41:48,810 --> 00:41:52,010
[Yongkyu: for someone else.]

777
00:41:52,550 --> 00:41:54,950
[Yongkyu: There's only one room...]

778
00:41:54,950 --> 00:41:57,350
[Yongkyu: I can't help it.]

779
00:41:59,220 --> 00:42:01,360
[Ah, I see...]

780
00:42:01,690 --> 00:42:02,620
Fair enough.

781
00:42:04,030 --> 00:42:05,630
[Chaebe: After all, we're roommates.]

782
00:42:05,630 --> 00:42:08,830
[Chaebe: I feel like we got a lot closer,]

783
00:42:08,830 --> 00:42:10,970
[Chaebe: and I really like that.]

784
00:42:11,500 --> 00:42:13,900
[Yongkyu: But here's how I see it, honestly.]

785
00:42:13,900 --> 00:42:16,840
[Yongkyu: It's impossible
to have zero feelings for you.]

786
00:42:16,840 --> 00:42:19,510
[Yongkyu: We share a room,
and we go on dates like this.]

787
00:42:20,040 --> 00:42:22,440
[Yongkyu: You never know
if feelings will grow or fade.]

788
00:42:22,440 --> 00:42:24,850
[Yongkyu: If I kept giving you hope like that]

789
00:42:25,110 --> 00:42:27,520
[Yongkyu: and leading you on,]

790
00:42:27,520 --> 00:42:29,390
[Yongkyu: I'm worried it would exhaust you.]

791
00:42:29,650 --> 00:42:30,720
[Chaebe: Not at all.]

792
00:42:30,720 --> 00:42:32,320
[Yongkyu: Ah, not at all? You're okay with it?]
[Chaebe: Yeah.]

793
00:42:32,320 --> 00:42:33,920
[Yongkyu: So can I just take the lead?]

794
00:42:33,920 --> 00:42:36,590
[Chaebe: Yeah, I'd love that.]

795
00:42:36,590 --> 00:42:39,530
[I do take care of you.]
[Take care of me more.]

796
00:42:39,530 --> 00:42:41,130
[I do take care of you!]
[Ah, what are you talking about?]

797
00:42:41,400 --> 00:42:43,800
[Yongkyu: You make it sound like
I don't look after you at all.]

798
00:42:43,800 --> 00:42:47,800
[Chaebe: But compared to others,
you don't pay as much attention to me.]

799
00:42:48,070 --> 00:42:50,470
[Yongkyu: Because in our room,]

800
00:42:50,470 --> 00:42:52,880
[Yongkyu: we get way more chances to talk.]

801
00:42:52,880 --> 00:42:56,610
[Yongkyu: We spend more time together,
but with others...]
[Chaebe: Still, I felt hurt.]

802
00:42:57,150 --> 00:42:59,820
[Chaebe: You know I like you,]

803
00:42:59,820 --> 00:43:03,550
[Chaebe: so seeing that makes me sad.]

804
00:42:59,900 --> 00:43:00,880
I know.

805
00:43:03,820 --> 00:43:07,020
[Yongkyu: That's why I tried to be extra careful.]

806
00:43:08,620 --> 00:43:10,760
[Yongkyu: Because every little thing I do]

807
00:43:10,760 --> 00:43:13,160
[Yongkyu: might get read as something deeper.]

808
00:43:14,760 --> 00:43:19,300
[Chaebe: I see... You handled it well.]

809
00:43:20,370 --> 00:43:22,770
[Yongkyu: Thanks for the note.]

810
00:43:22,770 --> 00:43:24,640
[Chaebe: You better treasure it.]

811
00:43:24,910 --> 00:43:27,580
[Chaebe: You're not gonna throw it away
when we go back, right?]

812
00:43:27,580 --> 00:43:32,540
[Yongkyu: Uh, where did I put it again?]
[Chaebe: I'm definitely checking up
on this after the show.]

813
00:43:33,260 --> 00:43:38,220
[Chaebe: Snap a picture and post it on Instagram.
Got it?]

814
00:43:38,500 --> 00:43:41,420
[Hurt]

815
00:43:41,720 --> 00:43:46,000
[Chaebe: Since I pretty much know how he feels now,]

816
00:43:46,000 --> 00:43:47,860
[Chaebe: nothing I do at this point]

817
00:43:47,860 --> 00:43:52,130
[Chaebe: will change a thing.]

818
00:43:52,940 --> 00:43:55,870
[Chaebe: I feel a bit bummed,]

819
00:43:55,870 --> 00:43:59,340
[Chaebe: but I have no regrets.]

820
00:44:00,140 --> 00:44:05,480
[Chaebe's feelings for Yongkyu
remain out of reach in the end]

821
00:44:09,490 --> 00:44:13,760
[A beach where you can see the yellow lighthouse]

822
00:44:18,830 --> 00:44:25,500
[Hyeyeon is waiting for someone]

823
00:44:25,770 --> 00:44:28,170
[Hyeyeon: I opened the note
and saw it was from Heejin.]

824
00:44:28,970 --> 00:44:31,370
[Kim Hyeyeon, if I hadn't avoided
talking to you after the workshop date,]
[Hyeyeon: After the workshop date with Sujin,]

825
00:44:31,370 --> 00:44:33,780
[and tried telling you how I really felt]
[Hyeyeon: if I hadn't avoided talking to you,]

826
00:44:33,780 --> 00:44:37,250
[would things be any different between us—Jung Heejin]
[Hyeyeon: would things be different between us?]

827
00:44:37,250 --> 00:44:39,920
[Hyeyeon: My heart sank,
and my thoughts started racing.]

828
00:44:39,920 --> 00:44:41,780
[Hyeyeon: Because honestly, among the girls,]

829
00:44:41,780 --> 00:44:46,590
[Hyeyeon: Heejin is still the closest
to my ideal type, looks-wise.]

830
00:44:46,590 --> 00:44:49,530
[Hyeyeon: So back then, I completely fell for her.]

831
00:44:49,530 --> 00:44:51,930
[Hyeyeon: Without thinking twice
or caring about others,]

832
00:44:51,930 --> 00:44:55,130
[Hyeyeon: I went all-in on Heejin.]

833
00:44:55,130 --> 00:44:59,670
[Hyeyeon: Honestly, the reason
she slipped down my list]

834
00:44:59,670 --> 00:45:02,070
[Hyeyeon: was because she felt so mature,]

835
00:45:02,070 --> 00:45:05,010
[Hyeyeon: while Sujin felt cute
and a little playful.]

836
00:45:05,010 --> 00:45:07,410
[Hyeyeon: So Sujin became my second pick.]

837
00:45:07,410 --> 00:45:09,510
[Kim Hyeyeon, if I hadn't avoided talking
to you after the workshop date,]
[Hyeyeon: "If I had talked to you back then,]

838
00:45:09,510 --> 00:45:11,680
[and tried telling you how I really felt]
[Hyeyeon: would things
have turned out differently?" Reading that,]

839
00:45:11,680 --> 00:45:13,280
[would things be any different between us—Jung Heejin]
[Hyeyeon: my mind was all over the place.]

840
00:45:14,620 --> 00:45:17,820
[Approaching]

841
00:45:17,820 --> 00:45:19,420
[Heejin walking over from afar]

842
00:45:19,690 --> 00:45:21,560
[Heejin: My real feelings for her?]

843
00:45:21,560 --> 00:45:24,490
[Heejin: Did we feel the same way back then,]

844
00:45:24,490 --> 00:45:28,500
[Heejin: or was it just all in my head?
I wanted to find out.]

845
00:45:42,380 --> 00:45:43,450
[Heejin: Have you been waiting long?]

846
00:45:43,450 --> 00:45:45,050
[Hyeyeon: Not too long.]

847
00:45:45,310 --> 00:45:48,250
[Heejin: Surprised? Did you expect me to pick you?]

848
00:45:48,250 --> 00:45:49,850
[Hyeyeon: Not at all.]
[Heejin: Really? You didn't expect it?]

849
00:45:49,850 --> 00:45:53,860
[Hyeyeon: Yeah, I thought it was not gonna happen.]
[Heejin: Really?]

850
00:45:53,860 --> 00:45:57,060
[Hyeyeon: I didn't think anyone
was holding onto feelings for me.]

851
00:45:57,060 --> 00:45:59,460
[Heejin: How could that be?]

852
00:45:59,460 --> 00:46:01,060
[Heejin: I mean, right now...]

853
00:46:01,060 --> 00:46:05,140
[Heejin: it's the day
before the final choice, right?]

854
00:46:05,140 --> 00:46:08,340
[Heejin:  So before everything ends,
I had to talk to you.]

855
00:46:08,340 --> 00:46:10,740
[Heejin: Once I got the chance,
I asked for this date.]

856
00:46:10,740 --> 00:46:14,480
[Heejin: Don't feel pressured at all.
Just speak honestly.]

857
00:46:14,480 --> 00:46:17,150
[Heejin: It'd be great if we could talk
about the things we never got to say.]

858
00:46:17,150 --> 00:46:23,020
[Hyeyeon: It's not like I never cared about you.]

859
00:46:23,020 --> 00:46:25,160
[Heejin: Thanks for saying that.]

860
00:46:26,760 --> 00:46:32,100
[Heejin: It took a lot of courage
for you to say that to me.]

861
00:46:32,100 --> 00:46:34,770
[Hyeyeon: Yeah, it definitely took courage...]

862
00:46:34,770 --> 00:46:39,040
[Heejin: Hearing you open up
like that]

863
00:46:39,040 --> 00:46:40,640
[Heejin: makes me feel really grateful.]
[Hyeyeon: Oh, really?]

864
00:46:40,640 --> 00:46:43,040
[Hyeyeon: Then let's keep it comfortable...]

865
00:46:43,040 --> 00:46:44,910
[Heejin: Got it.]

866
00:46:43,650 --> 00:46:44,470
Yeah.

867
00:46:44,910 --> 00:46:49,450
[Heejin: When we first met,]

868
00:46:49,450 --> 00:46:54,520
[Heejin: we moved faster than everyone else.]

869
00:46:53,900 --> 00:46:54,230
Yeah.

870
00:46:54,520 --> 00:46:57,990
[Heejin: We were both pretty proactive.]
[Hyeyeon: Yeah.]

871
00:46:57,990 --> 00:47:02,260
[Hyeyeon: I was serious when I came on
that strong at the beginning.]

872
00:47:04,660 --> 00:47:06,270
[Heejin: Ah, really?]

873
00:47:05,260 --> 00:47:05,950
Yeah.

874
00:47:06,270 --> 00:47:08,400
[Hyeyeon: Ah, was I coming on too strong?
Go ahead, keep talking.]

875
00:47:08,400 --> 00:47:09,820
[Heejin: But everything]

876
00:47:09,820 --> 00:47:12,670
[Heejin: I said to you,]

877
00:47:12,670 --> 00:47:14,270
[Heejin: and everything I felt before,]

878
00:47:14,810 --> 00:47:16,410
[Heejin: was genuine.]

879
00:47:16,410 --> 00:47:21,210
[Heejin: I tried hard to stay focused
and give it my all.]

880
00:47:21,210 --> 00:47:22,550
[Hyeyeon: I felt that.]

881
00:47:24,950 --> 00:47:29,220
[Heejin: I assumed you felt
the exact same way I did.]

882
00:47:30,290 --> 00:47:32,960
[Heejin: But as the days went on,]

883
00:47:32,960 --> 00:47:36,430
[Heejin: I started wondering
if I had misread the whole thing.]

884
00:47:36,430 --> 00:47:41,230
[Heejin: I just wanted to hear the truth from you.]

885
00:47:45,770 --> 00:47:52,440
[Hyeyeon: In the beginning,
you and I felt the exact same way.]

886
00:47:52,440 --> 00:47:55,110
[Hyeyeon: But as for our feelings...]

887
00:47:55,110 --> 00:47:58,850
[Hyeyeon: we both know
when we started drifting apart.]

888
00:47:58,850 --> 00:48:01,250
[Hyeyeon: Honestly, I]

889
00:48:01,250 --> 00:48:04,190
[Hyeyeon: started interacting with others]

890
00:48:04,190 --> 00:48:08,730
[Hyeyeon: and receiving interest from them,]

891
00:48:08,730 --> 00:48:13,530
[Hyeyeon: so our feelings naturally faded.]

892
00:48:13,530 --> 00:48:18,220
[Hyeyeon: Because I never told you
when my feelings started to change.]

893
00:48:18,220 --> 00:48:21,270
[Hyeyeon: So the moment]

894
00:48:21,270 --> 00:48:26,100
[Hyeyeon: you realized my heart
had gone to someone else,]

895
00:48:26,100 --> 00:48:27,780
[Hyeyeon: you started...]

896
00:48:27,780 --> 00:48:31,950
[Hyeyeon: acting distant toward me...]

897
00:48:31,950 --> 00:48:36,760
[Hyeyeon: That actually hurt my feelings, too.]
[Heejin: Ah, I see...]

898
00:48:37,820 --> 00:48:39,960
[Hyeyeon: Even though I knew
I shouldn't feel that way.]

899
00:48:39,960 --> 00:48:43,960
[Heejin: Ah, I really had no idea
you felt like that.]

900
00:48:43,960 --> 00:48:46,630
[Hyeyeon: Really?]
[Heejin: Yeah, really. I just...]

901
00:48:46,630 --> 00:48:51,970
[Heejin: wondered if I had gotten the wrong idea.]

902
00:48:51,970 --> 00:48:57,040
[Heejin: Honestly, I thought you voted
for me on the first day.]

903
00:48:58,110 --> 00:49:01,580
[Heejin: But didn't you vote
for another girl back then?]

904
00:49:01,580 --> 00:49:02,920
[Hyeyeon: Yeah.]

905
00:49:02,920 --> 00:49:07,720
[Heejin: Do you mind telling me who it was?
I know it's a tough question.]

906
00:49:07,720 --> 00:49:10,920
[Heejin: Was it some girl
who left a strong first impression on you?]

907
00:49:10,920 --> 00:49:13,330
[Hyeyeon: On the first day,]

908
00:49:13,330 --> 00:49:15,730
[Hyeyeon: it wasn't really about romantic interest.]

909
00:49:15,730 --> 00:49:18,400
[Hyeyeon: I was more focused on
who everyone was talking about.]

910
00:49:18,400 --> 00:49:23,740
[Hyeyeon: I didn't really have feelings
for the person I voted for that day.]

911
00:49:23,740 --> 00:49:28,810
[Hyeyeon: Even if it wasn't them,
I probably would've picked someone else,
though I can't tell you the name.]

912
00:49:29,480 --> 00:49:31,940
So basically...

913
00:49:32,280 --> 00:49:36,280
[Hyeyeon: I think that's
where we started misreading each other.]

914
00:49:36,280 --> 00:49:41,890
[Heejin: Ever since then,
one girl kept voting for me.]

915
00:49:41,890 --> 00:49:44,820
[Heejin: I always assumed it was you.]

916
00:49:44,820 --> 00:49:46,690
[Heejin: That's when it finally hit me.]

917
00:49:46,690 --> 00:49:49,900
[Heejin: I realized I had it wrong the whole time.]

918
00:49:49,900 --> 00:49:53,630
[Heejin: So naturally, I felt a bit embarrassed.]

919
00:49:53,630 --> 00:49:55,770
[Heejin: To be completely honest,]

920
00:49:55,770 --> 00:49:58,170
[Heejin: I felt a little... ]
[Hyeyeon: Were you mad?]

921
00:49:58,170 --> 00:49:59,770
[Heejin: Yeah, a bit. I just...]

922
00:50:00,310 --> 00:50:04,310
[Heejin: felt like you led me on.]

923
00:50:04,840 --> 00:50:07,510
[Heejin: And at the same time,]

924
00:50:07,510 --> 00:50:10,180
[Heejin: the vote result that day]

925
00:50:10,180 --> 00:50:13,390
[Heejin: was basically my popularity ranking.]

926
00:50:13,390 --> 00:50:14,990
[Heejin: So I wondered if you didn't...]

927
00:50:16,320 --> 00:50:18,990
[Hyeyeon: No, that's not it.]
[Heejin: take me seriously.]

928
00:50:18,990 --> 00:50:21,390
[Hyeyeon: Definitely not.]
[Heejin: I was]

929
00:50:21,390 --> 00:50:23,530
[Heejin: pretty obvious about liking you.]

930
00:50:23,530 --> 00:50:26,470
[Heejin: You said you wanted canapés,
so I even made them for you.]

931
00:50:27,000 --> 00:50:28,330
[Hyeyeon: Right.]

932
00:50:28,330 --> 00:50:31,800
[Heejin: My feelings for you were completely real.]

933
00:50:31,550 --> 00:50:31,800
Right.

934
00:50:31,800 --> 00:50:33,670
[Heejin: It just felt like you...]

935
00:50:33,670 --> 00:50:36,610
[Heejin: I was just someone you leaned on.]
[Hyeyeon: Used you...]

936
00:50:36,310 --> 00:50:38,560
-So it hurt my feelings. -Did it hurt you?

937
00:50:36,610 --> 00:50:38,860
[Heejin: It really hurt my feelings.]

938
00:50:38,860 --> 00:50:40,080
[Hyeyeon: I'm sorry.]

939
00:50:40,500 --> 00:50:42,480
[Hyeyeon: I guess I leaned on her]

940
00:50:42,480 --> 00:50:44,350
[Hyeyeon: because she's such a mature person.]

941
00:50:44,350 --> 00:50:46,750
[Hyeyeon: She saw those things
as me showing affection,]

942
00:50:46,750 --> 00:50:49,420
[Hyeyeon: but I basically...]

943
00:50:49,420 --> 00:50:51,020
[Hyeyeon: ignored it.]

944
00:50:51,290 --> 00:50:53,430
[Hyeyeon: You might not believe me,]

945
00:50:53,430 --> 00:50:56,630
[Hyeyeon: but appearance-wise,
you really are my ideal type...]

946
00:50:56,630 --> 00:50:58,760
[Hyeyeon: So I want to make one thing clear:]

947
00:50:58,760 --> 00:51:02,230
[Hyeyeon: I felt drawn to you when we first met,]

948
00:51:02,230 --> 00:51:04,900
[Hyeyeon: and I showed my interest in you openly.]

949
00:51:05,440 --> 00:51:06,770
[Hyeyeon: After that,]

950
00:51:06,770 --> 00:51:11,040
[Hyeyeon: once you found out
who I had feelings for,]

951
00:51:11,040 --> 00:51:13,710
[Hyeyeon: when we started
avoiding each other like this...]

952
00:51:13,710 --> 00:51:16,650
[Hyeyeon: I wondered if I should
reach out to you again,]

953
00:51:17,450 --> 00:51:20,650
[Hyeyeon: but I kind of ignored the situation.]

954
00:51:24,120 --> 00:51:28,930
[Heejin: I thought about talking to you,]

955
00:51:28,930 --> 00:51:32,130
[Heejin: but honestly, I backed off.]

956
00:51:32,660 --> 00:51:37,200
[Heejin: I felt like I needed
to watch my actions, too.]

957
00:51:37,200 --> 00:51:39,070
[Heejin: That's why I...]

958
00:51:39,070 --> 00:51:41,470
[Heejin: suddenly turned so cold toward you.]

959
00:51:41,470 --> 00:51:43,610
[Hyeyeon: Yeah, you really
gave me the cold shoulder.]

960
00:51:43,610 --> 00:51:46,550
[Hyeyeon: Even when you left
for your date with Sujin,]

961
00:51:46,550 --> 00:51:49,750
[Hyeyeon: you just brushed right past me.]

962
00:51:49,900 --> 00:51:51,740
[Sniffles]

963
00:51:54,820 --> 00:51:58,020
[Hyeyeon: I'm crying.]
[Heejin: Tears? Or snuffles?]

964
00:51:58,020 --> 00:52:01,490
[Heejin: Are you crying?]
[Hyeyeon: Tears and snuffles.]

965
00:52:01,490 --> 00:52:05,500
[Hyeyeon: I feel like I put you through so much.]

966
00:52:05,500 --> 00:52:07,900
[Hyeyeon: I feel so bad.]

967
00:52:07,900 --> 00:52:10,300
[Heejin: What are you doing? Hey.]

968
00:52:10,300 --> 00:52:14,840
[Heejin: Don't cry.
Seeing you cry makes me sad, too.]

969
00:52:14,840 --> 00:52:16,710
[Heejin: Stop crying, okay?]

970
00:52:16,710 --> 00:52:20,180
[Heejin: Don't cry.
You'll ruin your makeup.]

971
00:52:20,180 --> 00:52:25,250
[Hyeyeon: If I had just acted more clearly,
you wouldn't have gotten so hurt.]

972
00:52:24,290 --> 00:52:25,150
No, not at all.

973
00:52:25,250 --> 00:52:29,250
[Heejin: But I understand how you felt, too.]

974
00:52:29,250 --> 00:52:32,460
[Heejin: After all, this show is
about keeping your options open]

975
00:52:32,460 --> 00:52:34,590
[Heejin: and getting to know everyone.]

976
00:52:34,590 --> 00:52:37,000
[Heejin: I probably,...]

977
00:52:37,000 --> 00:52:40,730
[Heejin: had my expectations too high,]

978
00:52:40,730 --> 00:52:42,600
[Heejin: so the hurt felt surprisingly deeper.]

979
00:52:42,600 --> 00:52:45,540
[Heejin: As time went on, I realized]

980
00:52:45,800 --> 00:52:50,610
[Heejin: you didn't do anything wrong.]

981
00:52:51,140 --> 00:52:54,080
[Heejin: Don't cry.]

982
00:52:54,080 --> 00:52:56,210
[Hyeyeon: I just kept feeling]

983
00:52:56,210 --> 00:52:58,880
[Hyeyeon: this heavy pressure in my chest.]

984
00:52:58,880 --> 00:53:01,550
[Hyeyeon: It wasn't just you avoiding me...]

985
00:53:01,550 --> 00:53:05,290
[Hyeyeon: we were both avoiding each other.]
[Heejin: Exactly.]

986
00:53:05,820 --> 00:53:08,230
[Heejin: But asking for this Rewind Date
really took a lot of courage.]

987
00:53:08,230 --> 00:53:11,160
[Hyeyeon: It did.]
[Heejin: Because I]

988
00:53:11,160 --> 00:53:13,300
[Heejin: tend to avoid things sometimes.]

989
00:53:13,300 --> 00:53:15,970
[Hyeyeon: Everyone has that. I do, too.]

990
00:53:15,970 --> 00:53:20,140
[Heejin: I usually try so hard
to avoid acting like that...]

991
00:53:20,140 --> 00:53:23,440
[Hyeyeon: Everyone does.]
[Heejin: But coming here triggered it again.]

992
00:53:24,340 --> 00:53:27,180
[Heejin: I thought, "Ah, Jung Heejin
is running away again."]

993
00:53:25,490 --> 00:53:27,690
-Running away again. -No, you weren't.

994
00:53:28,100 --> 00:53:32,250
[Heejin: I knew I had to fix this first.]

995
00:53:32,700 --> 00:53:35,940
[Heejin: I couldn't keep hiding.
I had to face it head-on.]

996
00:53:35,940 --> 00:53:37,460
[Heejin: That's why I asked for this date.]

997
00:53:37,460 --> 00:53:40,180
[Hyeyeon: You really are such a wonderful person.]

998
00:53:40,180 --> 00:53:42,580
[Hyeyeon: I did the same thing.]

999
00:53:42,580 --> 00:53:46,050
[Hyeyeon: I dodged the issues between us.]

1000
00:53:46,050 --> 00:53:49,520
[Hyeyeon: If you hadn't asked to talk to me,
I probably would've]

1001
00:53:49,520 --> 00:53:51,920
[Hyeyeon: just stayed like that
without making a move.]

1002
00:53:51,920 --> 00:53:53,530
[Hyeyeon: But one thing is for sure...]

1003
00:53:53,530 --> 00:53:56,460
[Hyeyeon: I always knew you were a great person,]

1004
00:53:56,460 --> 00:53:59,130
[Hyeyeon: and by asking to talk]

1005
00:53:59,130 --> 00:54:01,000
[Hyeyeon: and opening up like this,]

1006
00:54:01,270 --> 00:54:03,940
[Hyeyeon: you proved it beyond a doubt.]

1007
00:54:03,940 --> 00:54:05,800
[Hyeyeon: I have so much to learn from you.]

1008
00:54:05,800 --> 00:54:08,210
[Heejin: But you know, if I genuinely...]

1009
00:54:08,210 --> 00:54:10,610
[Heejin: thought you were a terrible person,
I wouldn't have bothered clearing the air]

1010
00:54:10,610 --> 00:54:15,150
[Heejin: and just walked away.
But because I think you're a great person.]

1011
00:54:15,150 --> 00:54:19,150
[Heejin: You're someone I'd love
to stay connected with outside this show.]

1012
00:54:19,150 --> 00:54:20,750
[Heejin: I asked for this date.]

1013
00:54:20,750 --> 00:54:25,020
[Heejin: I hope you know that.]
[Hyeyeon: I'll keep that in mind. I got it.]

1014
00:54:25,020 --> 00:54:26,890
[Hyeyeon: I'll treasure it.]

1015
00:54:26,890 --> 00:54:30,220
[Hyeyeon: I feel like this will
be the most memorable moment of all.]

1016
00:54:30,220 --> 00:54:30,900
[Really?]
[Hyeyeon: I feel like this will be
the most memorable moment.]

1017
00:54:30,900 --> 00:54:33,570
[Hyeyeon: It'll definitely be one of my top scenes.]

1018
00:54:35,860 --> 00:54:38,370
[Heejin: We don't have much time left.]

1019
00:54:38,370 --> 00:54:40,510
[Heejin: Let's make the most of the time we have.]

1020
00:54:40,510 --> 00:54:42,910
[Hyeyeon: Okay.]
[Heejin: And even after the show,]

1021
00:54:42,910 --> 00:54:45,580
[Heejin: Let's stay good friends.]

1022
00:54:47,180 --> 00:54:48,780
[Hyeyeon: Stamp.]

1023
00:54:48,780 --> 00:54:50,120
[Heejin: Copy.]
[Hyeyeon: Copy.]

1024
00:54:50,120 --> 00:54:51,180
[Hyeyeon: Sign.]

1025
00:54:53,320 --> 00:54:54,920
[Hyeyeon: Uh, I need to sign, too.]

1026
00:54:58,920 --> 00:55:01,060
[Heejin: Thank you so much.]
[Hyeyeon: Thank you, too.]

1027
00:55:00,540 --> 00:55:01,460
I mean it.

1028
00:55:01,590 --> 00:55:03,460
[Hyeyeon: After talking to her,]

1029
00:55:03,460 --> 00:55:08,530
[Hyeyeon: we both felt so much lighter,
and started cheering each other on.]

1030
00:55:08,530 --> 00:55:13,070
[Hyeyeon: She really is so mature and wonderful.]

1031
00:55:14,410 --> 00:55:17,080
[Heejin: I loved hearing]

1032
00:55:17,080 --> 00:55:19,210
[Heejin: how she felt about me.]

1033
00:55:19,210 --> 00:55:21,080
[Heejin: I feel so relieved.]

1034
00:55:23,220 --> 00:55:24,280
[Heejin: Shall we go?]
[Hyeyeon: Sure.]

1035
00:55:24,280 --> 00:55:28,290
[Heejin: You handled that conversation so maturely.]

1036
00:55:28,290 --> 00:55:29,620
[Hyeyeon: You're the truly mature one here.]

1037
00:55:29,620 --> 00:55:30,960
[Heejin: Thanks.]

1038
00:55:31,490 --> 00:55:33,360
[Hyeyeon: Did you feel that I was being sincere?]

1039
00:55:33,360 --> 00:55:34,430
[Heejin: Of course.]

1040
00:55:34,430 --> 00:55:36,560
[Hyeyeon: That's all that matters.]
[Heejin: Did you feel mine, too?]

1041
00:55:36,560 --> 00:55:38,160
[Hyeyeon: Yeah, totally.]

1042
00:55:40,030 --> 00:55:45,100
[Clearing up the misunderstanding,
Heejin and Hyeyeon feel a weight lift]

1043
00:55:52,700 --> 00:55:57,180
[Focused]

1044
00:56:02,450 --> 00:56:06,730
[Yongkyu: Chaebe, I'm heading out!]
[Chaebe: Okay, have a good date!]

1045
00:56:06,990 --> 00:56:11,260
[Moments you wish you didn't see,
but can't help noticing]

1046
00:56:11,530 --> 00:56:14,470
[He just can't bring himself to look back]

1047
00:56:15,000 --> 00:56:22,470
[Left behind alone, what is Chaebe thinking?]

1048
00:56:27,280 --> 00:56:28,610
[Chaebe: Hey.]
[Seungho: Hey.]

1049
00:56:28,610 --> 00:56:31,280
[Chaebe: Taking a nap?]

1050
00:56:31,280 --> 00:56:33,690
[Seungho: I just ate,
so I can't fall asleep right now.]

1051
00:56:33,690 --> 00:56:38,760
[Chaebe: Can I hang out
in the main building downstairs?]
[Seungho: No, that's why I came over here.]

1052
00:56:38,760 --> 00:56:40,630
[Chaebe: Are they dating over there?]
[Seungho: Yeah.]

1053
00:56:40,630 --> 00:56:45,160
[Chaebe: Tch... hmph!]

1054
00:56:45,430 --> 00:56:47,300
[Chaebe: Did you go on your date?]
[Seungho: Yeah.]

1055
00:56:47,300 --> 00:56:50,240
[Seungho: What about you? It just came to my mind.]
[Chaebe: I just got back from my date with Yongkyu.]

1056
00:56:50,240 --> 00:56:53,970
[Seungho: Ah, you already went?
What did you two do?]
[Chaebe: We went to the beach.]

1057
00:56:50,270 --> 00:56:53,130
-Ah, you already went? -That's why I took pictures.

1058
00:56:53,970 --> 00:56:56,370
[Seungho: You went there again?]
[Chaebe: Yeah.]

1059
00:56:56,640 --> 00:57:00,380
[Chaebe: I asked him.]
[Seungho: Asked if he wants
to marry you?]

1060
00:57:03,050 --> 00:57:08,120
[Chaebe: I've been trying so hard
and expressing my feelings.]

1061
00:57:08,120 --> 00:57:13,460
[Chaebe: "Did my ranking change?
Did I become your second choice?"]

1062
00:57:13,460 --> 00:57:17,730
[Chaebe: He said no. So I asked where I rank.]

1063
00:57:17,730 --> 00:57:23,600
[Chaebe: He said there is no ranking.
He only has a first and second choice.]

1064
00:57:23,600 --> 00:57:26,000
[Chaebe: I'm not even on the board.]

1065
00:57:26,270 --> 00:57:31,080
[Chaebe: I'm just like a little brother to him,
someone who shares a room with him.]

1066
00:57:34,380 --> 00:57:37,900
[Seungho: Heejin should've stayed here,
and Yongkyu should've stayed over there.]

1067
00:57:37,900 --> 00:57:40,300
[Seungho: Yeah, following the usual routine.]

1068
00:57:40,300 --> 00:57:48,430
[Chaebe: Even if Heejin stayed here,
I don't think his mind would change.]

1069
00:57:48,740 --> 00:57:52,960
[Chaebe: Not living together
means even fewer chances to connect.]

1070
00:57:52,960 --> 00:57:59,370
[Chaebe: Sharing a room was our only chance
to get close.]

1071
00:58:03,910 --> 00:58:08,450
[Chaebe: By the way, he didn't put on perfume
when he left with me earlier,]

1072
00:58:08,450 --> 00:58:11,650
[Chaebe: but he put on perfume
for his date with Hyeyeon.]

1073
00:58:11,650 --> 00:58:15,120
[Chaebe: Unbelievable.]
[Seungho: That's hilarious.]

1074
00:58:15,120 --> 00:58:17,520
[Chaebe: Unbelievable.]

1075
00:58:18,590 --> 00:58:22,330
[Chaebe: And when he went on a date with Hyeyeon,]

1076
00:58:22,330 --> 00:58:24,860
[Chaebe: he dressed a lot like I do.]

1077
00:58:24,860 --> 00:58:27,400
[Chaebe: But when he went on a date with me,
he wore something completely different.]

1078
00:58:27,400 --> 00:58:29,860
[Seungho: That's true, actually.]

1079
00:58:29,860 --> 00:58:32,100
[What the...]

1080
00:58:31,300 --> 00:58:32,160
Looks like it.

1081
00:58:32,100 --> 00:58:36,470
[Chaebe: Guess he really likes Hyeyeon.]

1082
00:58:37,540 --> 00:58:45,380
[Chaebe: How did your chat go?]
[Seungho: No big changes on my end.]

1083
00:58:45,820 --> 00:58:53,020
[Chaebe: To Jinwoo?]
[Seungho: I feel even less certain now.]

1084
00:58:53,830 --> 00:58:59,160
[Chaebe: How long are they gonna date?]
[Seungho:They should take as much time as they can.
We don't have much time left.]

1085
00:59:01,300 --> 00:59:06,100
[Chaebe: Mine only lasted 40 minutes.]
[Seungho: Theirs hasn't even hit 30 minutes yet.]

1086
00:59:05,870 --> 00:59:06,730
Really?

1087
00:59:06,370 --> 00:59:08,770
[Time seems to pass even more slowly]

1088
00:59:19,450 --> 00:59:22,650
[Yongkyu waits alone for Hyeyeon]

1089
00:59:39,300 --> 00:59:41,100
[Pause]

1090
00:59:41,870 --> 00:59:44,810
[Hyeyeon: Hey.]
[Yongkyu: Hey, you're here.]

1091
00:59:45,610 --> 00:59:47,480
[Hyeyeon: I didn't realize we were cooking.]

1092
00:59:47,480 --> 00:59:49,080
[Hyeyeon: My clothes are so uncomfortable for this.]

1093
00:59:49,080 --> 00:59:49,880
[Hyeyeon: Am I good, Chef?]

1094
00:59:51,480 --> 00:59:53,350
[Yongkyu: Shouldn't we wear aprons?]
[Hyeyeon: Of course!]

1095
00:59:53,350 --> 00:59:56,820
[Hyeyeon: What am I without an apron?]

1096
00:59:56,820 --> 00:59:59,760
[Hyeyeon: Real chefs always wear aprons.]

1097
01:00:00,830 --> 01:00:02,690
[Yongkyu: Today, you get promoted from assistant...]

1098
01:00:02,690 --> 01:00:05,630
[Yongkyu: to Main Chef.]
[Hyeyeon: Chef? Main Chef?]

1099
01:00:05,630 --> 01:00:07,500
[Yongkyu: But what are we making?]

1100
01:00:07,860 --> 01:00:10,540
[Stumped]

1101
01:00:11,770 --> 01:00:14,710
[Yongkyu: Something like soup?
Let's keep it simple.]

1102
01:00:14,060 --> 01:00:14,780
A soup?

1103
01:00:15,510 --> 01:00:18,980
[Yongkyu steps in to help Hyeyeon]

1104
01:00:20,850 --> 01:00:23,250
[Yongkyu: Anything you want to make? Kimchi stew?]

1105
01:00:23,250 --> 01:00:25,380
[Hyeyeon: Sounds good!
Let's make pork kimchi stew.]

1106
01:00:25,380 --> 01:00:25,920
[Yongkyu: Sure.]

1107
01:00:26,720 --> 01:00:29,920
[Yongkyu: Hyeyeon mentioned before that she cooks,]

1108
01:00:29,920 --> 01:00:33,930
[Yongkyu: and that she enjoys cooking.]

1109
01:00:34,460 --> 01:00:37,660
[Yongkyu: I wanted to see
what she's like in the kitchen,]

1110
01:00:38,200 --> 01:00:41,930
[Yongkyu:so I decided to let her take the lead.]

1111
01:00:42,200 --> 01:00:45,400
[Hyeyeon: You chop the meat while I stir-fry this.]

1112
01:00:45,400 --> 01:00:46,470
[Yongkyu: Got it.]

1113
01:00:47,270 --> 01:00:49,410
[Main Chef Hyeyeon & Assistant Yongkyu begin cooking]

1114
01:00:50,480 --> 01:00:51,810
[Hyeyeon: Cut all of it.]

1115
01:00:51,810 --> 01:00:53,680
[Hyeyeon: This kind of stew]

1116
01:00:55,550 --> 01:00:57,950
[Hyeyeon: needs plenty of meat to taste good.]

1117
01:00:57,950 --> 01:00:59,550
[Yongkyu: There's no way this won't be good.]

1118
01:01:00,080 --> 01:01:01,950
[Hyeyeon: It tastes amazing
because I'm the one making it.]

1119
01:01:01,950 --> 01:01:04,090
[Yongkyu: Alright, alright, I get it.]

1120
01:01:04,660 --> 01:01:06,100
[Will it burn?]

1121
01:01:06,140 --> 01:01:07,560
[Yongkyu: Throw the meat in?]
[Hyeyeon: Yeah.]

1122
01:01:07,560 --> 01:01:09,160
[Hyeyeon: Toss it in.]

1123
01:01:09,160 --> 01:01:10,760
[Hyeyeon: You really thought I'd burn it?]

1124
01:01:10,760 --> 01:01:13,160
[Hyeyeon: It won't.]

1125
01:01:13,700 --> 01:01:15,830
[Hyeyeon: Assistant, why did you
cut the meat into such huge chunks?]

1126
01:01:15,830 --> 01:01:17,970
[Yongkyu: Oops.]

1127
01:01:18,240 --> 01:01:19,500
[Oops?] [Oops.]

1128
01:01:19,500 --> 01:01:21,500
[Questioning the Main Chef?] [Looks great.]

1129
01:01:21,500 --> 01:01:23,580
[Yongkyu: Looks great.]
[Hyeyeon: Want me to kick you out of my kitchen?]

1130
01:01:23,580 --> 01:01:25,980
[Yongkyu: Nice, looks really good.]

1131
01:01:26,780 --> 01:01:28,110
[Yongkyu: Do you cook at home, too?]

1132
01:01:28,110 --> 01:01:29,450
[Hyeyeon: Yeah!]

1133
01:01:29,450 --> 01:01:31,050
[Yongkyu: By yourself?]
[Hyeyeon: Yeah.]

1134
01:01:31,050 --> 01:01:33,450
[Hyeyeon: Sometimes I cook for myself,
and sometimes I cook for my dad and brother.]

1135
01:01:33,720 --> 01:01:36,120
[Yongkyu: This goes in at the end, right?]

1136
01:01:36,120 --> 01:01:37,990
[Really?]
[No, put it in halfway through.]

1137
01:01:37,990 --> 01:01:40,390
[Hyeyeon: Ah, Assistant, that looks like
it'll splatter. You put it in.]

1138
01:01:40,390 --> 01:01:42,530
[Yongkyu: OK.]

1139
01:01:43,860 --> 01:01:46,530
[Yongkyu: The tofu looks a bit unevenly sliced.]

1140
01:01:46,580 --> 01:01:47,980
[Glare]

1141
01:01:48,060 --> 01:01:50,540
[Yongkyu: Just offering my input.]

1142
01:01:52,140 --> 01:01:54,500
[Hyeyeon: People like you get fired
from the kitchen pretty quickly.]

1143
01:01:54,540 --> 01:01:56,700
[Me?]

1144
01:01:56,700 --> 01:01:57,420
[Sorry.]

1145
01:01:57,660 --> 01:02:01,940
[Hyeyeon: I've fired plenty of assistants like you.]

1146
01:02:01,940 --> 01:02:03,080
[Hyeyeon: You know that?]
[Yongkyu: Plenty?]

1147
01:02:03,080 --> 01:02:04,950
[Yes!] [Yeah!]

1148
01:02:05,220 --> 01:02:08,690
[Hyeyeon: My guilty conscience
suddenly made me speak formally...]

1149
01:02:09,750 --> 01:02:12,690
[Hyeyeon: Smells so good, right?]

1150
01:02:14,140 --> 01:02:17,500
[Hyeyeon: So did you go
on a Rewind Date earlier, too?]

1151
01:02:17,860 --> 01:02:19,220
[Yongkyu: Yeah, I did.]

1152
01:02:19,220 --> 01:02:20,700
[Hyeyeon: How was it?]

1153
01:02:21,300 --> 01:02:24,700
[Yongkyu: I went with Chaebe.]

1154
01:02:25,100 --> 01:02:27,640
[Hyeyeon: So how did it go?
Between you and Chaebe?]

1155
01:02:27,640 --> 01:02:28,710
[Yongkyu: Well...]

1156
01:02:28,710 --> 01:02:31,380
[Yongkyu: That date didn't]

1157
01:02:31,380 --> 01:02:35,380
[Yongkyu: change who I was]

1158
01:02:35,650 --> 01:02:39,920
[Ah.]
[Yongkyu: interested in.]

1159
01:02:40,180 --> 01:02:42,850
[Hyeyeon: So does Chaebe know]

1160
01:02:42,850 --> 01:02:43,390
[Hyeyeon: who you have feelings for?]

1161
01:02:43,660 --> 01:02:46,860
[Hyeyeon: Does he know who you have feelings for?]

1162
01:02:47,130 --> 01:02:48,990
[Hyeyeon: Did you go see the ocean with Chaebe?]

1163
01:02:48,990 --> 01:02:51,660
[Yongkyu: Yeah. What about you?]

1164
01:02:51,660 --> 01:02:54,070
[Hyeyeon: I went to see the ocean, too.]

1165
01:02:54,070 --> 01:02:54,600
[Yongkyu: With who?]

1166
01:02:55,130 --> 01:02:57,270
[Hyeyeon: With Heejin.]

1167
01:02:57,420 --> 01:02:59,020
[Freeze]

1168
01:02:59,670 --> 01:03:02,610
[Yongkyu: With Heejin?]
[Hyeyeon: Yeah. We talked about things
we never got to say before.]

1169
01:03:03,140 --> 01:03:05,280
[Hyeyeon: We had some]

1170
01:03:05,280 --> 01:03:10,080
[Hyeyeon: unnecessary misunderstandings between us.]

1171
01:03:10,350 --> 01:03:11,950
[Hyeyeon: But we cleared them all up.]

1172
01:03:11,950 --> 01:03:14,890
[Don't cry, don't cry.]
[Hyeyeon: I couldn't hold back my tears.]

1173
01:03:14,890 --> 01:03:16,320
[Don't cry, don't cry.]
[I really cried.]

1174
01:03:16,320 --> 01:03:19,290
[Sorry.]

1175
01:03:19,420 --> 01:03:22,630
[Hyeyeon: So I couldn't hold it in and just cried.]

1176
01:03:23,160 --> 01:03:25,300
[Hyeyeon: But it just goes to show
how honest we were with each other.]

1177
01:03:25,300 --> 01:03:28,500
[Hyeyeon: I laid all my true thoughts out to her,]

1178
01:03:28,500 --> 01:03:31,970
[Hyeyeon: and after talking to her,
a huge weight lifted off me.]

1179
01:03:33,570 --> 01:03:37,040
[While they chat, the kimchi stew starts boiling]

1180
01:03:37,310 --> 01:03:38,110
[Yongkyu: Can I open the lid and check?]

1181
01:03:38,110 --> 01:03:40,780
[Hyeyeon: Not yet.
Just listen to the sound.]

1182
01:03:42,380 --> 01:03:44,780
[Uh, sounds like it's bubbling?]

1183
01:03:44,780 --> 01:03:45,620
[It's bubbling away.]

1184
01:03:46,120 --> 01:03:48,790
[Hyeyeon: Now it's finally boiling.]

1185
01:03:48,790 --> 01:03:51,190
[Hyeyeon: I was just about to check it myself.]

1186
01:03:51,460 --> 01:03:52,790
[Yongkyu: Can I taste it to check the seasoning?]

1187
01:03:52,790 --> 01:03:53,860
[Hyeyeon: Not yet.]

1188
01:03:53,860 --> 01:03:54,930
[Hyeyeon: Go grab the Dasida seasoning powder first.]

1189
01:03:56,530 --> 01:03:57,860
[Yongkyu: Can't I take a quick sip
before adding it?]

1190
01:03:57,850 --> 01:03:58,920
-No. -Just...

1191
01:03:57,860 --> 01:03:58,660
[Hyeyeon: No.]

1192
01:03:58,660 --> 01:04:01,070
[Yongkyu: Just one sip. Just one sip.]

1193
01:03:59,790 --> 01:04:00,990
-Fine. -Just one sip.

1194
01:04:01,070 --> 01:04:02,400
[Yongkyu: Why don't you taste it first?]

1195
01:04:02,400 --> 01:04:02,930
[Hyeyeon: Alright.]

1196
01:04:02,930 --> 01:04:07,210
[Hyeyeon: Let me taste it first to see
if it's safe for you.]
[Yongkyu: See if a human can eat it.]

1197
01:04:07,240 --> 01:04:09,380
I think... never mind, I won't say it.

1198
01:04:13,880 --> 01:04:16,010
[Hyeyeon: Go grab the Dasida seasoning powder.]

1199
01:04:16,010 --> 01:04:17,620
[Yongkyu: Two packets? Or three?]

1200
01:04:17,620 --> 01:04:18,680
[Hyeyeon: Two packets?]
[Yongkyu: Yeah, two packets?]

1201
01:04:18,680 --> 01:04:20,280
[Yongkyu: We should have
ramen seasoning packets somewhere, too.]

1202
01:04:20,280 --> 01:04:23,220
[Hyeyeon: Ramen seasoning packets?
Are you kidding me?]

1203
01:04:23,760 --> 01:04:25,360
[Yongkyu: Let me taste it first.]

1204
01:04:27,230 --> 01:04:28,830
[Yongkyu: I'm just taking a bite of tofu.]

1205
01:04:31,230 --> 01:04:33,100
[Blow on it before giving it to me.]

1206
01:04:33,100 --> 01:04:35,500
[Hyeyeon: You can eat it like this?]
[Yongkyu: Blow on it first.]

1207
01:04:35,780 --> 01:04:37,580
Taste it to check the seasoning.

1208
01:04:38,600 --> 01:04:38,970
How is it?

1209
01:04:38,970 --> 01:04:41,370
[Hyeyeon: But I used this spoon
for the garlic earlier.]

1210
01:04:41,370 --> 01:04:43,510
[Hyeyeon: It might taste pretty garlic-heavy.]

1211
01:04:43,510 --> 01:04:44,580
[Hyeyeon: I was right, wasn't I?]

1212
01:04:45,110 --> 01:04:45,910
[Yongkyu: No, it's actually perfect.]

1213
01:04:45,910 --> 01:04:48,700
[Hyeyeon: For real?]
[Yongkyu: Cooked just right, too.]

1214
01:04:46,750 --> 01:04:49,140
-Did I put too much garlic? -Cooked just right.

1215
01:04:49,140 --> 01:04:50,940
[Cough]

1216
01:04:53,040 --> 01:04:53,950
-Hey. -Hyeyeon.

1217
01:04:53,120 --> 01:04:56,050
[Yongkyu: Hyeyeon, are you trying to kill me?]

1218
01:04:56,590 --> 01:04:58,190
[Hyeyeon: Why are you choking like that?]

1219
01:04:58,990 --> 01:05:01,130
[Yongkyu: She's so adorable.]

1220
01:05:01,930 --> 01:05:04,330
[Yongkyu: Super cute.
The way she talks]

1221
01:05:04,330 --> 01:05:06,730
[Yongkyu: and the way she cooks are super cute.]

1222
01:05:07,530 --> 01:05:11,000
[Yongkyu: It feels like we're a long-term couple]

1223
01:05:11,270 --> 01:05:13,940
[Yongkyu: cooking together at home.]

1224
01:05:13,940 --> 01:05:17,940
[Yongkyu: Just really natural and cozy.]

1225
01:05:20,340 --> 01:05:24,080
[Yongkyu: But did your]

1226
01:05:24,080 --> 01:05:25,950
[Yongkyu: top pick change?]

1227
01:05:25,950 --> 01:05:26,750
[Hyeyeon: Did my ranking change?]
[Yongkyu: Yeah.]

1228
01:05:27,550 --> 01:05:30,760
[Hyeyeon: I definitely have a lot more
to think about now.]

1229
01:05:31,290 --> 01:05:33,960
[Hyeyeon: Right before we dated,]

1230
01:05:33,960 --> 01:05:36,630
[Hyeyeon: my feelings shifted big time.]

1231
01:05:37,160 --> 01:05:40,630
[Hyeyeon: And right at that moment,
you confessed your feelings to me,]

1232
01:05:40,900 --> 01:05:43,300
[Hyeyeon: so my mind got even messier.]

1233
01:05:43,300 --> 01:05:44,640
[Hyeyeon: I've been thinking about it.]

1234
01:05:45,440 --> 01:05:46,770
[Yongkyu: But after going on that date with you,]

1235
01:05:46,770 --> 01:05:48,370
[Yongkyu: my feelings really changed.]

1236
01:05:48,370 --> 01:05:50,180
[Yongkyu: Honestly, it felt
way more comfortable than I expected.]

1237
01:05:50,180 --> 01:05:50,700
[Really?]
[Yongkyu: Seriously, way more comfortable.]

1238
01:05:50,700 --> 01:05:51,740
[Really?]
[Yongkyu: You're such a good listener.]

1239
01:05:51,740 --> 01:05:52,640
[Yongkyu: You're a great listener.]

1240
01:05:52,910 --> 01:05:54,250
[Hyeyeon: Even right now?]

1241
01:05:53,020 --> 01:05:54,250
-Even right now? -You even asked me questions.

1242
01:05:54,250 --> 01:05:55,580
[Yongkyu: Yeah.]

1243
01:05:55,580 --> 01:05:57,450
[Hyeyeon: Making this kimchi stew
with me is fun, right?]

1244
01:05:57,450 --> 01:05:58,780
[Yongkyu: Yeah.]

1245
01:05:59,320 --> 01:06:01,990
[Hyeyeon's expression is impossible to read]

1246
01:06:02,250 --> 01:06:05,020
[Hyeyeon: You can open the lid now.
You have my permission.]

1247
01:06:05,300 --> 01:06:06,860
[Whoa.] [Whoa.]

1248
01:06:07,220 --> 01:06:09,990
[Yongkyu: It looks a bit like soybean paste stew.]

1249
01:06:11,330 --> 01:06:13,730
[Looking like soybean paste stew,
Hyeyeon's kimchi stew is ready]

1250
01:06:14,060 --> 01:06:15,330
[Hyeyeon: Take a picture of me.]

1251
01:06:17,200 --> 01:06:19,070
[Hyeyeon: Why are you looking so dead serious?]

1252
01:06:19,070 --> 01:06:23,610
[Yongkyu: I snap a bunch of shots real quick
and pick my favorite.]

1253
01:06:23,610 --> 01:06:27,080
[Yongkyu & Hyeyeon
celebrate their second cooking session]

1254
01:06:27,080 --> 01:06:28,150
[Yongkyu: Turned out great, right?]

1255
01:06:28,150 --> 01:06:29,480
[Yongkyu: Put the lid on and lock in the flavor.]

1256
01:06:29,480 --> 01:06:30,550
[Hyeyeon: Keep it sealed.]

1257
01:06:32,150 --> 01:06:33,220
[Hyeyeon: I'm so happy.]
[Yongkyu: Nice job.]

1258
01:06:33,220 --> 01:06:34,290
[Hyeyeon: Are you happy?]

1259
01:06:34,290 --> 01:06:35,620
[Yongkyu: Yeah, I am.]

1260
01:06:36,420 --> 01:06:39,360
[Did Yongkyu manage
to make his way into Hyeyeon's heart?]

1261
01:06:44,900 --> 01:06:49,500
[On the final night at BI-LIVE, let's spend
one last special evening together in the yard]

1262
01:06:49,560 --> 01:06:50,900
[Jinwoo: That sounds so bittersweet.]

1263
01:06:50,900 --> 01:06:53,030
[Jinwoo: The final night at BI-LIVE...]

1264
01:06:53,030 --> 01:06:54,900
[Heejin: Really?]
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

1265
01:06:54,900 --> 01:06:58,370
[Jinwoo: We're spending our last night together.]

1266
01:06:58,370 --> 01:07:01,310
[Heejin: I honestly can't believe it.]
[Jinwoo: So sad.]

1267
01:07:01,310 --> 01:07:05,140
[Heejin: I honestly can't believe it.]
[Jinwoo: Man, I really can't.]

1268
01:07:05,140 --> 01:07:07,180
[Jinwoo: I kept hoping]

1269
01:07:07,180 --> 01:07:08,780
[Jinwoo: we'd all share one last meal together.]

1270
01:07:08,780 --> 01:07:10,920
[Jinwoo: This is such a great chance.]

1271
01:07:10,920 --> 01:07:12,520
[Jinwoo: Since it's our final night,]

1272
01:07:12,520 --> 01:07:15,720
[Jinwoo: I can't help feeling
so many emotions right now.]

1273
01:07:15,720 --> 01:07:17,860
[Jinwoo: Looking back at day one,]

1274
01:07:17,860 --> 01:07:19,720
[Jinwoo: and every little moment
we shared living here...]

1275
01:07:19,720 --> 01:07:21,860
[Jinwoo: it really gets to me.]

1276
01:07:22,390 --> 01:07:25,600
[Heejin: The Rewind Dates wrapped up nicely, too.]

1277
01:07:25,600 --> 01:07:29,070
[Heejin: Everything I was holding onto,
I finally let go.]

1278
01:07:29,070 --> 01:07:32,000
[Heejin: So I'm really looking forward]

1279
01:07:32,000 --> 01:07:35,210
[Heejin: to enjoying this meal with everyone,
totally stress-free.]

1280
01:07:35,740 --> 01:07:39,480
[On the final night at BI-LIVE, let's spend
one last special evening together in the yard]

1281
01:07:39,480 --> 01:07:40,810
[Yongkyu: The yard?]
[Eunchae: Let's head straight there.]

1282
01:07:40,810 --> 01:07:43,480
[Eunchae: I think it's where we were earlier.]

1283
01:07:43,480 --> 01:07:45,020
[Chaebe: I need to change my pants.]

1284
01:07:45,020 --> 01:07:48,060
[Ugh!]

1285
01:07:48,060 --> 01:07:50,690
[Eunchae: That sounded like someone just died.]

1286
01:07:50,690 --> 01:07:53,890
[Eunchae: Honestly,
the final moment keeps getting closer.]

1287
01:07:53,890 --> 01:07:57,630
[Eunchae: Everyone is so great,
and we've all grown so attached,]

1288
01:07:57,630 --> 01:08:00,030
[Eunchae: so saying goodbye feels hard.]

1289
01:08:00,030 --> 01:08:02,170
[Yongkyu: I'm starving.]

1290
01:08:02,170 --> 01:08:03,740
[Chaebe: Let's go.]

1291
01:08:03,740 --> 01:08:04,940
[Chaebe: I'm so excited.]

1292
01:08:04,940 --> 01:08:06,100
[Chaebe: Everyone's gotten way closer,]

1293
01:08:06,100 --> 01:08:08,770
[Chaebe: so I can finally enjoy a meal
with zero pressure.]

1294
01:08:08,770 --> 01:08:12,510
[Chaebe: I was already starving.]

1295
01:08:13,040 --> 01:08:17,850
[They will all be going their
separate ways tomorrow,]

1296
01:08:18,380 --> 01:08:22,920
[gather for their final dinner together,
not wanting to say goodbye.]

1297
01:08:23,220 --> 01:08:26,819
[The BBQ Party at BI-LIVE]

1298
01:08:30,930 --> 01:08:33,859
[Hyeyeon: How about I do it?
I'll handle the grilling.]

1299
01:08:33,859 --> 01:08:36,260
[Yongkyu: You're grilling the meat?]
[Hyeyeon: Yeah.]

1300
01:08:36,529 --> 01:08:38,399
[Yongkyu: Do you know how to grill?]
[Hyeyeon: Of course.]

1301
01:08:38,399 --> 01:08:40,529
[Jinwoo: Wait, you're grilling?]

1302
01:08:40,529 --> 01:08:41,340
[Heejin: For real?]

1303
01:08:41,340 --> 01:08:43,470
[Hyeyeon: I used to work at a barbecue restaurant.]
[Jinwoo: That's such a contrast, you know?]

1304
01:08:43,470 --> 01:08:45,340
[Heejin: You worked there?]
[Hyeyeon: I worked part-time at one for three years.]

1305
01:08:43,550 --> 01:08:45,340
-You worked there? -I worked at a barbecue restaurant.

1306
01:08:45,340 --> 01:08:46,410
[Jinwoo: Seriously?]

1307
01:08:46,410 --> 01:08:49,080
[Hyeyeon: I scrubbed grill pans
like crazy every day.]
[Heejin: Whoa, you're actually really good.]

1308
01:08:49,080 --> 01:08:50,410
[Hyeyeon: What's up?]
[Jinwoo: You're something else.]

1309
01:08:50,410 --> 01:08:53,350
[Hyeyeon: Really?]
[Jinwoo: You're my second pick.]

1310
01:08:54,779 --> 01:08:55,689
Damn it.

1311
01:08:55,020 --> 01:08:56,500
[Glare]

1312
01:08:56,500 --> 01:08:58,689
[Chaebe: You two taking care of the grill?]
[Yongkyu: Yeah.]

1313
01:08:58,689 --> 01:09:00,819
[Yongkyu: But we've got four pairs of tongs.]

1314
01:09:00,819 --> 01:09:02,160
[Hyeyeon: Four pairs of tongs?]

1315
01:09:02,160 --> 01:09:03,220
[Chaebe: Then we'll help you out.]

1316
01:09:03,490 --> 01:09:05,359
[Jinwoo: Then let's just sit down, Eunchae.]

1317
01:09:05,359 --> 01:09:07,229
[Yongkyu: We need to chop this up.]

1318
01:09:07,229 --> 01:09:08,830
[Sujin: I'll chop it right away.]

1319
01:09:08,830 --> 01:09:10,160
[Hyeyeon: Hey, snap a photo of me!]

1320
01:09:10,160 --> 01:09:12,029
[Chaebe: One, two, three.]

1321
01:09:13,899 --> 01:09:14,970
[Chaebe: It's gonna burn!]

1322
01:09:16,029 --> 01:09:18,630
