1324
01:09:21,640 --> 01:09:26,979
[Hyeyeon: Seungho, come take a photo with me.]
[Seungho: No, no, I'm grilling.]

1325
01:09:26,979 --> 01:09:28,050
[Hyeyeon: Okay, got it.]

1326
01:09:28,050 --> 01:09:30,180
[Chaebe: I'm filming a video.]

1327
01:09:29,180 --> 01:09:30,140
Ah, okay.

1328
01:09:30,180 --> 01:09:33,740
[I'll grill this super tasty for everyone.]

1329
01:09:33,779 --> 01:09:36,500
[Hyeyeon: Seungho usually
wouldn't jump in like this,]

1330
01:09:36,500 --> 01:09:38,100
[Hyeyeon: but he's standing here with us...]

1331
01:09:38,100 --> 01:09:40,859
[Hyeyeon: Looks like he and Jinwoo]

1332
01:09:40,859 --> 01:09:43,800
[Hyeyeon: really have grown apart.]

1333
01:09:43,800 --> 01:09:46,470
[Hyeyeon: But I don't think he came over
to get close to me.]

1334
01:09:46,470 --> 01:09:49,670
[Hyeyeon: He probably just wanted to grill.]

1335
01:09:49,670 --> 01:09:52,340
[Hyeyeon: Need an assistant to chop this.]
[Chaebe: Got it.]

1336
01:09:52,340 --> 01:09:55,280
[Hyeyeon: I got officially promoted
to Main Chef today.]
[Chaebe: Really?]

1337
01:09:55,280 --> 01:09:57,950
[Chaebe: Who is that?]

1338
01:09:56,470 --> 01:09:58,070
-Totally fine. -Two should be enough.

1339
01:09:57,950 --> 01:10:00,610
[Chaebe: I still don't know who that is.]

1340
01:10:00,530 --> 01:10:01,000
So I...

1341
01:10:00,610 --> 01:10:02,750
[Hyeyeon: Is this a couple's spat?]

1342
01:10:02,750 --> 01:10:05,150
[Chaebe: Honestly, I wanted to help out,
but Kim Hyeyeon]

1343
01:10:05,150 --> 01:10:07,500
[Chaebe: was always by Yongkyu's side.]

1344
01:10:07,500 --> 01:10:10,700
[What was she doing?]

1345
01:10:10,700 --> 01:10:11,560
[Chaebe: Anyway,]

1346
01:10:11,560 --> 01:10:13,960
[Chaebe: he's pretty cool. I just wish that,
even for one day,]

1347
01:10:13,960 --> 01:10:15,830
[Chaebe: he could let someone else handle things]

1348
01:10:15,830 --> 01:10:17,700
[Chaebe: and just sit down to enjoy a relaxed meal.]

1349
01:10:17,700 --> 01:10:20,630
[Chaebe: But he insists on playing chef.]

1350
01:10:20,630 --> 01:10:23,040
[Chaebe: Watching him makes my heart ache a little.]

1351
01:10:23,570 --> 01:10:25,170
[Yongkyu: Should I cut it larger? This size?]

1352
01:10:25,170 --> 01:10:29,020
[Seungho: About... this big, I guess.]

1353
01:10:29,020 --> 01:10:31,460
[Grill it up quick.]

1354
01:10:30,260 --> 01:10:31,500
-A little smaller. -Got it.

1355
01:10:31,500 --> 01:10:34,620
[Let's bring this over first.]
[Hurry, it's taking too long.]

1356
01:10:34,620 --> 01:10:35,850
[Jinwoo: We've got nothing to do right now.]

1357
01:10:35,850 --> 01:10:37,720
[Hyeyeon: Sorry.]
[Eunchae: I'm dying of boredom.]

1358
01:10:37,720 --> 01:10:40,390
[Chaebe: Jinwoo, want a bite?]
[Jinwoo: Me? Sure.]

1359
01:10:40,390 --> 01:10:42,520
[Yongkyu: Yeah, Jinwoo, give it a taste.]
[Jinwoo: Let me have a taste.]

1360
01:10:42,520 --> 01:10:45,190
[Hyeyeon: Seungho, do you want a bite, too?
Is it okay without sauce?]

1361
01:10:45,190 --> 01:10:46,260
[Seungho: No, I want sauce with it.]

1362
01:10:46,260 --> 01:10:48,130
[Hyeyeon: What sauce do you want? Ssamjang?]
[Seungho: Ssamjang.]

1363
01:10:51,600 --> 01:10:52,670
[Chaebe: Is it good? Is it good?]
[Jinwoo: So delicious!]

1364
01:10:52,670 --> 01:10:55,600
[Hyeyeon: Eunchae, can you
open the ssamjang for me?]

1365
01:10:55,600 --> 01:10:56,940
[Hyeyeon: Behind the lettuce.]
[Eunchae: Open it?]

1366
01:10:56,940 --> 01:10:57,580
[Yeah.]

1367
01:10:59,020 --> 01:10:59,900
-Done? -Done.

1368
01:10:59,070 --> 01:11:00,140
[Hyeyeon: Done.]

1369
01:11:00,140 --> 01:11:02,010
[Phew]
[Chaebe: Eunchae, try a piece, too.]

1370
01:11:02,010 --> 01:11:03,340
[Jinwoo: Hey, it's seriously good. Try some.]

1371
01:11:03,340 --> 01:11:05,100
[Eunchae: Sure.]

1372
01:11:05,100 --> 01:11:07,220
[Hyeyeon: Here, Seungho.]

1373
01:11:07,420 --> 01:11:08,800
Does it fit on the plate?

1374
01:11:11,350 --> 01:11:12,420
[Seungho: Yeah, tasty.]

1375
01:11:12,950 --> 01:11:14,560
[Hyeyeon: Good?]
[Seungho: Super good.]

1376
01:11:15,090 --> 01:11:17,220
[Jinwoo can only watch helplessly from the side]

1377
01:11:17,490 --> 01:11:21,230
[Jinwoo: I hesitated a bit
because I felt like I lost that energy.]

1378
01:11:21,230 --> 01:11:23,630
[Jinwoo: We kept running into problems,]

1379
01:11:23,630 --> 01:11:25,770
[Jinwoo: and as it built up piece by piece,]

1380
01:11:25,770 --> 01:11:28,440
[Jinwoo: that hyped-up passion I had at first...]

1381
01:11:28,440 --> 01:11:30,840
[Jinwoo: just gradually wore away]

1382
01:11:30,840 --> 01:11:33,510
[Jinwoo: as time went on.]

1383
01:11:34,580 --> 01:11:37,380
[Sujin: Ah, it's so cold.]

1384
01:11:37,380 --> 01:11:39,910
[Sujin: Need a hand with anything?]
[Heejin: Yeah, just these.]

1385
01:11:39,910 --> 01:11:43,650
[Heejin: I was washing dishes
while cooking the kimchi stew.]

1386
01:11:43,650 --> 01:11:46,590
[Heejin: We might be short on utensils.]

1387
01:11:46,590 --> 01:11:48,190
[Sujin: After this meal,]

1388
01:11:48,190 --> 01:11:49,520
[Sujin: when will we get another chance to talk?]

1389
01:11:49,520 --> 01:11:52,460
[Heejin: We're out of time.]
[Sujin: Exactly.]

1390
