1391
01:11:54,330 --> 01:11:58,330
[Ah...]
[Sujin: But we cleared up
our misunderstanding way too late.]

1392
01:11:58,330 --> 01:11:59,670
[Sujin: If you don't feel that way,
never mind.]

1393
01:11:59,670 --> 01:12:02,070
[Heejin: Yeah, talking things out...]

1394
01:12:02,070 --> 01:12:05,270
[Sujin: If that's not it, never mind!]
[Heejin: It was just too late.]

1395
01:12:05,270 --> 01:12:07,410
[Sujin: Because yesterday,]

1396
01:12:07,410 --> 01:12:10,080
[Sujin: you went out on that secret date,]

1397
01:12:10,080 --> 01:12:12,210
[Sujin: I thought there was
nothing I could do about it.]

1398
01:12:12,210 --> 01:12:14,880
[Heejin: But today...]

1399
01:12:14,880 --> 01:12:19,150
[Heejin: I was really glad
we could talk on the Rewind Date.]

1400
01:12:19,150 --> 01:12:21,180
[Sujin: Ah, so you don't want to keep talking, huh.]

1401
01:12:21,180 --> 01:12:21,780
[Ah, of course I...]
[Sujin: Ah, you don't want to keep talking.]

1402
01:12:21,780 --> 01:12:22,140
[Ah, of course...]
[Sujin: Ah, I see how it is.]

1403
01:12:22,140 --> 01:12:23,690
[Sujin: I see how it is.]

1404
01:12:23,690 --> 01:12:26,360
[Heejin: I honestly don't even know
what to say anymore.]

1405
01:12:26,360 --> 01:12:30,360
[Sujin: Even if I do nothing...]
[Heejin: I give up.]

1406
01:12:30,360 --> 01:12:32,500
[Sujin: Just kidding! Just kidding.]

1407
01:12:33,030 --> 01:12:35,700
[Sujin: Actually, after finding out I was Heejin's]

1408
01:12:35,700 --> 01:12:37,840
[Sujin: second choice,]

1409
01:12:37,840 --> 01:12:41,580
[Sujin: I started sticking to her like glue again.]

1410
01:12:41,580 --> 01:12:45,310
[Sujin: If she changes her mind back to me,
I'd be so happy.]

1411
01:12:45,310 --> 01:12:47,980
[Sujin: Even if it's like this, I just want to]

1412
01:12:47,980 --> 01:12:51,190
[Sujin: stay by her side and take care of her.]

1413
01:12:52,250 --> 01:12:55,720
[Look around]
[Jinwoo: Smells so tempting.]

1414
01:12:56,260 --> 01:12:58,130
[Eunchae: Why are there so few people here?]

1415
01:12:58,130 --> 01:13:00,260
[Jinwoo: Feels a bit empty, right?]
[Eunchae: Where did Sujin go?]

1416
01:13:00,260 --> 01:13:02,660
[Jinwoo: What are they doing inside?]

1417
01:13:04,000 --> 01:13:08,270
[Eunchae: Heejin and Sujin have been away]

1418
01:13:08,270 --> 01:13:10,400
[Eunchae: from here for quite a while.]

1419
01:13:10,400 --> 01:13:13,610
[Eunchae: I knew Sujin's top choice]

1420
01:13:13,610 --> 01:13:16,540
[Eunchae: is Heejin.]

1421
01:13:16,540 --> 01:13:21,350
[Eunchae: Whoever Heejin chooses is her call,
so I'm quietly waiting.]

1422
01:13:21,350 --> 01:13:25,090
[Eunchae: If today gets wasted like this,]

1423
01:13:25,090 --> 01:13:31,230
[Eunchae: with so little time left
before the final choice,]

1424
01:13:31,230 --> 01:13:35,230
[Eunchae: how am I supposed to]

1425
01:13:35,230 --> 01:13:37,900
[Eunchae: figure out my feelings in the end?]]

1426
01:13:38,700 --> 01:13:41,640
[Heejin: Clear the middle and put the soup here.]

1427
01:13:41,640 --> 01:13:43,240
[Hyeyeon: Whoa, it's our soup!]

1428
01:13:43,240 --> 01:13:45,640
[Ayy.] [Hyeyeon: Instead of "our soup,"
it's more like "my soup."]
[Heejin: Smells so good!]

1429
01:13:45,640 --> 01:13:47,820
[Yongkyu: We both own it.]

1430
01:13:47,820 --> 01:13:50,180
[Hyeyeon: I own 80% and you own 20%.]

1431
01:13:50,180 --> 01:13:51,510
[Chaebe: Really?]
[Hyeyeon: Yeah.]

1432
01:13:51,510 --> 01:13:54,450
[Heejin: Whoa, there's so much lettuce here!]

1433
01:13:54,980 --> 01:13:56,850
[Heejin: I'm gonna eat tons of wrap veggies.]

1434
01:13:56,850 --> 01:14:00,050
[Jinwoo: Do you like lettuce wraps?]
[Heejin: Yeah.]

1435
01:14:00,590 --> 01:14:02,460
[Jinwoo: Let's do a toast!]

1436
01:14:02,460 --> 01:14:04,590
[Eunchae: Pretty boring.]
[Jinwoo: Yeah, pretty boring.]

1437
01:14:04,590 --> 01:14:07,530
[Eunchae: I'm tired.]
[Jinwoo: I'm bored. Even my mouth is bored.
Everything's boring.]

1438
01:14:07,530 --> 01:14:09,660
[Eunchae: Getting sleepy.]

1439
01:14:12,490 --> 01:14:13,370
My voice...

1440
01:14:14,740 --> 01:14:16,870
[Seungho: Go eat.]
[Hyeyeon: Seungho, where are you going?]

1441
01:14:16,870 --> 01:14:20,340
[Hyeyeon: Seungho, where are you going?]
[Yongkyu: Let him go eat.]

1442
01:14:20,340 --> 01:14:22,740
[Seungho: I'm here to eat.]
[Jinwoo: Seungho, go ahead and eat.]

1443
01:14:22,740 --> 01:14:25,410
[Seungho: I've actually been eating the whole time.]
[Jinwoo: Really? I could tell.]

1444
01:14:28,880 --> 01:14:30,480
[Jinwoo: Let's eat, too.]

1445
01:14:30,480 --> 01:14:32,620
[Eunchae: Ah, so cold.]

1446
01:14:32,620 --> 01:14:34,490
[Jinwoo: Wrap yourself in the blanket.]
[Eunchae: Ah, but...]

1447
01:14:32,860 --> 01:14:34,490
-Wrap yourself in the blanket. -The pork belly...

1448
01:14:34,490 --> 01:14:36,890
[Eunchae: That doesn't seem to help much.]

1449
01:14:36,890 --> 01:14:39,290
[Jinwoo: Really? Not necessarily.]

1450
01:14:39,290 --> 01:14:42,140
[Nod]
[Heejin: Yongkyu, want me to make you a wrap?]

1451
01:14:42,140 --> 01:14:43,560
[Yongkyu: Coming!]

1452
01:14:47,300 --> 01:14:49,440
[Chaebe: Whoa, that's huge! Whoa.]

1453
01:14:48,910 --> 01:14:49,440
Impressive.

1454
01:14:49,440 --> 01:14:52,370
[Heejin: I just washed dishes,
so my hands are clean.]

1455
01:14:52,370 --> 01:14:54,510
[Hyeyeon: So delicious!]

1456
01:14:55,310 --> 01:14:57,900
[Hyeyeon: You're eating so loud right next to me.]

1457
01:14:57,900 --> 01:15:00,020
[Chaebe: Make one for Hyeyeon, too, Seungho.]

1458
01:15:00,020 --> 01:15:01,060
[Hyeyeon: Nobody's making me...]

1459
01:15:01,060 --> 01:15:01,660
[What?]
[Hyeyeon: Nobody's making me...]

1460
01:15:07,780 --> 01:15:09,990
[Hyeyeon: But he isn't moving an inch.]

1461
01:15:09,990 --> 01:15:11,860
[Chaebe: Seungho, make her one.]

1462
01:15:11,860 --> 01:15:12,930
[Seungho: One bite?]
[Hyeyeon: Never mind.]

1463
01:15:12,930 --> 01:15:15,180
[Yongkyu: Make her a wrap.]
[Hyeyeon: Just keep eating, keep eating.]

1464
01:15:15,180 --> 01:15:16,900
[Hyeyeon: Keep eating.]

1465
01:15:16,900 --> 01:15:18,580
[Lost]

1466
01:15:18,250 --> 01:15:19,780
-Let's fry another batch. -So funny.

1467
01:15:18,580 --> 01:15:20,140
[Lost]
[Hyeyeon: So funny.]

1468
01:15:20,140 --> 01:15:23,020
[Eating]

1469
01:15:21,730 --> 01:15:23,210
-Put this here first. -2.

1470
01:15:23,020 --> 01:15:25,210
[Jinwoo: So tasty!]
[Heejin: Really? I want some, too.]

1471
01:15:25,210 --> 01:15:27,070
[Heejin: Wow, this is really good.
Which chopsticks are yours?]

1472
01:15:27,070 --> 01:15:28,680
[Heejin: Never mind, I'll eat it myself.]

1473
01:15:28,680 --> 01:15:30,810
[Jinwoo: I'll feed you.]
[Heejin: Really?]

1474
01:15:30,810 --> 01:15:32,680
[Jinwoo: Eat the meat first.]
[Heejin: Yeah.]

1475
01:15:32,680 --> 01:15:34,820
[Jinwoo: Try it.]

1476
01:15:34,820 --> 01:15:36,150
[Heejin: Delicious!]
[Jinwoo: Good, right?]

1477
01:15:36,150 --> 01:15:37,750
[Sujin: Bringing kimchi
was the right move, wasn't it?]

1478
01:15:37,750 --> 01:15:39,090
[Heejin: Yeah.]
[Seungho: Tasty.]

1479
01:15:39,090 --> 01:15:41,220
[Jinwoo: Total stroke of genius.]

1480
01:15:41,220 --> 01:15:42,560
[Jinwoo: Whose idea was it?]

1481
01:15:42,560 --> 01:15:43,620
[Sujin: Ours.]

1482
01:15:45,760 --> 01:15:46,560
[Sujin: Heejin's idea?]

1483
01:15:46,560 --> 01:15:48,300
[Jinwoo: She keeps pointing to herself!]
[Sujin: Heejin's idea.]

1484
01:15:47,540 --> 01:15:49,050
-Heejin's idea. -Must be.

1485
01:15:48,300 --> 01:15:48,960
[Jinwoo: How should I put it...]

1486
01:15:48,960 --> 01:15:52,170
[Sujin: But I helped out as the assistant, too.]

1487
01:15:52,700 --> 01:15:54,300
[Heejin: Every time Sujin takes care of me,]

1488
01:15:54,300 --> 01:15:55,820
[Heejin: I feel so grateful.]

1489
01:15:55,820 --> 01:15:56,970
[Heejin: But I...]

1490
01:15:56,970 --> 01:16:00,440
[Heejin: don't go out of my way to stay]

1491
01:16:00,440 --> 01:16:02,310
[Heejin: by the side of someone I care about.]

1492
01:16:02,310 --> 01:16:06,050
[Heejin: Eunchae seems just like me in that way.]

1493
01:16:06,050 --> 01:16:08,720
[Heejin: She ate comfortably and enjoyed the food.]

1494
01:16:10,850 --> 01:16:12,190
[Heejin: Whoa, this kimchi stew is amazing!]

1495
01:16:15,390 --> 01:16:16,720
[Jinwoo: The stew is so good.]

1496
01:16:16,720 --> 01:16:18,330
[Yongkyu: Delicious, right?]
[Heejin: Tastes like restaurant-quality kimchi stew.]

1497
01:16:18,330 --> 01:16:20,730
[Yongkyu: I made it.]
[ Jinwoo: Yeah, right.]

1498
01:16:20,730 --> 01:16:23,130
[Yongkyu: I made it.]

1499
01:16:23,130 --> 01:16:24,730
[Hyeyeon: Earlier, you said if it tasted bad,]

1500
01:16:24,730 --> 01:16:26,330
[Hyeyeon: you'd tell everyone I made it.]

1501
01:16:26,330 --> 01:16:31,140
[Yongkyu: Good or bad, my share is still my share.]

1502
01:16:32,060 --> 01:16:32,900
[Chaebe: All done?]

1503
01:16:32,900 --> 01:16:35,060
[Yongkyu: Yeah, all set. Eat up, eat up!]
[Hyeyeon: Yeah, pretty much.]

1504
01:16:35,410 --> 01:16:36,740
[Hyeyeon: Huh? Round two of cooking tonight?]

1505
01:16:36,740 --> 01:16:39,150
[Hyeyeon: Didn't you say earlier
that it was too short and you didn't get enough?]

1506
01:16:39,170 --> 01:16:41,570
[Yongkyu: Like this...]
[Hyeyeon: Round two of cooking.]

1507
01:16:41,570 --> 01:16:43,970
[Hyeyeon: How was today's]

1508
01:16:43,970 --> 01:16:46,910
[Hyeyeon: rewind date?]

1509
01:16:46,910 --> 01:16:49,040
[Yongkyu: Pretty good.]

1510
01:16:49,040 --> 01:16:53,850
[Yongkyu: It feels like we're
the owners of a resort.]

1511
01:16:53,850 --> 01:16:56,780
[Yongkyu: Somehow, I ended up being
