1514
01:17:01,590 --> 01:17:03,720
[Yongkyu: I was happy, just chatting
with each other,]

1515
01:17:03,720 --> 01:17:06,660
[Yongkyu: talking about random little things.]

1516
01:17:06,660 --> 01:17:09,600
[Yongkyu: I had a really good time.]

1517
01:17:09,860 --> 01:17:12,800
[Dinner officially begins]

1518
01:17:11,720 --> 01:17:12,640
Delicious.

1519
01:17:14,260 --> 01:17:15,200
[Hyeyeon: It's good.]

1520
01:17:15,200 --> 01:17:17,340
[Yongkyu: You took a lot. All big pieces.]

1521
01:17:17,340 --> 01:17:18,670
[Hyeyeon: I came to a buffet all by myself.]

1522
01:17:18,670 --> 01:17:20,540
[Yongkyu: The outfit is something too.]

1523
01:17:22,140 --> 01:17:24,280
[Hyeyeon: Oh, come on. What are you doing?]

1524
01:17:24,280 --> 01:17:27,210
[Yongkyu: Cute, cute.]

1525
01:17:27,210 --> 01:17:30,420
[Heejin: It's the last meal. I have such
