1526
01:17:30,420 --> 01:17:32,820
[Yongkyu: Is this really the last meal?]

1527
01:17:32,820 --> 01:17:35,220
[Sujin: I can't believe it ends tomorrow.]

1528
01:17:35,220 --> 01:17:37,360
[Jinwoo: What are everyone's thoughts?]

1529
01:17:37,360 --> 01:17:39,230
[Sujin: My thoughts...]

1530
01:17:39,230 --> 01:17:42,700
[Sujin: First of all, thank you
to all seven guests.]

1531
01:17:42,700 --> 01:17:44,830
[Sujin: I don't know if I'll ever meet this many
kind people again...]

1532
01:17:44,830 --> 01:17:48,040
[Sujin: at any future events.]

1533
01:17:48,040 --> 01:17:50,700
[Sujin: I'm really grateful for this time.]

1534
01:17:53,640 --> 01:17:56,580
[Sujin: Sorry, am I the only one talking?]

1535
01:17:56,580 --> 01:17:59,250
[Jinwoo: I feel pretty much the same.]
[Sujin: Right?]

1536
01:17:59,250 --> 01:18:03,250
[Sujin: Can everyone really feel that
we're going home tomorrow?]

1537
01:18:03,250 --> 01:18:05,120
[Jinwoo: No, I can't.]

1538
01:18:05,120 --> 01:18:06,720
[Sujin: I see.]

1539
01:18:06,720 --> 01:18:08,590
[Jinwoo: Because I've gotten so used to
this place already.]

1540
01:18:08,340 --> 01:18:08,670
[Yeah]

1541
01:18:08,590 --> 01:18:11,260
[Jinwoo: The life here and the environment...]

1542
01:18:11,260 --> 01:18:14,730
[Jinwoo: so I don't want to go back
to an unfamiliar place.]

1543
01:18:15,530 --> 01:18:20,330
[Sujin: It was awkward at first, but we've built
friendships over time.]

1544
01:18:20,330 --> 01:18:23,540
[Sujin: I can't help but think,
"I'm going to miss this."]

1545
01:18:23,540 --> 01:18:25,670
[Sujin: "I have to go back to reality again."]

1546
01:18:25,670 --> 01:18:28,340
[Sujin: Can we still be friends after we leave?]

1547
01:18:28,340 --> 01:18:31,810
[Sujin: I hope we can all stay close.]

1548
01:18:32,350 --> 01:18:33,410
[Chaebe: When I first got here,]

1549
01:18:33,410 --> 01:18:37,680
[Chaebe: I thought, "How am I going
to last 7 days here?"]

1550
01:18:37,680 --> 01:18:40,350
[Chaebe: But now that we've built friendships,]

1551
01:18:40,350 --> 01:18:45,690
[Chaebe: I really should have opened up sooner.]

1552
01:18:45,690 --> 01:18:47,290
[Chaebe: That's what I regret.]

1553
01:18:47,560 --> 01:18:52,100
[Unable to part, the members continue
to gather together.]

1554
01:18:48,710 --> 01:18:49,490
Okay.

1555
01:18:52,100 --> 01:18:53,700
[Hyeyeon: Is this all we have on our side?]

1556
01:18:53,700 --> 01:18:55,570
[Hyeyeon: There's so much over there.]
[Jinwoo: Right?]

1557
01:18:56,900 --> 01:18:57,970
[Yongkyu: Should I share some with you?]

1558
01:18:57,970 --> 01:18:59,840
[Jinwoo: Sorry.]
[Hyeyeon: We only have stems left.]

1559
01:18:59,840 --> 01:19:01,440
[Jinwoo: Want some pizza?]

1560
01:19:01,440 --> 01:19:03,580
[Hyeyeon: I'll have crackers and cheese.]
[Jinwoo: Crackers and cheese.]

1561
01:19:03,580 --> 01:19:05,180
[Yongkyu: Give it all to them.]

1562
01:19:05,180 --> 01:19:06,250
[Yongkyu: Over there looks like a banquet hall.]

1563
01:19:08,650 --> 01:19:12,390
[Yongkyu: They don't even have water.]

1564
01:19:10,330 --> 01:19:12,390
-They don't even have water. -We can find some.

1565
01:19:12,390 --> 01:19:15,860
[Yongkyu: Nice.]

1566
01:19:15,860 --> 01:19:19,590
[Jinwoo: You need to go find it.]
[Eunchae: Where did it go?]

1567
01:19:20,390 --> 01:19:21,590
[Oh dear]

1568
01:19:21,590 --> 01:19:22,800
[Hyeyeon: I'll read it and tell you.]
[Eunchae: Read it to me.]

1569
01:19:23,010 --> 01:19:24,360
-What's wrong? -What's wrong? What's wrong?

1570
01:19:23,660 --> 01:19:27,320
[After tonight, the time for choices will come.
If you have any feelings left unexpressed,]

1571
01:19:24,360 --> 01:19:25,810
Curious.

1572
01:19:25,810 --> 01:19:27,260
Hold on. It asks us to express
our feelings right now.

1573
01:19:27,260 --> 01:19:30,400
-What? -If you have any feelings left unexpressed,

1574
01:19:27,320 --> 01:19:30,980
[don't hesitate—express them now.]

1575
01:19:30,400 --> 01:19:31,040
do it right now.

1576
01:19:30,980 --> 01:19:33,300
[Sujin: No, no. That's definitely
something you'd do privately.]

1577
01:19:33,540 --> 01:19:34,140
-Right. -Right.

1578
01:19:33,620 --> 01:19:34,560
[Jinwoo: Yeah. Saying it out of nowhere
here is just too...]

1579
01:19:34,560 --> 01:19:35,500
[Sujin: Suddenly saying it here...]

1580
01:19:35,500 --> 01:19:37,860
[Sujin: I'm going to confess.]

1581
01:19:37,860 --> 01:19:40,860
[Sujin: "Chaebe, actually I've liked you
for a long time." Should I do that?]

1582
01:19:40,960 --> 01:19:42,310
-That's crazy. -"You're my first choice."

1583
01:19:41,060 --> 01:19:42,460
[That's crazy]

1584
01:19:42,310 --> 01:19:42,930
Should we go outside?

1585
01:19:42,660 --> 01:19:44,340
[Should we go outside?]

1586
01:19:42,930 --> 01:19:44,340
"And you're my final choice too."

1587
01:19:44,340 --> 01:19:45,860
[Yongkyu: So should we start looking
for love now?]

1588
01:19:45,860 --> 01:19:47,380
[Sujin: Should we start looking now?]

1589
01:19:47,380 --> 01:19:48,960
[Yongkyu: I've already found mine.]
[Sujin: Should we start looking now?]

1590
01:19:48,960 --> 01:19:51,090
[Chaebe: Let's each say our
first impressions of everyone.]

1591
01:19:51,090 --> 01:19:53,230
[Hyeyeon: First impressions?]
[Jinwoo: This is going to be fun.]

1592
01:19:51,800 --> 01:19:52,130
Yeah.

1593
01:19:53,580 --> 01:19:54,820
[You go first]

1594
01:19:55,460 --> 01:19:56,620
[You go first]

1595
01:19:56,620 --> 01:19:58,420
[Jinwoo: You say it too.]

1596
01:19:58,420 --> 01:20:00,620
[Yongkyu: What?]
[Hyeyeon: Yongkyu, you go first.]

1597
01:20:00,620 --> 01:20:02,300
[Jinwoo: Yeah, Yongkyu, you go first.]
[Yongkyu: First impressions?]

1598
01:20:02,300 --> 01:20:06,040
[Yongkyu: In the order everyone arrived
when I first got here.]

1599
01:20:05,640 --> 01:20:06,260
Which person?

1600
01:20:06,040 --> 01:20:08,440
[Yongkyu: Heejin was sitting in
the corner over there.]

1601
01:20:08,440 --> 01:20:10,040
[Chaebe: Really?]

1602
01:20:10,420 --> 01:20:12,060
[Yongkyu: The person you had in mind]

1603
01:20:12,070 --> 01:20:14,340
[Yongkyu: or someone you didn't talk to much.]

1604
01:20:14,340 --> 01:20:17,810
[Yongkyu: I thought I'd talk to them alone.]

1605
01:20:17,810 --> 01:20:19,680
[Yongkyu: But we all gathered together]

1606
01:20:19,680 --> 01:20:22,620
[Yongkyu: and spent the last day together.]

1607
01:20:22,620 --> 01:20:25,560
[Yongkyu: I could see that some people
had already made up their minds.]

1608
01:20:25,560 --> 01:20:29,030
[Yongkyu: and others were still unsure.]

1609
01:20:29,830 --> 01:20:32,500
[Sujin: Let's go to sleep.]
[Yongkyu: Okay. Time to wrap it up.]

1610
01:20:32,500 --> 01:20:34,360
[Chaebe: I want to keep hanging out.]

1611
01:20:34,360 --> 01:20:37,030
[Hyeyeon: Then come to our 4-person room.]
[Chaebe: Can I?]

1612
01:20:36,240 --> 01:20:36,920
Yeah.

1613
01:20:36,920 --> 01:20:38,530
-Okay. -The 4-person room is always lively.

1614
01:20:37,030 --> 01:20:38,640
[Hyeyeon: The 4-person room is always lively.]

1615
01:20:38,640 --> 01:20:39,700
[Yongkyu: Let's wrap it up then. Anyone who wants]

1616
01:20:39,700 --> 01:20:40,770
[Yongkyu: to hang out after washing up
can gather.]

1617
01:20:40,770 --> 01:20:42,370
[Chaebe: Let's do face masks.]

1618
01:20:42,370 --> 01:20:43,970
[Hyeyeon: Okay. Let's all take a group photo.]

1619
01:20:43,970 --> 01:20:46,640
[Jinwoo: Gather in the 4-person room.]
[Heejin: Gather in the 4-person room?]

1620
01:20:45,940 --> 01:20:46,650
Yeah.

1621
01:20:46,640 --> 01:20:48,510
[Yongkyu: Heejin.]

1622
01:20:48,510 --> 01:20:51,720
[Yongkyu: Come to our room. Come.]

1623
01:20:51,920 --> 01:20:52,980
We'll wait for you.

1624
01:20:54,380 --> 01:20:58,120
[Hyeyeon: Seungho, have you made up your mind?]
[Seungho: No.]

1625
01:20:58,120 --> 01:20:59,460
[Seungho: I'll decide tomorrow.]

1626
01:20:59,460 --> 01:21:01,860
[Hyeyeon: Okay. Go wash up.]

1627
01:21:03,190 --> 01:21:05,330
[Hyeyeon: I don't think he'll pick me.]

1628
01:21:05,330 --> 01:21:08,270
[Hyeyeon: Even though he's currently in
a rough patch with Jinwoo.]

1629
01:21:08,270 --> 01:21:11,740
[Hyeyeon: I know it's precisely because there are
feelings that they're struggling.]

1630
01:21:11,740 --> 01:21:13,870
[Hyeyeon: That's why those emotions arise.]

1631
01:21:13,870 --> 01:21:16,810
[Hyeyeon: If he ends up choosing Jinwoo here,]

1632
01:21:16,810 --> 01:21:19,740
[Hyeyeon: they'll be able to work
those issues out later.]

1633
01:21:20,540 --> 01:21:24,010
[Hyeyeon: So I think he'd pick Jinwoo.]

1634
01:21:25,180 --> 01:21:27,620
[Jinwoo: Have you made up your mind?]

1635
01:21:27,620 --> 01:21:29,060
[Seungho: I don't know.]
[Jinwoo: You don't know?]

1636
01:21:29,060 --> 01:21:31,780
[Seungho: I still don't know.]
[Jinwoo: Really?]

1637
01:21:33,340 --> 01:21:35,220
[Hah]

1638
01:21:36,780 --> 01:21:37,740
[Jinwoo: What?]

1639
01:21:37,740 --> 01:21:38,700
[Seungho: You two asked me the exact
same question.]

1640
01:21:38,700 --> 01:21:40,100
[Jinwoo: Really?]
[Seungho: Yeah.]

1641
01:21:40,100 --> 01:21:42,300
[Jinwoo: That's understandable.]

1642
01:21:42,300 --> 01:21:43,760
[Jinwoo: That's understandable, right?]

1643
01:21:43,760 --> 01:21:45,220
[Seungho: Word for word... "Have you
made up your mind?"]

1644
01:21:45,220 --> 01:21:47,440
[Seungho: Six characters, exactly the same.]

1645
01:21:47,440 --> 01:21:49,660
[Jinwoo: Really? She asked "Have you
made up your mind?" too?]

1646
01:21:49,660 --> 01:21:51,900
[Seungho: We'll see.]

1647
01:21:51,900 --> 01:21:53,640
[Seungho: The people involved should know, right?]

1648
01:21:53,640 --> 01:21:56,050
[Jinwoo: What?]
[Seungho: What?]

1649
01:21:56,050 --> 01:21:57,740
[Jinwoo: Oh...]

1650
01:21:57,740 --> 01:21:59,340
[Jinwoo: So it's not me then?]

1651
01:21:59,340 --> 01:22:00,940
[Seungho: You never know.]

1652
01:22:00,940 --> 01:22:03,080
[Jinwoo: I'm the one involved, but I don't know.]

1653
01:22:03,080 --> 01:22:06,810
[Seungho: That's what I mean. That person
should know, right?]

1654
01:22:06,810 --> 01:22:09,480
[Jinwoo: Oh...]

1655
01:22:09,480 --> 01:22:11,890
[Jinwoo: I don't know anymore.]

1656
01:22:15,090 --> 01:22:17,220
[Jinwoo: Did you answer Hyeyeon?]

1657
01:22:17,220 --> 01:22:20,430
[Seungho: No. I said the same thing—
"I don't know."]

1658
01:22:20,430 --> 01:22:23,360
[Jinwoo: Did you also say "The people
involved should know, right?"]

1659
01:22:23,900 --> 01:22:25,580
[Seungho: I didn't ask that.]

1660
01:22:25,580 --> 01:22:30,340
[Seungho: I hadn't said that yet.
She went to wash up.]

1661
01:22:31,940 --> 01:22:33,860
[Jinwoo: I felt like if I went any deeper,]

1662
01:22:33,860 --> 01:22:35,780
[Jinwoo: it would seem like I was persuading him
to pick me.]

1663
01:22:35,780 --> 01:22:37,650
[Jinwoo: As if Seungho had already
made up his mind]

1664
01:22:37,650 --> 01:22:39,780
[Jinwoo: and I was intentionally
trying to sway him.]

1665
01:22:39,780 --> 01:22:42,190
[Jinwoo: I've already mentally prepared myself.]

1666
01:22:42,190 --> 01:22:46,720
[Jinwoo: I don't have the courage
to change my mind,]

1667
01:22:46,720 --> 01:22:49,130
[Jinwoo: and I don't have the energy left either.]

1668
01:22:49,660 --> 01:22:52,060
[Seungho: It's not that my feelings for Jinwoo
have completely died.]

1669
01:22:52,060 --> 01:22:54,200
[Seungho: Some things happened.]

1670
01:22:54,200 --> 01:22:56,600
[Seungho: I don't know if it's just temporary
hesitation or what.]

1671
01:22:56,600 --> 01:23:00,070
[Seungho: I haven't been able to clearly
control my feelings.]

1672
01:23:00,070 --> 01:23:02,470
[Seungho: So I think I'm a little swayed.]

1673
01:23:03,010 --> 01:23:06,210
[What choice will Seungho make tomorrow?]

1674
01:23:06,740 --> 01:23:08,080
[Sujin: Should we sit on the bed?]

1675
01:23:08,080 --> 01:23:09,540
[Heejin: Is it okay to sit on the bed
in outdoor clothes?]

1676
01:23:09,540 --> 01:23:11,010
[Sujin: Yeah, I don't mind that stuff.]

1677
01:23:11,010 --> 01:23:12,880
[Heejin: I just feel like...]

1678
01:23:12,880 --> 01:23:17,950
[Sujin: It's not easy for you to initiate
conversation with someone, is it?]

1679
01:23:17,950 --> 01:23:23,030
[Heejin: I really don't like to initiate...]

1680
01:23:23,030 --> 01:23:27,560
[Heejin: or start conversations]
[Sujin: Why? Because you've already talked a lot?]

1681
01:23:27,560 --> 01:23:30,230
[Why?]
[Heejin: I just don't want to.]

1682
01:23:30,230 --> 01:23:34,770
[Heejin: This morning...]

1683
01:23:35,040 --> 01:23:42,780
[I felt Eunchae's coldness this morning.]

1684
01:23:35,130 --> 01:23:38,480
I felt it this morning.

1685
01:23:38,480 --> 01:23:41,140
I don't know anymore. Does she even want to talk?

1686
01:23:42,780 --> 01:23:47,320
[Heejin: I feel like she's just
enjoying herself here.]

1687
01:23:47,320 --> 01:23:52,920
[Heejin: Messing around with friends, with
no intention of talking at all.]

1688
01:23:49,940 --> 01:23:52,470
-Messing around with friends. -But I kept...

1689
01:23:53,190 --> 01:23:56,130
[The misunderstanding deepens]

1690
01:23:56,660 --> 01:24:01,100
[Without communication, can this
misunderstanding be resolved?]

1691
01:24:01,100 --> 01:24:03,870
[Sujin: To me, this is more important than
having fun. It's the first thing I need to do.]

1692
01:24:03,870 --> 01:24:06,000
[Sujin: So I kept trying to leave my seat.]

1693
01:24:06,000 --> 01:24:09,210
[Heejin: I could tell.]
[Sujin: See? I kept trying to leave.]

1694
01:24:09,210 --> 01:24:11,340
[Sujin: Why leave so early, especially
when it's almost the end?]

1695
01:24:11,340 --> 01:24:15,080
[Sujin: Even if it's the end, we can still see
each other after it's over.]

1696
01:24:15,080 --> 01:24:19,980
[Sujin: That's not a problem for me. That's not
what matters most to me.]

1697
01:24:21,060 --> 01:24:24,220
[Heejin: We talked a lot during the day.]

1698
01:24:24,220 --> 01:24:27,060
[Sujin: Yeah, we did.]

1699
01:24:27,060 --> 01:24:33,730
[Heejin: Through that conversation, I really felt
how seriously you take this.]

1700
01:24:33,730 --> 01:24:36,400
[Sujin: I even got teary-eyed.]
[Heejin: Yeah.]

1701
01:24:36,400 --> 01:24:42,010
[Sujin: Tearing up and saying,
"This is really how I feel."]

1702
01:24:42,010 --> 01:24:45,750
[Heejin: I don't know yet if I'll get a chance
to talk to Eunchae.]

1703
01:24:45,750 --> 01:24:50,550
[Heejin: Without having talked to her,
and based on how I feel right now,]

1704
01:24:50,550 --> 01:24:55,620
[Heejin: I've pretty much decided what
I'm going to do tomorrow.]

1705
01:24:55,620 --> 01:24:58,560
[Sujin: Then that's fine.]

1706
01:24:58,560 --> 01:25:01,490
[Sujin: I asked you to talk because I was worried
you might feel pressured.]

1707
01:25:01,490 --> 01:25:02,830
[Sujin: I don't mean it that way. It's just]

1708
01:25:02,830 --> 01:25:05,770
[Sujin: you should of course follow your heart
and make your own choice.]

1709
01:25:05,770 --> 01:25:10,570
[Sujin: Whether you pick me or someone else,
I really don't mind.]

1710
01:25:10,570 --> 01:25:13,240
[Sujin: If you turn me down, I'll take
the rejection well.]

1711
01:25:13,240 --> 01:25:15,910
[Sujin: If we end up as final couples,
I'll happily leave with you.]

1712
01:25:15,910 --> 01:25:18,850
[Sujin: Don't worry too much about it.]

1713
01:25:18,850 --> 01:25:23,920
[Heejin: I think I should have a brief
conversation before tomorrow comes.]

1714
01:25:23,920 --> 01:25:27,650
[Heejin: I think it's necessary.]
[Sujin: With Eunchae? Oh, with me?]

1715
01:25:27,650 --> 01:25:30,860
[Sujin: No. Because I think talking with me]

1716
01:25:30,860 --> 01:25:33,790
[Sujin: might affect your final decision.]

1717
01:25:33,790 --> 01:25:37,530
[Sujin: So I think you should definitely
talk to Eunchae too.]

1718
01:25:37,530 --> 01:25:41,530
[Heejin: Even if I don't go talk to Eunchae,]

1719
01:25:41,530 --> 01:25:43,930
[Heejin: I've already made up my mind,
and I can guess what she'd say.]

1720
01:25:43,930 --> 01:25:46,340
[Sujin: Then it doesn't matter.]

1721
01:25:46,340 --> 01:25:50,880
[Heejin: But if Eunchae wants
to talk to me, we can.]

1722
01:25:50,880 --> 01:25:55,680
[Heejin: But even if we do, I don't think]

1723
01:25:55,680 --> 01:26:03,160
[Heejin: my feelings will change that much.]

1724
01:26:03,160 --> 01:26:05,830
[Sujin: I don't know what your
feelings are anyway.]

1725
01:26:05,830 --> 01:26:08,500
[Sujin: Anyway, let's both do well tomorrow.]

1726
01:26:08,500 --> 01:26:11,700
[Sujin: I'll dress up nicely tomorrow.]

1727
01:26:14,630 --> 01:26:17,570
[Heejin: I'll look forward to it.]

1728
01:26:17,570 --> 01:26:20,510
[Sujin: Yeah. Stay tuned. I don't know if we'll
even see each other though.]

1729
01:26:20,510 --> 01:26:23,980
[Sujin: Okay, that's it. Let's go.
I'll walk you out.]

1730
01:26:25,580 --> 01:26:28,250
[Sujin: We cleared up the
misunderstanding too late,]

1731
01:26:28,250 --> 01:26:31,450
[Sujin: and I thought it might be too short]

1732
01:26:31,450 --> 01:26:33,850
[Sujin: of a time to affect
the final choice?]

1733
01:26:33,850 --> 01:26:36,790
[Sujin: That's what I thought.]

1734
01:26:36,790 --> 01:26:38,120
[Heejin: I have two options.]

1735
01:26:38,120 --> 01:26:41,330
[Heejin: But I had already given up
on one of them]

1736
01:26:41,330 --> 01:26:43,200
[Heejin: and reached a final conclusion.]

1737
01:26:43,200 --> 01:26:45,870
[Heejin: Then one side started being
very proactive,]

1738
01:26:45,870 --> 01:26:48,270
[Heejin: showing interest in me.]

1739
01:26:48,270 --> 01:26:50,670
[Heejin: Right now, I'm leaning a bit
toward that side.]

1740
01:26:53,610 --> 01:26:56,010
[On the last night, Heejin's feelings
shift once again.]

1741
01:26:56,420 --> 01:26:59,860
[The last night at BI-LIVE is not over yet]

1742
01:27:03,750 --> 01:27:04,820
[Yongkyu: Have you showered?]

1743
01:27:04,820 --> 01:27:06,950
[Jinwoo: I'm about to go.][Heejin: Oh, what?]

1744
01:27:06,950 --> 01:27:10,160
[Yongkyu: You haven't showered yet?]
[Heejin: I just did.]

1745
01:27:10,660 --> 01:27:12,510
-I'm about to go. -Oh, you really came?

1746
01:27:11,220 --> 01:27:13,090
[Heejin: Oh, you really came?]

1747
01:27:13,090 --> 01:27:15,500
[Jinwoo: Is it cold outside?]
[Chaebe: Yeah, it's cold.]

1748
01:27:15,500 --> 01:27:20,030
[Yongkyu: Honey, I'm here.]
[Hyeyeon: What? You're wearing a face mask?]

1749
01:27:17,870 --> 01:27:18,700
Did you come alone?

1750
01:27:18,700 --> 01:27:19,540
What? You're wearing a face mask?

1751
01:27:19,540 --> 01:27:21,460
-Yes, I'm here. -Hello.

1752
01:27:20,030 --> 01:27:23,500
[Hyeyeon: Oh, hello.]
[Chaebe: Hello.]

1753
01:27:21,460 --> 01:27:22,910
Hello.

1754
01:27:23,500 --> 01:27:27,240
[Heejin: You came?]
[Jinwoo: You came?]

1755
01:27:26,740 --> 01:27:28,400
-Hello. -I want to do a face mask too.

1756
01:27:27,240 --> 01:27:28,840
[Sujin: I want to do one too.]

1757
01:27:28,400 --> 01:27:30,390
-You look really pretty without makeup. -Right?

1758
01:27:28,840 --> 01:27:30,440
[Jinwoo: You look really pretty
without makeup though.]

1759
01:27:30,440 --> 01:27:32,580
[Jinwoo: Your skin is so nice.]
[Heejin: You're so pretty.]

1760
01:27:34,710 --> 01:27:36,500
[Yongkyu: What?]

1761
01:27:36,500 --> 01:27:38,180
[Eunchae: Nothing. Don't laugh.]

1762
01:27:38,180 --> 01:27:39,790
[Yongkyu: What?]
[Eunchae: Stop being funny. Really.]

1763
01:27:38,350 --> 01:27:39,790
-Stop being funny. Really. -What?

1764
01:27:39,790 --> 01:27:42,860
[Chaebe: This is my first time seeing this.]
[Eunchae: Stop being funny.]

1765
01:27:42,860 --> 01:27:44,100
[Yongkyu: What?]

1766
01:27:44,100 --> 01:27:48,900
[Chaebe: He's the one who took it.]

1767
01:27:48,900 --> 01:27:51,840
[Yongkyu: Let me see.]

1768
01:27:51,840 --> 01:27:53,660
[Eunchae: Stop being funny.]

1769
01:27:53,820 --> 01:27:56,060
[Startled]

1770
01:28:00,620 --> 01:28:03,320
[Hyeyeon: Oh, that's so funny.]
[Yongkyu: Hey, delete that photo.]

1771
01:28:03,320 --> 01:28:05,720
[Chaebe: He's the one who took it.]
[Seungho: Post it.]

1772
01:28:05,720 --> 01:28:08,660
[Eunchae: If you're going to delete
something, delete this one first.]

1773
01:28:08,660 --> 01:28:09,990
[Yongkyu: Delete that photo.]

1774
01:28:10,380 --> 01:28:13,060
[Yongkyu: The moments I regret...]

1775
01:28:13,060 --> 01:28:19,330
[Yongkyu: Even if it was awkward at first
and I didn't like the vibe.]

1776
01:28:19,330 --> 01:28:22,540
[Yongkyu: I should have gathered the courage
to talk to her more proactively.]

1777
01:28:22,540 --> 01:28:26,540
[Yongkyu: Fight for a better
date opportunity.]

1778
01:28:26,540 --> 01:28:30,010
[Yongkyu: When I had the chance to go on
a date with Hyeyeon,]

1779
01:28:30,010 --> 01:28:32,150
[Yongkyu: I should have been more proactive]

1780
01:28:32,150 --> 01:28:36,150
[Yongkyu: in choosing her. I regret that.]

1781
01:28:36,150 --> 01:28:38,820
[Sujin: Are we going to sleep here?]

1782
01:28:38,820 --> 01:28:40,690
[Hyeyeon: Let's all sleep here together.]

1783
01:28:42,820 --> 01:28:45,760
[Heejin walks toward a certain place]

1784
01:28:46,290 --> 01:28:48,430
[Heejin: Since it's the last night,]

1785
01:28:48,430 --> 01:28:51,360
[Heejin: Eunchae was really into talking
with friends]

1786
01:28:51,360 --> 01:28:54,830
[Heejin: and I thought they'd probably
stay up all night talking.]

1787
01:28:54,830 --> 01:28:58,300
[Heejin: So I quietly put on my clothes and
went out to find a place to sleep.]

1788
01:28:58,300 --> 01:29:00,970
[Heejin: I ended up sleeping in the secret room.]

1789
01:29:00,970 --> 01:29:02,580
[Heejin: Just in case Eunchae might contact me,]

1790
01:29:02,580 --> 01:29:06,310
[Heejin: in case she wanted to talk before
I went to sleep,]

1791
01:29:06,310 --> 01:29:10,460
[Heejin: I kept my phone next to my pillow.]

1792
01:29:11,120 --> 01:29:15,660
[Eunchae: Heejin suddenly disappeared
at some point.]

1793
01:29:15,660 --> 01:29:18,590
[Eunchae: And that day, I happened to]

1794
01:29:18,590 --> 01:29:20,990
[Eunchae: have used up all my SBM Talk limits.]

1795
01:29:20,990 --> 01:29:24,200
[Eunchae: So I couldn't contact her.]

1796
01:29:24,200 --> 01:29:29,000
[Eunchae: For various reasons, things didn't
go well that day.]

1797
01:29:29,540 --> 01:29:35,140
[Even on the last night at BI-LIVE, they keep
missing each other.]

1798
01:29:35,410 --> 01:29:39,410
[The last day at BI-LIVE]

1799
01:29:40,750 --> 01:29:43,420
[Heejin wakes up first]

1800
01:29:43,950 --> 01:29:46,620
[Heejin: Since it's the last day,]

1801
01:29:46,620 --> 01:29:49,290
[Heejin: I want to prepare well.]

1802
01:29:49,290 --> 01:29:51,690
[Heejin: At the same time, I'm also thinking]

1803
01:29:51,690 --> 01:29:54,890
[Heejin: whether I'll get a chance to
talk to Eunchae today.]

1804
01:29:54,890 --> 01:29:57,030
[Heejin: I have that thought too.]

1805
01:29:57,030 --> 01:30:01,030
[Heejin: Maybe we can talk today?
Something like that?]

1806
01:30:02,900 --> 01:30:06,910
[After hearing Heejin getting ready, the other
members also start waking up.]

1807
01:30:09,840 --> 01:30:11,710
[Heejin: Good morning, everyone.]

1808
01:30:11,710 --> 01:30:13,310
[Hyeyeon: Yeah.]

1809
01:30:14,300 --> 01:30:16,900
[Hyeyeon: But sis, did you go somewhere?]

1810
01:30:16,900 --> 01:30:19,340
[Heejin: I slept alone in the secret room.]

1811
01:30:19,500 --> 01:30:20,860
[Oh~]

1812
01:30:21,590 --> 01:30:23,720
[Heejin: I was so tired last night.]

1813
01:30:23,720 --> 01:30:25,860
[Heejin: What time did you guys go to sleep?]

1814
01:30:25,860 --> 01:30:29,060
[Hyeyeon: What time did we sleep last night?]

1815
01:30:29,060 --> 01:30:31,460
[Seungho: Around 3?]

1816
01:30:38,400 --> 01:30:40,540
[Jinwoo: I can't believe it's already
the last day.]

1817
01:30:40,540 --> 01:30:42,410
[Jinwoo: The final choice is actually today.]

1818
01:30:42,410 --> 01:30:44,010
[Jinwoo: Whether it's in a few tens
of minutes or a few hours,]

1819
01:30:44,010 --> 01:30:46,150
[Jinwoo: I have to make a choice.]

1820
01:30:46,150 --> 01:30:48,550
[Jinwoo: Should I talk to Seungho a little?]

1821
01:30:48,550 --> 01:30:49,620
[Jinwoo: I kind of regret it?]

1822
01:30:54,950 --> 01:30:57,620
[Seungho: I thought it would be a long time,
but now that I'm in it,]

1823
01:30:57,620 --> 01:31:00,290
[Seungho: I realize it was actually
a really short time.]

1824
01:31:00,290 --> 01:31:04,560
[Seungho: Everything will be decided today.
Thinking about that makes me a little nervous.]

1825
01:31:08,570 --> 01:31:10,170
[Hyeyeon: I opened my eyes]

1826
01:31:10,170 --> 01:31:13,910
[Hyeyeon: and realized I have to make
the final choice today. It really is the end.]

1827
01:31:14,440 --> 01:31:18,180
[Hyeyeon: My heart feels a bit unsettled,
and I'm nervous too.]

1828
01:31:18,420 --> 01:31:21,700
[Tae Eunchae, Lim Chaebe, Koo Yongkyu]

1829
01:31:22,720 --> 01:31:26,190
[After waking up, Eunchae starts packing
her things early.]

1830
01:31:27,250 --> 01:31:30,190
[Eunchae: I'm sad to leave, but]

1831
01:31:30,190 --> 01:31:33,660
[Eunchae: I plan to follow my heart
and have no regrets.]

1832
01:31:33,660 --> 01:31:35,800
[Eunchae: Since it's the final choice,]

1833
01:31:35,800 --> 01:31:39,530
[Eunchae: no matter what choice
the other person makes]

1834
01:31:39,530 --> 01:31:43,270
[Eunchae: I'll try to take it in stride.
That's my plan.]

1835
01:31:49,410 --> 01:31:52,080
[Chaebe: I feel really sad to leave, you know?]

1836
01:31:52,080 --> 01:31:54,480
[Chaebe: And I kind of don't want to go.]

1837
01:31:54,480 --> 01:31:59,290
[Chaebe: Playing together, having
dinner together...]

1838
01:31:59,290 --> 01:32:00,090
[Chaebe: going on dates...]

1839
01:32:00,890 --> 01:32:03,020
[Chaebe: I just feel sad.]

1840
01:32:05,960 --> 01:32:07,940
[Eunchae: Hey.]

1841
01:32:14,780 --> 01:32:16,900
[Getting up]

1842
01:32:19,840 --> 01:32:23,310
[Yongkyu: Really, thinking about how
this is the last morning...]

1843
01:32:23,310 --> 01:32:25,980
[Yongkyu: I feel so sad.]

1844
01:32:29,980 --> 01:32:31,850
[Yongkyu: It's already the last day,]

1845
01:32:31,850 --> 01:32:34,250
[Yongkyu: and I've spent the last night here.]

1846
01:32:34,790 --> 01:32:36,390
[Yongkyu: I feel a strange mix of emotions.]

1847
01:32:36,390 --> 01:32:38,520
[Yongkyu: I feel both relieved and melancholic.]

1848
01:32:38,520 --> 01:32:40,130
[Yongkyu: Who should I choose?]

1849
01:32:40,390 --> 01:32:42,500
[Yongkyu: That's what I was thinking about.]

1850
01:32:42,500 --> 01:32:45,700
[Go Sujin]

1851
01:32:52,780 --> 01:32:55,610
[Sujin: On the first day, time felt so slow.]

1852
01:32:55,610 --> 01:32:59,080
[Sujin: I thought, "How am I going to
last 6 days?"]

1853
01:32:59,080 --> 01:33:01,750
[Sujin: After that, time flew by.]

1854
01:33:01,750 --> 01:33:04,680
[Sujin: I'm so sad. Now I have
to go back to reality.]

1855
01:33:04,680 --> 01:33:07,620
[Sujin: That's how I feel.]

1856
01:33:14,290 --> 01:33:18,300
[Hyeyeon brings Seungho's swimsuit over too]

1857
01:33:20,170 --> 01:33:22,300
[Seungho: Oh, long time no see.]

1858
01:33:22,300 --> 01:33:24,700
[Hyeyeon: It's all dried now, sir.]

1859
01:33:24,700 --> 01:33:27,640
[Hyeyeon: You'll be paying, right?]
[Seungho: I don't have anywhere to put it.]

1860
01:33:27,640 --> 01:33:31,110
[Hyeyeon: Then what should we do?]
[Seungho: Please throw it away for me.]

1861
01:33:31,110 --> 01:33:32,980
[Hyeyeon: I can't do that.]

1862
01:33:34,580 --> 01:33:36,450
[Hyeyeon: I'm doomed with packing.]

1863
01:33:36,980 --> 01:33:39,650
[Hyeyeon: I planned to try my best
until the very end.]

1864
01:33:40,190 --> 01:33:42,590
[Hyeyeon: But I ended up busy with other things,]

1865
01:33:42,590 --> 01:33:44,460
[Hyeyeon: and couldn't actively show
interest in him.]

1866
01:33:44,460 --> 01:33:47,660
[Hyeyeon: But I still wanted him to know]

1867
01:33:47,660 --> 01:33:49,260
[Hyeyeon: that I haven't given up on you.]

1868
01:33:49,260 --> 01:33:51,930
[Hyeyeon: When Seungho looked around,
I'd ask what he was looking for.]

1869
01:33:52,470 --> 01:33:54,600
[Hyeyeon: When he ran into trouble,
I'd say "I'll help you"]

1870
01:33:54,600 --> 01:33:56,740
[Hyeyeon: and then go help him.]

1871
01:33:57,540 --> 01:34:01,700
[While Seungho and Hyeyeon are packing]

1872
01:34:03,700 --> 01:34:05,300
[A glance]

1873
01:34:03,790 --> 01:34:05,390
-Dear. -Thank you.

1874
01:34:06,540 --> 01:34:07,680
[Jinwoo: At first, seeing them together like that]

1875
01:34:07,680 --> 01:34:09,280
[Jinwoo: made me feel uneasy and jealous.]

1876
01:34:09,280 --> 01:34:12,220
[Jinwoo: Now, when I see that kind of scene.]

1877
01:34:12,220 --> 01:34:14,350
[Jinwoo: He and I fought a lot.]

1878
01:34:14,350 --> 01:34:17,020
[Jinwoo: But it seems like he doesn't have
that kind of friction with Hyeyeon.]

1879
01:34:17,290 --> 01:34:19,690
[Jinwoo: So rather than the happiness I gave him,]

1880
01:34:19,690 --> 01:34:24,230
[Jinwoo: Seungho might prefer the happiness
Hyeyeon gives him.]

1881
01:34:24,230 --> 01:34:25,830
[Jinwoo: That's what I thought.]

1882
01:34:26,370 --> 01:34:30,100
[What choices will these three make today?]

1883
01:34:31,170 --> 01:34:35,710
[Meanwhile, Eunchae is already ready
to leave BI-LIVE.]

1884
01:34:36,080 --> 01:34:40,250
[Eunchae: Did you sleep well? I didn't
see you last night.]

1885
01:34:40,780 --> 01:34:43,450
[Eunchae: The day before, I used up
all my SBM Talk limits,]

1886
01:34:43,450 --> 01:34:45,590
[Eunchae: so I couldn't contact her.]

1887
01:34:45,590 --> 01:34:47,990
[Eunchae: She suddenly disappeared last night,
and I was worried.]

1888
01:34:47,990 --> 01:34:51,460
[Eunchae: That's what I sent in the SBM Talk.]

1889
01:34:51,560 --> 01:34:52,300
Me?

1890
01:34:52,870 --> 01:34:54,290
Yes, I'll try it on myself.

1891
01:34:54,290 --> 01:34:55,950
-Feel it before you buy. -Yes.

1892
01:34:56,800 --> 01:34:58,260
[Eunchae: Did you sleep well?
I didn't see you last night.]

1893
01:34:58,260 --> 01:34:59,730
[Heejin: Would she contact me?
I wondered...]

1894
01:34:59,730 --> 01:35:01,870
[Heejin: but I didn't expect her
to actually reach out.]

1895
01:35:01,870 --> 01:35:05,660
[Heejin: I thought she wouldn't,
so I was really surprised.]

1896
01:35:05,660 --> 01:35:06,500
[Eunchae: Did you sleep well?
I didn't see you last night.]

1897
01:35:06,500 --> 01:35:07,340
[Heejin: Eunchae, I'm busy packing.
Let's go talk in the living room?]

1898
01:35:07,340 --> 01:35:10,900
[Before the final choice, Heejin suggests
talking to Eunchae.]

1899
01:35:10,900 --> 01:35:12,550
[Heejin: Did you sleep well last night?]

1900
01:35:12,550 --> 01:35:15,210
[Eunchae: Yeah. I slept better than I expected.]

1901
01:35:15,210 --> 01:35:18,950
[Eunchae: I didn't sleep long, but I'm not tired.]

1902
01:35:18,950 --> 01:35:20,290
[Heejin: You look really pretty today?]

1903
01:35:19,120 --> 01:35:21,330
Yes. I really like this outfit today too.

1904
01:35:20,290 --> 01:35:23,760
[Eunchae: Yes. I really like this
outfit today too.]

1905
01:35:21,330 --> 01:35:23,550
Really.

1906
01:35:23,760 --> 01:35:27,760
[Heejin: After we spent the night in the secret
room, were you happy the next day?]

1907
01:35:27,680 --> 01:35:29,050
-Yeah. Why? -Really?

1908
01:35:27,760 --> 01:35:30,700
[Eunchae: Yeah. Why? Did I look unhappy?]
[Heejin: Oh, really?]

1909
01:35:30,700 --> 01:35:33,630
[Heejin: No, I'm saying... hi.]

1910
01:35:33,630 --> 01:35:35,230
[Heejin: "Did you sleep well?" I said that...]

1911
01:35:35,230 --> 01:35:37,640
[Heejin: but you didn't respond.]
[Eunchae: Really?]

1912
01:35:37,640 --> 01:35:39,240
[Heejin: I was wondering, "Did she not hear me?"]

1913
01:35:39,240 --> 01:35:41,370
[Heejin: and then you walked away without
even looking at me.]

1914
01:35:41,370 --> 01:35:42,980
[Heejin: You just left.]

1915
01:35:42,980 --> 01:35:46,710
[Eunchae: Oh, I do feel like I should
explain that.]

1916
01:35:46,710 --> 01:35:48,580
[Eunchae: Because at that time,]

1917
01:35:48,580 --> 01:35:51,250
[Eunchae: I was busy preparing some things]

1918
01:35:51,250 --> 01:35:53,820
[Eunchae: so I quickly went back to get ready.]

1919
01:35:53,820 --> 01:35:56,180
[Eunchae: I thought you might misunderstand too.]

1920
01:35:56,180 --> 01:36:01,930
[Eunchae: But then during the meal,
we were sitting far apart]

1921
01:36:01,930 --> 01:36:06,470
[Eunchae: so I didn't get a chance
to explain. I'm sorry.]

1922
01:36:06,470 --> 01:36:07,800
[Heejin: Oh, so that's why...]

1923
01:36:07,800 --> 01:36:09,940
[Heejin: Because I felt like]

1924
01:36:10,470 --> 01:36:13,940
[Heejin: you were avoiding me,]

1925
01:36:13,940 --> 01:36:17,340
[Heejin: so I thought maybe something
had upset you.]

1926
01:36:17,340 --> 01:36:18,820
[Eunchae: You were really bothered by it.]
[Heejin: Yeah.]

1927
01:36:18,820 --> 01:36:22,260
[Heejin: So I thought you were
using your attitude]

1928
01:36:22,260 --> 01:36:25,100
[Heejin: to show how you felt about
the secret room date.]

1929
01:36:25,100 --> 01:36:27,940
[I thought that might be the case]

1930
01:36:27,940 --> 01:36:30,080
[Eunchae: No, that's not it at all.]

1931
01:36:30,080 --> 01:36:34,610
[Eunchae: That's why I noticed you were gone]

1932
01:36:34,610 --> 01:36:37,550
[Eunchae: when we were all sitting
around talking last night]

1933
01:36:38,080 --> 01:36:39,420
[Eunchae: I was going to send you
an SBM Talk, you know?]

1934
01:36:39,420 --> 01:36:43,160
[Eunchae: I was going to ask where you were
and what you were doing.]

1935
01:36:43,160 --> 01:36:46,630
[Eunchae: but I had used up
all my SBM Talk limits.]

1936
01:36:46,630 --> 01:36:51,430
[Eunchae: And sending you a message from
someone else's phone felt a bit weird.]

1937
01:36:51,430 --> 01:36:55,700
[Eunchae: So I asked you this morning
if you slept well.]

1938
01:36:55,700 --> 01:37:00,240
[Eunchae: I was bothered by it too,
but I missed the timing.]

1939
01:37:00,240 --> 01:37:02,640
[Heejin: You wanted to talk to me last night?]

1940
01:37:02,640 --> 01:37:07,450
[Eunchae: Yeah. That's why I was looking for you.]
[Heejin: Oh, really? Why didn't you say anything?]

1941
01:37:07,450 --> 01:37:11,180
[Heejin: You were looking for me?]
[Eunchae: Yeah. That's what I just said.]

1942
01:37:12,520 --> 01:37:13,850
[Eunchae: Where did you go last night?
I still don't know.]

1943
01:37:13,850 --> 01:37:15,190
[Heejin: Last night?]

1944
01:37:15,190 --> 01:37:18,120
[Heejin: Here's what happened...]

1945
01:37:18,120 --> 01:37:19,730
[Heejin: Because you seemed a little...]

1946
01:37:19,730 --> 01:37:25,330
[Heejin: I thought you weren't planning
to talk to me before the end,]

1947
01:37:25,330 --> 01:37:28,800
[Heejin: so I was going to go to sleep last night
but everyone was sleeping in my room.]

1948
01:37:28,800 --> 01:37:33,070
[Heejin: I had nowhere to sleep, so I went
to the secret room alone.]

1949
01:37:33,070 --> 01:37:34,940
[Eunchae: You slept there the whole time?]
[Heejin: Yeah.]

1950
01:37:34,940 --> 01:37:37,880
[Heejin: I was afraid you might contact me
in the middle of the night.]

1951
01:37:37,880 --> 01:37:40,550
[Heejin: So I kept my phone next to me.]

1952
01:37:43,750 --> 01:37:45,420
[Eunchae: I'm so sorry.]

1953
01:37:45,420 --> 01:37:48,550
[Heejin: It's okay.]
[Eunchae: I'm sorry.]

1954
01:37:48,550 --> 01:37:51,060
[Eunchae: I should have...]

1955
01:37:51,060 --> 01:37:54,960
[Eunchae: found a way to contact you
and been more attentive.]

1956
01:37:55,420 --> 01:37:59,500
[Eunchae: I was trying in my own way,]

1957
01:37:59,500 --> 01:38:04,040
[Eunchae: but I didn't realize she was that
troubled and worried about it.]

1958
01:38:04,040 --> 01:38:07,510
[Eunchae: I feel really bad.]

1959
01:38:07,510 --> 01:38:13,110
[Eunchae: I regret not being more
attentive to her.]

1960
01:38:13,380 --> 01:38:17,380
[Eunchae: I'm sorry. I'm sorry.]
[Heejin: It's okay.]

1961
01:38:17,920 --> 01:38:22,720
[Heejin: I was surprised. Eunchae
seemed so genuinely sorry.]

1962
01:38:22,720 --> 01:38:24,320
[Heejin: She said she didn't mean to...]

1963
01:38:24,320 --> 01:38:26,990
[Heejin: and that she should have been
more attentive.]

1964
01:38:26,990 --> 01:38:33,670
[Heejin: She was whining like a cat caught
in the rain. It was cute.]

1965
01:38:34,260 --> 01:38:38,780
[Heejin: But I should have asked too—
"Eunchae, do you want to talk?"]

1966
01:38:38,780 --> 01:38:41,410
[Heejin: I'm also at fault.]
[Eunchae: No, you're not.]

1967
01:38:41,410 --> 01:38:44,880
[Heejin: But really, the day
after the secret room...]

1968
01:38:44,880 --> 01:38:46,210
[Heejin: I thought you felt that way about me]

1969
01:38:46,210 --> 01:38:49,420
[Heejin: that's really what I thought.]

1970
01:38:49,420 --> 01:38:51,020
[Eunchae: No, I...]

1971
01:38:51,020 --> 01:38:57,260
[Heejin: And in that process, I was
spending time with Sujin]

1972
01:38:57,260 --> 01:39:03,260
[Heejin: and Sujin kept being really
proactive with me.]

1973
01:39:03,260 --> 01:39:05,120
[Eunchae: What kind of things?]

1974
01:39:05,120 --> 01:39:08,590
[Heejin: She said she'd keep being direct
with me.]

1975
01:39:09,660 --> 01:39:11,800
[Eunchae: But I'm also... I'm also very direct.]

1976
01:39:12,140 --> 01:39:17,400
[Eunchae: Like Sujin, I'm also very direct.]

1977
01:39:17,620 --> 01:39:21,380
[Heejin: So your feelings really haven't changed?]

1978
01:39:21,230 --> 01:39:22,630
-Right? -Yeah.

1979
01:39:21,380 --> 01:39:22,820
[Eunchae: Yeah.]

1980
01:39:22,820 --> 01:39:25,780
[Eunchae: I think you're the person it's okay
to change feelings for...]

1981
01:39:25,780 --> 01:39:29,460
[Eunchae: but I didn't take the initiative
to talk to you first.]

1982
01:39:29,820 --> 01:39:33,060
[Eunchae: I feel really sorry about that.]

1983
01:39:33,060 --> 01:39:35,420
[Heejin: Oh, but really, don't say sorry anymore.]

1984
01:39:33,110 --> 01:39:35,420
-Oh, but really, don't say sorry anymore. -No, no.

1985
01:39:35,420 --> 01:39:39,100
[Eunchae: Should I stop saying it?]
[Heejin: Yeah. Stop saying it. It's okay.]

1986
01:39:39,100 --> 01:39:40,700
[Eunchae: No, I really am sorry.]

1987
01:39:40,700 --> 01:39:47,370
[Heejin: Let's just say our timing was off.]

1988
01:39:47,480 --> 01:39:48,460
Both of us.

1989
01:39:50,580 --> 01:39:53,260
[Heejin: Thank you for asking to talk to me.]

1990
01:39:53,780 --> 01:39:55,780
[Eunchae: No, thank you for accepting.]

1991
01:39:55,790 --> 01:39:57,390
[Heejin: But you look really good today.]

1992
01:39:57,390 --> 01:39:58,990
[Eunchae: Really? You too.]

1993
01:40:01,400 --> 01:40:02,460
[Heejin: Let's go first.]

1994
01:40:02,460 --> 01:40:03,270
[Eunchae: Let's go?]

1995
01:40:07,020 --> 01:40:09,540
[Eunchae: I'm glad I reached out.]

1996
01:40:09,540 --> 01:40:10,880
[Eunchae: If I hadn't...]

1997
01:40:10,880 --> 01:40:13,810
[Eunchae: even though it's the last day]

1998
01:40:14,080 --> 01:40:17,020
[Eunchae: I think we might not have]

1999
01:40:17,020 --> 01:40:19,060
[Eunchae: even had a conversation.]

2000
01:40:19,060 --> 01:40:23,900
[Eunchae: So I'm really glad we got this
one last chance to talk.]

2001
01:40:23,900 --> 01:40:26,220
[Heejin: Her feelings haven't changed.]

2002
01:40:26,220 --> 01:40:29,160
[Heejin: I could feel it.]

2003
01:40:29,160 --> 01:40:31,290
[Heejin: Her sincere feelings.]

2004
01:40:31,560 --> 01:40:35,560
[Heejin: In this process, I also saw
her mature side.]

2005
01:40:37,170 --> 01:40:40,640
[Yongkyu: Let's go, everyone.]
[Chaebe: We're fast. Our trio.]

2006
01:40:41,620 --> 01:40:43,310
[Yongkyu: You have so much luggage?]

2007
01:40:43,840 --> 01:40:46,510
[Now it's time to leave BI-LIVE]

2008
01:40:47,040 --> 01:40:48,640
[Eunchae: How am I going to carry this down?]

2009
01:40:48,640 --> 01:40:50,780
[Yongkyu: Put it down here first.
I'll carry it down for you.]

2010
01:40:51,420 --> 01:40:52,780
[Eunchae: It's heavy.]

2011
01:40:57,500 --> 01:41:00,390
[Chaebe: Oh, it's not that heavy.]

2012
01:41:00,820 --> 01:41:05,730
[Sujin is also ready to leave]

2013
01:41:13,470 --> 01:41:18,540
[One by one, they leave BI-LIVE...]

2014
01:41:23,170 --> 01:41:24,050
So scary!

2015
01:41:24,410 --> 01:41:28,950
[Leaving the memories of BI-LIVE
behind]

2016
01:41:27,220 --> 01:41:28,450
In weird places...

2017
01:41:32,100 --> 01:41:34,140
I'm the kind of person who would do this too.

2018
01:41:32,420 --> 01:41:36,690
[Members facing their final choice]

2019
01:41:38,830 --> 01:41:43,370
[What choices will they make
after the countless sincere feelings at BI-LIVE?]

2020
01:41:43,630 --> 01:41:46,870
[Time for the final choice]

2021
01:41:47,780 --> 01:41:51,100
[Time to confess. Do you want to convey
your feelings to the other person? GO / BACK]

2022
01:41:53,240 --> 01:41:55,640
[Heejin: I was agonizing over it this morning.]

2023
01:41:55,640 --> 01:41:59,110
[Heejin: But my choice is pretty much set now.]

2024
01:41:59,650 --> 01:42:04,190
[Eunchae: Relax. Just like your mindset
that morning.]

2025
01:42:04,190 --> 01:42:05,250
[Eunchae: Just relax.]

2026
01:42:05,250 --> 01:42:08,190
[Eunchae: Anyway, you've done all you can.]

2027
01:42:08,190 --> 01:42:10,060
[Eunchae: Just wait for the choice.]

2028
01:42:10,590 --> 01:42:14,860
[Sujin: Actually, even though my feelings
are already firm...]

2029
01:42:14,860 --> 01:42:18,330
[Sujin: Anyway, it probably won't be me.
Should I just step back?]

2030
01:42:18,330 --> 01:42:20,200
[Sujin: I had this thought.]

2031
01:42:20,740 --> 01:42:23,410
[Chaebe: It's really the end now.]

2032
01:42:24,210 --> 01:42:27,410
[Yongkyu: Thinking "Is one week... too short?"]

2033
01:42:27,410 --> 01:42:29,810
[Yongkyu: while I pressed the button.]

2034
01:42:30,880 --> 01:42:32,210
[Seungho: I'm a bit conflicted.]

2035
01:42:32,210 --> 01:42:35,680
[Seungho: I don't know how to choose now.]

2036
01:42:36,220 --> 01:42:38,890
[Jinwoo: I'm really torn. Anyway, I...]

2037
01:42:38,890 --> 01:42:41,290
[Jinwoo: Since I gave up talking to Seungho,]

2038
01:42:41,290 --> 01:42:45,290
[Jinwoo: I kind of gave up on winning him back.]

2039
01:42:45,290 --> 01:42:49,030
[Jinwoo: In this state, wouldn't it be better
to just not confess?]

2040
01:42:49,030 --> 01:42:50,630
[Jinwoo: Just choosing BACK.]

2041
01:42:50,630 --> 01:42:53,300
[Jinwoo: Would my choice make me hurt less?]

2042
01:42:53,300 --> 01:42:54,640
[Jinwoo: Because compared to being rejected,]

2043
01:42:54,640 --> 01:42:56,770
[Jinwoo: it would feel better
if I'm the one rejecting.]

2044
01:42:59,710 --> 01:43:01,580
[Hyeyeon: Even if it won't work out,
I'll choose GO.]

2045
01:43:09,850 --> 01:43:15,460
[Now it's time
for the final choice]

2046
01:43:15,990 --> 01:43:24,530
[Who will find
true love?]

2047
01:43:35,980 --> 01:43:38,150
[Seungho: I pressed GO first.]

2048
01:43:38,150 --> 01:43:39,480
[Seungho: I was a bit troubled.]

2049
01:43:39,480 --> 01:43:43,220
[Seungho: I didn't know how to choose.]

2050
01:43:43,220 --> 01:43:45,620
[Seungho: But I still wanted to make a decision.]

2051
01:43:45,620 --> 01:43:47,490
[Seungho: Where my heart would go...]

2052
01:43:47,490 --> 01:43:50,160
[Seungho: I didn't even know it myself
at the time.]

2053
01:43:50,160 --> 01:43:52,560
[Seungho: But I still felt I needed to be
in that situation first.]

2054
01:43:52,560 --> 01:43:54,160
[Seungho: So I pressed it.]

2055
01:43:54,960 --> 01:43:59,230
[Who will Seungho choose?]

2056
01:44:01,900 --> 01:44:05,640
[Hyeyeon, who is always actively
approaching Seungho?]

2057
01:44:08,840 --> 01:44:12,580
[Jinwoo, who chose Seungho
from beginning to end?]

2058
01:44:12,580 --> 01:44:13,920
[Jinwoo: The reason I pressed GO is...]

2059
01:44:13,920 --> 01:44:17,120
[Jinwoo:  Anyway, because I like Seungho...]

2060
01:44:17,120 --> 01:44:19,520
[Jinwoo: That's why I agonized so much.]

2061
01:44:19,520 --> 01:44:21,920
[Jinwoo: I kept thinking about him.]

2062
01:44:21,920 --> 01:44:25,930
[Jinwoo: So I kept choosing him up until now.]

2063
01:44:25,930 --> 01:44:29,930
[Jinwoo: I think with these feelings,
I have to confess to him.]

2064
01:44:30,470 --> 01:44:34,740
[Who will be the first to come to Seungho?]

2065
01:44:41,500 --> 01:44:43,140
[Seungho: I looked to the right.]

2066
01:44:43,140 --> 01:44:45,810
[Seungho: I saw a familiar silhouette.]

2067
01:44:45,810 --> 01:44:48,480
[Seungho: I thought, "Jinwoo is here."]

2068
01:44:48,480 --> 01:44:51,950
[Seungho: "He came to me first."]

2069
01:44:53,280 --> 01:44:55,420
[Jinwoo: Hello.]

2070
01:44:55,420 --> 01:44:57,020
[Seungho: Hi.]

2071
01:44:59,420 --> 01:45:02,740
[Jinwoo: After getting closer...
we greeted each other.]

2072
01:45:02,740 --> 01:45:04,610
[Jinwoo: I felt his expression wasn't very good.]

2073
01:45:04,610 --> 01:45:07,280
[Jinwoo: Ah... looks like I'm
going to be rejected.]

2074
01:45:07,280 --> 01:45:09,690
[Jinwoo: The atmosphere wasn't great.]

2075
01:45:09,690 --> 01:45:11,550
[Jinwoo: It wasn't a fluttering atmosphere either.]

2076
01:45:12,620 --> 01:45:15,290
[Seungho: I said it yesterday...]

2077
01:45:15,290 --> 01:45:17,430
[Jinwoo: What? Seems like...]

2078
01:45:18,490 --> 01:45:20,360
[Jinwoo: If you don't give a clear answer here,]

2079
01:45:20,360 --> 01:45:22,230
[Jinwoo: I won't know after it's over?]

2080
01:45:22,760 --> 01:45:24,100
[Seungho: Yeah.]

2081
01:45:24,100 --> 01:45:27,040
[Seungho: But we haven't talked even once.]

2082
01:45:28,100 --> 01:45:31,310
[Jinwoo: Anyway, no matter how much I talked...]

2083
01:45:31,310 --> 01:45:34,510
[Jinwoo: I mean...]

2084
01:45:34,510 --> 01:45:36,380
[Jinwoo: Only one.]

2085
01:45:40,650 --> 01:45:43,320
[Seungho: Seems like you're not sad at all.]

2086
01:45:43,320 --> 01:45:46,520
[Jinwoo: Because I expected it.]

2087
01:45:46,520 --> 01:45:48,920
[Seungho: If you expected it,
why didn't you talk to me?]

2088
01:45:49,730 --> 01:45:51,590
[Jinwoo: I didn't talk to you
because I expected it.]

2089
01:45:58,800 --> 01:46:03,070
[Hyeyeon approaching the two]

2090
01:46:03,460 --> 01:46:06,540
[Hyeyeon: I kept walking up the red trail.]

2091
01:46:06,540 --> 01:46:08,410
[Hyeyeon: I felt someone was there.]

2092
01:46:08,410 --> 01:46:11,080
[Hyeyeon: So I glanced and saw two people.]

2093
01:46:11,080 --> 01:46:14,280
[Hyeyeon: Very familiar silhouettes,
it was Jinwoo and Seungho.]

2094
01:46:14,280 --> 01:46:16,950
[Hyeyeon: So I thought, ah, as expected...]

2095
01:46:16,950 --> 01:46:18,290
[Hyeyeon: The two have already paired up.]

2096
01:46:18,290 --> 01:46:20,690
[Hyeyeon: Just to show me
that I was already late,]

2097
01:46:20,690 --> 01:46:23,090
[Hyeyeon: they dragged me out this late.]

2098
01:46:23,090 --> 01:46:25,760
[Hyeyeon: Like during the 2 days 1 night, when I
didn't go for a walk and went back to the house,]

2099
01:46:25,760 --> 01:46:28,660
[Hyeyeon: I saw the two of them in couple outfits
and felt it was already too late.]

2100
01:46:28,660 --> 01:46:30,830
[Hyeyeon: I was late.]

2101
01:46:31,220 --> 01:46:33,620
[Seungho: Don't you have anything to say?]

2102
01:46:33,620 --> 01:46:36,060
[Jinwoo: Um... just...]

2103
01:46:37,100 --> 01:46:38,840
[Jinwoo: Oh?]

2104
01:46:39,140 --> 01:46:40,940
[Seungho: What should I do?
Jinwoo: I feel like we should talk later.]

2105
01:46:40,940 --> 01:46:42,580
[Jinwoo: Something to say?]

2106
01:46:42,580 --> 01:46:44,980
[Jinwoo: I said "I respect your choice."]

2107
01:46:44,980 --> 01:46:48,860
[Seungho: Other than that.
Jinwoo: What else can I say?]

2108
01:46:48,860 --> 01:46:51,460
[Hyeyeon: Why are you here?
Seungho: Things to say...]

2109
01:46:51,560 --> 01:46:53,700
[Jinwoo: Things to say?]

2110
01:46:53,700 --> 01:46:55,300
[Jinwoo: Hello.
Hyeyeon: Hello.]

2111
01:46:55,300 --> 01:46:57,430
[Jinwoo: Hyeyeon, come here.]
Seungho: Hello.]

2112
01:46:58,060 --> 01:46:59,590
-Hello.
-You fell down...

2113
01:47:00,140 --> 01:47:03,540
[Seungho: Is it really OK for me to do this?]
Jinwoo: I don't know.]

2114
01:47:03,580 --> 01:47:07,140
[Seungho: Now I have to make a decision
in front of both of them.]

2115
01:47:07,140 --> 01:47:09,000
[Seungho: How should I choose?]

2116
01:47:09,000 --> 01:47:12,740
[Seungho: In the end,
it might hurt one of them.]

2117
01:47:12,740 --> 01:47:15,410
[Seungho: So I thought a lot about it.]

2118
01:47:15,940 --> 01:47:18,880
[Jinwoo: I knew Hyeyeon would choose Seungho.]

2119
01:47:18,880 --> 01:47:21,820
[Jinwoo: But I really didn't expect it at all]

2120
01:47:21,820 --> 01:47:23,150
[Jinwoo: that the three of us would be
in the same place.]

2121
01:47:23,150 --> 01:47:25,290
[Jinwoo: Ah, it's a bit cruel.]

2122
01:47:25,290 --> 01:47:27,960
[Jinwoo: I didn't expect it to go this far.]

2123
01:47:27,960 --> 01:47:29,830
[Jinwoo: I need to be mentally prepared.]

2124
01:47:30,090 --> 01:47:31,690
[Jinwoo: Oh, do you two want to talk?]

2125
01:47:31,690 --> 01:47:33,560
[Seungho: No, I want to listen.]

2126
01:47:33,560 --> 01:47:36,500
[Seungho: Really nothing? Nothing at all?]

2127
01:47:36,500 --> 01:47:39,430
[Seungho: Really nothing you want to say to me?]

2128
01:47:43,170 --> 01:47:45,570
[Seungho: Yesterday, during the Rewind Date,
I said...]

2129
01:47:45,570 --> 01:47:47,180
[Seungho: I needed certainty.]

2130
01:47:47,180 --> 01:47:50,110
[Seungho: But you didn't give me that certainty.]

2131
01:47:50,110 --> 01:47:51,180
[Seungho: And ended the conversation.]

2132
01:47:51,180 --> 01:47:55,450
[Seungho: If Jinwoo had given me certainty
back then,]

2133
01:47:55,450 --> 01:47:59,190
[Seungho: and showed a clear commitment,]

2134
01:47:59,190 --> 01:48:03,730
[Seungho: I think I might have
changed my mind then.]

2135
01:48:04,260 --> 01:48:05,860
[Jinwoo: Something to say?]

2136
01:48:05,860 --> 01:48:08,260
[Jinwoo: Ah, you came while we were
talking about things he wanted to say.]

2137
01:48:08,260 --> 01:48:08,800
[Hyeyeon: Oh, really?]

2138
01:48:08,800 --> 01:48:11,730
[Seungho: But he only said
"I respect your choice."]

2139
01:48:11,730 --> 01:48:13,340
[Jinwoo: That respect...
Seungho: It's meaningless.]

2140
01:48:13,340 --> 01:48:14,940
[Jinwoo: Because that was my true feeling.]

2141
01:48:14,940 --> 01:48:16,270
[Seungho: It wasn't your true feeling.]

2142
01:48:16,270 --> 01:48:18,410
[Jinwoo: It was my true feeling.
What else did you think it was?]

2143
01:48:20,010 --> 01:48:22,940
[Hyeyeon: Don't fight.]

2144
01:48:22,940 --> 01:48:25,610
[Hyeyeon: I was wondering, why are these two...
instead of making the final choice,]

2145
01:48:25,610 --> 01:48:28,550
[Hyeyeon: flirting in front of me.]

2146
01:48:28,550 --> 01:48:32,020
[Hyeyeon: What are you doing?
It already looks so clear anyway.]

2147
01:48:32,020 --> 01:48:33,620
[Hyeyeon: Why did you ask me to stay here?]

2148
01:48:38,460 --> 01:48:41,100
[Seungho: Honestly, I don't know
my own heart either.]

2149
01:48:41,360 --> 01:48:43,770
[Hyeyeon: Huh? Even at this point?
Jinwoo: Even at this point?]

2150
01:48:43,770 --> 01:48:46,700
[Seungho: I don't know. Don't ask me.]

2151
01:48:47,940 --> 01:48:49,740
[Hyeyeon: OK.]

2152
01:48:51,100 --> 01:48:54,180
[Seungho, who hasn't made up his mind yet]

2153
01:48:54,580 --> 01:48:58,450
[Seungho: The person I liked first was Jinwoo,]

2154
01:48:58,450 --> 01:49:00,850
[Seungho: and then Hyeyeon.]

2155
01:49:00,850 --> 01:49:02,980
[Seungho: Both of them have different charms.]

2156
01:49:02,980 --> 01:49:05,390
[Seungho: In such a short time,]

2157
01:49:05,390 --> 01:49:07,790
[Seungho: I don't know]

2158
01:49:07,790 --> 01:49:09,930
[Seungho: how I should choose.]

2159
01:49:10,990 --> 01:49:13,130
[Hyeyeon: I thought Seungho had already decided,]

2160
01:49:13,130 --> 01:49:14,730
[Hyeyeon: but he hadn't, so...]

2161
01:49:14,730 --> 01:49:17,130
[Hyeyeon: I thought, oh, again...]

2162
01:49:17,130 --> 01:49:17,930
[Hyeyeon: It's revived again.]

2163
01:49:18,730 --> 01:49:20,870
[Seungho: Can I hear it?]

2164
01:49:20,870 --> 01:49:23,270
[Seungho: Each of you say one last thing
you want to say to me?]

2165
01:49:28,340 --> 01:49:31,810
[Jinwoo: It has been you for me
since the beginning.]

2166
01:49:31,810 --> 01:49:33,150
[Jinwoo: And it's still you now.]

2167
01:49:33,950 --> 01:49:38,220
[Jinwoo: That's why I came here now.]

2168
01:49:41,160 --> 01:49:43,020
[Hyeyeon: Me?]

2169
01:49:43,560 --> 01:49:45,430
[Hyeyeon: I hope you]

2170
01:49:45,430 --> 01:49:47,830
[Hyeyeon: can receive more love.]

2171
01:49:49,160 --> 01:49:53,440
[Hyeyeon: I hope you choose the person
who knows best how to love you.]

2172
01:49:53,440 --> 01:49:55,300
[Hyeyeon: And I think that's me.]

2173
01:49:55,300 --> 01:49:58,770
[Hyeyeon: I've shown you a lot of my feelings,]

2174
01:49:58,770 --> 01:50:02,240
[Hyeyeon: and I think you know it very well.]

2175
01:50:02,240 --> 01:50:05,710
[Hyeyeon: But I also respect your choice.]

2176
01:50:09,990 --> 01:50:11,590
[Jinwoo: Hyeyeon, in my eyes,]

2177
01:50:11,590 --> 01:50:14,520
