2178
01:50:14,520 --> 01:50:16,660
[Jinwoo: She's a very cute kid.]

2179
01:50:16,660 --> 01:50:19,860
[Jinwoo: But in front of Seungho,
she shows the side of a mature older sister.]

2180
01:50:19,860 --> 01:50:22,530
[Jinwoo: Her answers are also more]

2181
01:50:22,530 --> 01:50:27,070
[Jinwoo: sincere than mine.]

2182
01:50:27,070 --> 01:50:29,740
[Jinwoo: So I think Hyeyeon is more mature
than I imagined.]

2183
