2186
01:50:44,150 --> 01:50:46,820
[Seungho: how much are they at this point?]

2187
01:50:46,820 --> 01:50:48,420
[Seungho: Really, tell the truth.]

2188
01:50:49,220 --> 01:50:51,090
[Jinwoo: Tell the truth?]

2189
01:50:51,090 --> 01:50:53,230
[Jinwoo: Hmm...]

2190
