[Jinwoo: Honestly, I could say it's 100%.]

2192
01:51:08,440 --> 01:51:10,050
[Jinwoo: But the reason I said 90% is...]

2193
01:51:10,050 --> 01:51:13,250
[Jinwoo: 90% is that I like you,
