2194
01:51:13,250 --> 01:51:16,180
[Jinwoo: is the problems or conflicts we'll face]

2195
01:51:16,180 --> 01:51:21,790
[Jinwoo: in the future that even now]

2196
01:51:21,790 --> 01:51:23,390
[Jinwoo: haven't been resolved yet.]

2197
01:51:23,390 --> 01:51:26,600
[Jinwoo: That's why I deducted 10% and said 90%.]

2198
01:51:27,660 --> 01:51:28,730
[Hyeyeon: Me too? I have to listen to this too?]

2199
01:51:28,730 --> 01:51:30,870
[Seungho: Anyway, it's the same question.]

2200
01:51:30,870 --> 01:51:34,600
[Seungho: You know, the extent of your feelings
