[Seungho: We've only known each other for a week.]

2202
01:51:37,010 --> 01:51:39,410
[Seungho: Don't talk about feelings
or things like that.]

2203
01:51:39,410 --> 01:51:41,540
[Seungho: How big are your true feelings for me?]

2204
01:51:41,540 --> 01:51:43,680
[Seungho: Tell the truth.]

2205
01:51:46,880 --> 01:51:49,820
[Hyeyeon: I really...]

2206
