[Hyeyeon: I really fell in love with you.]

2207
01:51:51,420 --> 01:51:54,890
[Hyeyeon: So the extent of my feelings...]

2208
01:51:54,890 --> 01:51:58,360
[Hyeyeon: I don't want to express it
