2214
01:52:24,150 --> 01:52:29,590
[The two who honestly conveyed their feelings]

2215
01:52:32,790 --> 01:52:34,130
[Seungho: I've decided.]

2216
01:52:36,000 --> 01:52:37,600
[Jinwoo: Wait a minute.
Hyeyeon: Wait.]

2217
01:52:37,600 --> 01:52:39,730
[Jinwoo: Wait a moment before you say it. Wait.]

2218
01:52:39,730 --> 01:52:41,070
[Jinwoo: Ah, say it now.]

2219
01:52:50,720 --> 01:52:51,340
Hello.

2220
01:52:51,340 --> 01:52:51,930
Hello.

2221
01:52:52,010 --> 01:52:53,350
[Jinwoo: Hello.]

2222
01:52:53,350 --> 01:52:56,020
[Jinwoo: Nice to meet you.
Seungho: Nice to meet you.]

2223
01:52:59,490 --> 01:53:04,290
[Seungho: The person with a
strong first impression]

2224
01:53:04,290 --> 01:53:06,960
