Seungho: OK.]

2234
01:53:36,320 --> 01:53:39,790
[Hyeyeon: Did your heart flutter for me too?]

2235
01:53:39,790 --> 01:53:42,200
[Seungho: Yeah, it did.
Hyeyeon: Ah, really?]

2236
01:53:41,380 --> 01:53:42,090
Yeah.

2237
01:53:42,460 --> 01:53:45,930
[Hyeyeon, who gradually won his heart
