[Seungho: I feel like I shouldn't look back.]

2267
01:55:11,620 --> 01:55:14,560
[Seungho: I don't regret this choice.]

2268
01:55:14,560 --> 01:55:19,090
[Seungho: Firstly, I'm really happy
