2295
01:57:44,040 --> 01:57:46,710
[Yongkyu, who chose BACK after agonizing]

2296
01:57:47,240 --> 01:57:50,180
[Yongkyu: Chaebe chose me.]

2297
01:57:50,180 --> 01:57:53,110
[Yongkyu: But I think I need to meet the person]

2298
01:57:53,110 --> 01:57:55,520
[Yongkyu: I'm more interested in.]

2299
01:57:55,520 --> 01:57:58,450
[Yongkyu: That's what I thought.]

2300
