[Yongkyu: I'm sorry, but]

2301
01:58:06,990 --> 01:58:10,730
[Yongkyu: I did my best for Hyeyeon,]

2302
01:58:11,000 --> 01:58:13,670
[Yongkyu: and expressed my feelings,]

2303
01:58:13,670 --> 01:58:17,140
[Yongkyu: I think I've done all of that.]

2304
01:58:17,670 --> 01:58:20,880
[Yongkyu: I have no regrets in that regard.]

2305
01:58:23,280 --> 01:58:26,210
[Yongkyu gives up his final choice]

2306
01:58:32,350 --> 01:58:35,020
[Chaebe left alone
