2311
01:58:55,580 --> 01:58:57,180
[Chaebe: I did my best.]

2312
01:58:57,710 --> 01:58:59,580
[Chaebe: Well done, Lim Chaebe.]

2313
01:59:05,450 --> 01:59:10,530
[Even though it's a pity,
Chaebe did his best for his feelings]

2314
01:59:15,060 --> 01:59:19,070
[The waves of feelings swaying until the very end]

2315
01:59:22,800 --> 01:59:25,470
