[Sujin: How have you been?]

2326
02:00:02,040 --> 02:00:03,640
[Sujin: Should I sit here?]

2327
02:00:03,640 --> 02:00:06,310
[Sujin: Should I sit here?
Heejin: Have a seat.]

2328
02:00:05,260 --> 02:00:06,090
