2357
02:01:40,010 --> 02:01:44,280
[Sujin: I'm sincere. Really, really...]

2358
02:01:44,550 --> 02:01:50,150
[Heejin: I learned a lot through you too.]

2359
02:01:50,150 --> 02:01:57,890
[Heejin: There's a side of you I want to become.
Sujin: Being confident.]

2360
02:01:57,890 --> 02:02:02,430
[Heejin: I hope you can continue to show]

2361
02:02:02,430 --> 02:02:04,030
