someone is slowly approaching the two]

2363
02:02:17,420 --> 02:02:19,100
[Oh my!]

2364
02:02:19,100 --> 02:02:20,660
[Hello. Oh my!]

2365
02:02:20,660 --> 02:02:24,050
[Sujin: Oh my! This...]

2366
02:02:20,880 --> 02:02:21,860
Oh my!

2367
02:02:22,430 --> 02:02:23,590
-This...
-Hello.

2368
02:02:24,050 --> 02:02:26,990
[Sujin: Ah, it's this kind of situation.]

2369
02:02:27,270 --> 02:02:28,440
-This...
-Hello.

2370
02:02:28,890 --> 02:02:30,490
It's this kind of situation.

2371
02:02:32,330 --> 02:02:36,330
[Heejin: I didn't expect Eunchae to come here.]

2372
02:02:36,330 --> 02:02:41,400
[Heejin: The moment I saw Eunchae,
