2381
02:03:10,770 --> 02:03:12,900
[Eunchae: So I came to confess.]

2382
02:03:13,430 --> 02:03:15,300
[Eunchae: So I came to confess.]

2383
02:03:18,770 --> 02:03:24,110
[Eunchae: I think love has a total capacity.]

2384
