2388
02:03:45,200 --> 02:03:49,740
[Eunchae: It's the simplest yet most complex.]

2389
02:03:49,740 --> 02:03:54,540
[Eunchae: An emotion that's hard to control.]

2390
02:03:55,080 --> 02:04:00,410
[Eunchae: But these moments that keep appearing
