2391
02:04:00,410 --> 02:04:06,550
[Eunchae: I think they can be summed up as love.]

2392
02:04:06,550 --> 02:04:14,830
[Eunchae: To the person I love...
the person I like...]

2393
02:04:14,830 --> 02:04:16,960
[Eunchae: Do you want to hear what I have to say?]

2394
02:04:17,580 --> 02:04:20,100
[Yes, tell me.]

2395
02:04:20,100 --> 02:04:24,440
[Eunchae: Since there's no forever,
