2396
02:04:24,970 --> 02:04:28,710
[Eunchae: Do you want to be consistent with me?]

2397
02:04:28,840 --> 02:04:32,310
["Do you want to be consistent with me?"]

2398
02:04:38,180 --> 02:04:42,140
