2401
02:04:51,930 --> 02:04:54,340
[Eunchae: It's my great honor.]

2402
02:04:54,340 --> 02:05:01,280
[Heejin: You are the person who made me break]

2403
02:05:01,280 --> 02:05:04,210
[Heejin: my previous prejudices
against younger people.]

2404
02:05:06,350 --> 02:05:14,620
[Heejin: At first, I felt so many sad emotions
that it was painful.]

2405
02:05:14,620 --> 02:05:19,160
[Heejin: But at that time,
you slowly approached me.]

2406
02:05:19,160 --> 02:05:27,970
[Heejin: And created a breakthrough
for a new beginning for me. Thank you.]

2407
02:05:28,770 --> 02:05:30,100
[Eunchae: I thank you too.]

2408
02:05:30,100 --> 02:05:33,040
[Heejin: You gave me a lot of strength.]

2409
02:05:37,850 --> 02:05:42,580
[Now, please choose the person
your heart desires]

2410
02:05:43,450 --> 02:05:47,720
[Heejin stands at
the crossroads of the final choice]

2411
02:05:49,590 --> 02:05:52,530
[Sujin: Personally, I want to date Heejin.]

2412
02:05:52,790 --> 02:05:56,000
[From the first day
she only looked at Heejin]

2413
02:05:52,850 --> 02:05:55,840
It's definitely Heejin for me.

2414
02:05:55,840 --> 02:06:01,080
I just want to date Heejin.

2415
02:05:58,230 --> 02:06:01,070
[Only thinking of Heejin]

2416
02:06:01,340 --> 02:06:05,820
[Sujin, who is single-minded]

2417
02:06:05,820 --> 02:06:07,480
[Eunchae: Why? Choose me?]

2418
02:06:07,820 --> 02:06:10,410
[The younger one who charges forward boldly]

2419
