Why choose you?

2420
02:06:10,780 --> 02:06:13,460
[Making Heejin's heart flutter]

2421
02:06:16,600 --> 02:06:19,800
[Eunchae: Sunshine after rain...]

2422
02:06:20,340 --> 02:06:23,010
[Occasional moments that feel mature
like an older person make her heart flutter]

2423
02:06:21,620 --> 02:06:22,620
See you tomorrow.

2424
02:06:23,270 --> 02:06:27,810
[Eunchae, who approaches sincerely]

2425
02:06:28,980 --> 02:06:32,150
[What is Heejin's choice?]

2426
02:06:33,950 --> 02:06:35,550
[Heejin: Shall we go?]

2427
02:06:37,890 --> 02:06:39,690
[Shall we go?]

2428
02:06:40,110 --> 02:06:41,400
Let's go.

2429
02:06:54,240 --> 02:06:58,780
[Heejin: How did you think of
preparing such words?]

2430
02:06:58,690 --> 02:06:59,650
-You really are... -Do you like it?

2431
02:06:58,780 --> 02:07:00,380
[Eunchae: Do you like it?
Heejin: Yes.]

2432
02:07:00,380 --> 02:07:02,250
[Eunchae: Are you satisfied?
Heejin: Yes.]

2433
02:07:12,120 --> 02:07:17,190
[Sujin: Actually, the way Heejin
looked at me then]

2434
02:07:17,190 --> 02:07:19,860
[Sujin: was a look of guilt.]

2435
02:07:19,860 --> 02:07:23,600
[Sujin: Actually, I expected it
as soon as I sat down.]

2436
02:07:26,800 --> 02:07:32,140
[Sujin: Although I felt bitter inside, actually]

2437
02:07:32,140 --> 02:07:34,810
[Sujin: I think it's because
I could have said it first...]

2438
02:07:34,810 --> 02:07:39,080
[Sujin: But I took a step back instead.]

2439
02:07:40,420 --> 02:07:42,820
[Sujin: I think timing is key in love.]

2440
02:07:42,820 --> 02:07:45,220
[Sujin: So it can't be helped.]

2441
02:07:45,760 --> 02:07:49,230
[Heejin: You look so good today.
Eunchae: Really?]

2442
02:07:49,230 --> 02:07:52,430
[Eunchae: Not usually?
Heejin: You look good usually too.]

2443
02:07:52,430 --> 02:07:55,100
[Heejin: But today is double.
Eunchae: Ah, double?]

2444
02:07:58,300 --> 02:08:01,240
[Heejin: I never dreamed I'd become
the final couple.]

2445
02:08:01,240 --> 02:08:06,040
[Heejin: And what's even more surprising is
that I became a couple with Eunchae.]

2446
02:08:06,440 --> 02:08:10,310
["So amazing!"]

2447
02:08:10,310 --> 02:08:16,450
[Heejin: Eunchae, thank you for coming to me
despite how tough it was.]

2448
02:08:16,450 --> 02:08:20,190
[Heejin: Because of you, my life in BI-LIVE]

2449
02:08:20,190 --> 02:08:22,860
[Heejin: could end smoothly like this.]

2450
02:08:22,860 --> 02:08:29,270
[Heejin: Let's go eat the hot pot
and malatang you like.]

2451
02:08:29,800 --> 02:08:34,340
[Eunchae: I'm so happy we became
the final couple.]

2452
02:08:34,340 --> 02:08:38,610
[Eunchae: I remember how I was at the beginning.]

2453
02:08:38,610 --> 02:08:40,740
[Eunchae: I realized that you can succeed
as long as your heart flutters.]

2454
02:08:40,740 --> 02:08:43,150
[Eunchae: I'm thankful she accepted my feelings]

2455
02:08:43,150 --> 02:08:44,480
[Eunchae: and also thankful she chose me.]

2456
02:08:44,480 --> 02:08:46,620
[Eunchae: Finally holding hands...]

2457
02:08:46,620 --> 02:08:50,890
[Eunchae: I hope there's no big burden.]

2458
02:08:50,890 --> 02:08:57,290
[Eunchae: Let's just take it slow in the future
like we do now.]

2459
02:08:57,290 --> 02:08:59,160
[Eunchae: That's what I want to say to her.]

2460
02:09:00,230 --> 02:09:03,430
[Heejin and Eunchae, final couple]

2461
