[And...]

2462
02:09:09,040 --> 02:09:11,180
[Yongkyu: A memorable scene?]

2463
02:09:11,180 --> 02:09:14,650
[Jinwoo: Feeling the complete sincerity...]

2464
02:09:14,650 --> 02:09:18,120
[Jinwoo: Completely my first day?]

2465
02:09:18,920 --> 02:09:22,650
[Jinwoo: When I met Seungho,
I think that day is the most memorable.]

2466
02:09:22,650 --> 02:09:24,790
[Sujin: When we drank]

2467
02:09:24,790 --> 02:09:28,790
[Sujin: and chatted together, I think
I'll miss that time the most.]

2468
02:09:28,790 --> 02:09:31,730
[Yongkyu: Everyone being loud
and playful together,]

2469
02:09:31,730 --> 02:09:35,730
[Yongkyu: eating and playing games...]

2470
02:09:35,730 --> 02:09:38,400
[Yongkyu: I think those are the most memorable.]

2471
02:09:38,400 --> 02:09:40,540
[Heejin: The most memorable thing was...]

2472
02:09:40,540 --> 02:09:45,340
[Heejin: the taco date where I ate with Eunchae
while looking at the sea.]

2473
02:09:45,340 --> 02:09:48,010
[Chaebe: When I first came here,
I really felt time passed so slowly.]

2474
02:09:48,010 --> 02:09:51,480
[Chaebe: But now, I've gotten familiar
and attached.]

2475
02:09:51,480 --> 02:09:53,880
[Chaebe: So it feels like time flew by too fast.]

2476
02:09:53,880 --> 02:09:57,890
[Sujin: My first gain was meeting good people.]

2477
02:09:57,890 --> 02:10:01,090
[Sujin: Although I said I'd move forward bravely,]

2478
02:10:01,090 --> 02:10:04,030
[Sujin: it was my first time doing so.]

2479
02:10:04,030 --> 02:10:05,900
[Sujin: I think these experiences]

2480
02:10:05,900 --> 02:10:08,570
[Sujin: will help me grow further in the future.]

2481
02:10:08,570 --> 02:10:15,770
[Eunchae: Meeting so many bisexual friends
