2482
02:10:15,770 --> 02:10:19,240
[Eunchae: and chatting with everyone like this
for the first time,]

2483
02:10:19,240 --> 02:10:22,980
[Eunchae: I felt a great sense of belonging.]

2484
02:10:22,980 --> 02:10:25,380
[Yongkyu: It was a very enjoyable time,]

2485
02:10:25,380 --> 02:10:28,050
[Yongkyu: and a time I will remember again.]

2486
02:10:28,050 --> 02:10:32,060
[Seungho: What my feelings are,
what I'm thinking about...]

2487
02:10:32,060 --> 02:10:36,060
[Seungho: I also learned something
about how mature I am in love.]

2488
02:10:36,060 --> 02:10:38,460
[Hyeyeon: Being with a group of people]

2489
02:10:38,460 --> 02:10:40,600
[Hyeyeon: where I don't have to
hide my orientation]

2490
02:10:40,600 --> 02:10:43,000
[Hyeyeon: allowed me to show my true self.]

2491
02:10:43,000 --> 02:10:46,200
[Hyeyeon: It also made me realize]

2492
02:10:46,200 --> 02:10:47,810
[Hyeyeon: that the real me can be loved.]

2493
02:10:47,810 --> 02:10:52,340
[Chaebe: Yongkyu, even after leaving here,
